1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Note: "Another source calls her Helena, daughter of John Montgomery, but she seems to have been his granddaughter. She was Sir James' first daughter by his second wife Christian, but he had 3 previous daughters. La
2 CONC g Charter - app #23 Confirms wedding date and place and Helen's paternity." (William Greer, Wheaton, Illinois, 1995.) 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Birth:  1530 Dumfries Dumfries and Galloway, Scotland  Death:  1578 Dumfries Dumfries and Galloway, Scotland 
2 CONT
2 CONT Helen Douglas. Born: 1530 in Dumfries, Dumfries-shire, Scotland. Died: 1578 at Dumfriesshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Sir James Douglas. Mother: Christian Montgomerie.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Roger Grierson, 8th Lord of Lag. Married: 21 Apr 1566 at Dumfriesshire, Scotland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Roger Grierson (1529 - 1593)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   William Grierson (1550 - 1629)*
2 CONT
