1 NOTE {geni:about_me}     Information from the 1962 Yearbook of the American Clan Gregor Society, Inc, (page 24, # 1364, Robert Alan Temple), Washington, D.C. and other notes and charts from Lois Temple, Dublin, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Information from "Douglas Baronetage of Scotland, Pub 1790", "Burke's Peerage, British Authority", and "O'Hart's Irish Pedigrees, Irish and British."
2 CONT
2 CONT     Roger Grierson was the 8th Lord of Lag. He succeeded his half brother, William, who had died without heir (Per precept of clare constat of 5 June 1566 [Lag Charter].) He also had sasine of Rock Hall and left 3 daughters by Hel
2 CONC en.
2 CONT
