1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Sir Alexander Stewart of Garlies''' ( d. 5 October 1596) was the son of Sir Alexander Stewart of Garlies and Catherine Herries. He married, firstly, Christian Douglas, daughter of Sir James Douglas of Drumlanrig
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, secondly, Lady Elizabeth Douglas, daughter of David Douglas, 7th Earl of Angus and Margaret Hamilton, after 1572.
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived at Garlies, Scotland. He was invested as a Knight in 1590.
