1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Lady Nicola Stewart was born in 1574, in Wigtown, Wigtownshire, Scotland, her father, Lord Alexander Stewart 6th Laird of Garlies, was 23 and her mother, Lady Christiana Elizabeth Douglas, was 20. She married 
