2 CONT '''1 June 15[- -]: Tack by Helen Montgomery, daughter of late Neil Montgomery of Lainshaw, to Hugh, earl of Eglinton, of 1/2 merkland called Hawernis [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD
2 CONC 3%2f3%2f1%2f4&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=neil+montgomery&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1550&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Montgomerie Family, Earls of Eglinton, reference GD3/3/1/4]'''
