1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Janet Schaw (James Schaw2, James Schaw1) was born in Sauchie, Clackmannshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Archibald Edmonstone, son of William Edmonstone and Matilda Stewart. He was born ABT 1453 in Strathblane, Stirlingshire, Scotland, and died ABT 1502 in Strathblane, Stirlingshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Janet Schaw and Archibald Edmonstone is:
2 CONT * 2	  i.	William Edmonstone was born ABT 1470 in Strathblane, Stirlingshire, Scotland, and died 9 SEP 1513 in Braxton, Northumberland, England. He married Sybille Baillie, daughter of Richard Baillie. She was born ABT 1481 in Lami
2 CONC ngton, Lanarkshire, Scotland, and died ABT 1510. He married Elizabeth Leslie, daughter of George Leslie and Christian Haliburton. She was born ABT 1457 in Rothes, Banffshire, Scotland, and died BEF AUG 1511
2 CONT * https://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=mlysell&id=I13061
2 CONT <nowiki>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</nowiki>
2 CONT ====BOOK
2 CONT * '''MacGregor, Gordon. 2022.''' ''Scotland, Red Books of Scotland, 1600-1939'', 4th Edition. Vol. 8 [https://www.ancestry.com/imageviewer/collections/62525/images/redbookofscotlandvolume8osw-smapdf2-00767?pId=54593 Ancestry.com],
2 CONC  pp. 750, 752.
2 CONT ** Sir James Schaw, 2nd of Sauchie…He m. Christina, daughter of Sir David Bruce of Clackmannan, and d. in 1491. [The lands of Sauchie had been in non-entry for a period of one year at the entry of his grandson and heir in 1492.] H
2 CONC e was father of,…
2 CONT *** “5. Janet Schaw, ''m.'' Sir Archibald Edmonstone, 3d of Duntreath, (he survived her and m. secondly, before 27 April 1498, to Janet Melville [''Acta Dom Conc''. Vol ii. PP. 176-77.]), whom with, on his resignation, she had a c
2 CONC harter under the Great Seal for the lands of Cambuswallace on 14 February 1491 [C2/12/261.], and had issue.”
2 CONT <nowiki>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</nowiki>
2 CONT
2 CONT ====JANET SCHAW
2 CONT '''Janet Schaw is the daughter of Sir James Schaw of Sauchie. [https://archive.org/details/genealogicalacco00inedmo/page/34/mode/1up Duntreath: 34]'''
2 CONT
