2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT From [https://archive.org/stream/historicalaccoun1849cowa/historicalaccoun1849cowa_djvu.txt "Historical account of the noble family of Kennedy, Marquess of Ailsa and Earl of Cassilis ... (Anon.)"]
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Kennedy of Bargany is mentioned. He married Agnes, daughter of Hugh, second Earl of  Eglinton, and had issue two sons ; 
2 CONT *Gilbert, his eldest son, who married Janet, daughter of Andrew,  Lord Ochiltree. He was killed at the skirmish of Brockloch, near Lady Corse, at Maybole, by Lord  Cassillis 1 friends, on 11th December 1601.* He  was succeeded by 
2 CONC his son Thomas. 
2 CONT *Sir Thomas Kennedy's second son was Thomas Kennedy of  Drummurchie, who slew Sir Thomas Kennedy of  Culzean near Ayr on the 12th May 1602, in revenge for the death of his brother Gilbert. He fled to Ireland, where he lived with t
2 CONC he Viscount of  Ardes. In 1620 the estate of Bargany was sold by Thomas Kennedy, son of Gilbert Kennedy of  Bargany, to Sir Thomas Hamilton of Lesterwick,  with whose descendants in the female line it still  remains. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT * [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft#page/440/mode/2up The Scots peerage], Vol. III, page 438-440
2 CONT * https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Kennedy_of_Bargany Thomas Kennedy of Bargany (died 1597) was a Scottish courtier and landowner. … He was the son of Thomas Kennedy of Bargany and Margaret Campbell, a daughter of Hew Campbell
2 CONC  of Loudon, Sheriff of Ayr. Thomas Kennedy married Isobel Stewart, a daughter of Andrew Stewart, 2nd Lord Ochiltree and Agnes Cunningham. He married secondly Agnes Montgomerie daughter of Hugh Montgomerie, 2nd Earl of Eglinton.  T
2 CONC heir children included: Gilbert Kennedy of Bargany and Ardstinchar, who married his cousin Jean Stewart, a daughter of Andrew, Master of Ochiltree and Margaret Stewart, Mistress of Ochiltree. Jean Stewart was a maiden in the house
2 CONC hold of Anne of Denmark.
2 CONT * https://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I18111&tree=CC
