2 CONT '''George Douglas, Master of Angus'''1  
2 CONT M, #109562, '''b. circa 1469, d. 9 September 1513'''
2 CONT Last Edited=12 Apr 2011
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.04%
2 CONT '''     George Douglas, Master of Angus was born circa 1469.1 He was the son of''' Archibald Douglas, 5th Earl of Angus and Elizabeth Boyd.1 '''He married Elizabeth Drummond''', daughter of John Drummond, 1st Lord Drummond and Lad
2 CONC y Elizabeth Lindsay, '''between July 1485 and 31 January 1489.1 He died on 9 September 1513 at Flodden Field, Northumberland, EnglandG, killed in action.'''1
2 CONT '''     He was styled as Master of Angus between 1470 and 1513.1 He fought in the Battle of Flodden on 9 September 1513.'''1
2 CONT '''Children of George Douglas, Master of Angus and Elizabeth Drummond'''
