2 CONT Charts	
2 CONT 14 Generation Pedigree of George III, King of Great Britain & Ireland
2 CONT 14 Generation Pedigree of Friedrich Wilhelm III, King of Prussia
2 CONT '''     Elizabeth Drummond married Sir David Fleming''', son of Malcolm Fleming, Master of Fleming and Eupheme Livingston, '''circa 1481.4 Elizabeth Drummond married George Douglas, Master of Angus''', son of Archibald 'Bell the C
2 CONC at' Douglas, 5th Earl Angus and Elizabeth Boyd, '''before March 1488.2,3 Elizabeth Drummond and George Douglas, Master of Angus obtained a marriage license on 3 December 1495; Date of Papal Dispensation.5 Elizabeth Drummond died a
2 CONC fter 21 August 1514.'''
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT '''George Douglas, Master of Angus''' b. c 1469, d. 9 Sep 1513
