2 CONC d Elizabeth Plantagenet, on 6 August 1514 at Chapel of Kinnoull, Kinnoull, Scotland; They had 1 daughter, Margaret.3 Archibald Douglas, 6th Earl of Angus and Margaret Tudor were divorced on 11 March 1527.3 Archibald Douglas, 6th E
2 CONC arl of Angus married Margaret Maxwell, daughter of Robert Maxwell, 4th Lord Maxwell and Janet Douglas, on 9 April 1543. Archibald Douglas, 6th Earl of Angus died before 22 January 1557 at Tantallon.
