2 CONT *******						  m. Mariota Acarsane or Accarson (d before 07.08.1538, dau of John Acarsane of Glen)
2 CONT ********							(i) .... etc. 
2 CONT *******						(C) William Gordon of Craichlaw (d 1545) 
2 CONT *******						  m. Janet Baillie 
2 CONT *******						(D) John Gordon of Hardlands
2 CONT *******						(E) David Gordon 
2 CONT *******						(F) Elizabeth Gordon
2 CONT *******						  m. Sir William Douglas, 6th of Drumlanrig (d after Flodden 10.09.1513)
2 CONT *******						(G) Janet Gordon 
2 CONT *******						  m1. (mcrt 20.05.1486) Alexander Stewart of Garlies
2 CONT *******						  m2. (1503) Sir William Keith of Inverugie (d 1521)
2 CONT *******						(H) Margaret Gordon (a 1492)
2 CONT *******						  m. (before 12.07.1492) Bertilmo Glendonwyn, younger of that ilk (dvp)
2 CONT *******						(I) Isabel Gordon possibly of this generation, of this marriage
2 CONT *******						  m. Gilbert McDowall of Freugh (d Flodden 09.09.1513) 
2 CONT ******					  partner unknown 
2 CONT *******						(J) William Gordon of Crathlet
2 CONT ******					(2) Alexander Gordon of Auchireoch, etc ancestor of Gordons of Airds of Kells
2 CONT *******						(A) .... etc.
2 CONT ******					(3) George Gordon had issue
2 CONT ******					  m. Janet (da of John Maclellan or Dougalson of Troquhain)
2 CONT ******					(4) Roger Gordon ancestor of Gordons of Crogo
2 CONT ******					  m. Geylles Macnaught (dau of Andrew Macnaught of Crogo)
2 CONT ******					(5) Margaret Gordon
2 CONT ******					  m. (mcrt 13.07.1476) Thomas Maclellan of Bomby
2 CONT ****			ii. .... etc.
