2 CONT *Father      William de Gordon d. c 1455
2 CONT *'''     Sir John Gordon was born circa 1448 at of Lochinvar & Stichell, Roxburghshire, Scotland.2 He married Annabella Boyd, daughter of Robert Boyd, 1st Lord Boyd, Great Chamberlain of Scotland and Mariota (Janet) Maxwell, circa
2 CONC  1470.3 Sir John Gordon married Elizabeth Lindsay before 19 May 1489. Sir John Gordon died after 11 May 1517.3
