2 CONT *'''Sir John Gordon of Lochinvar1
2 CONT *'''M, #20333, d. after 11 May 1517
2 CONT *Last Edited=23 Jan 2012
2 CONT *'''     Sir John Gordon of Lochinvar was the son of William de Gordon, 1st of Lochinvar.2 He married, firstly, Annabella Boyd, daughter of Robert Boyd, 1st Lord Boyd of Kilmarnock and Mariot Maxwell.3 He married, secondly, Elizab
2 CONC eth Lindsay before 19 May 1489.4 He died after 11 May 1517.5
2 CONT *'''     He lived at Lochinvar, Scotland.1
2 CONT *'''Child of Sir John Gordon of Lochinvar and Annabella Boyd
2 CONT ** 1.Isobell Gordon+6
