1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://thepeerage.com/p2595.htm#i25946
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Maxwell, 5th / 6th Lord Maxwell was born circa 1510.1 He was the son of Robert Maxwell, 4th / 5th Lord Maxwell and Janet Douglas.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Lady Beatrix Douglas, daughter of James Douglas, 3rd Earl of Morton and Catherine Stewart, after 25 July 1530.1 He died on 14 September 1552.2
2 CONT
2 CONT He held the office of Warden of the Western Marches in 1542.2 He succeeded as the 5th Lord Maxwell [S., 1445] on 9 July 1546.2 He was appointed Privy Counsellor (P.C.) [Scotland] in 1551.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Robert Maxwell, 5th Lord Maxwell and Lady Beatrix Douglas
2 CONT
2 CONT *Robert Maxwell, 6th Lord Maxwell3 b. bt 1549 - 1551, d. fr 21 Dec 1553 - 26 Jan 1554/55
2 CONT *John Maxwell, 7th Lord Maxwell+4 b. 24 Apr 1553, d. 6 Dec 1593
2 CONT
