1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Egidia Kennedy
2 CONT *Born: 1492 in Ayrshire, Scotland 
2 CONT *Burial: Old Dunscore Cemetery  Dunscore Dumfries and Galloway, Scotland
2 CONT *Father: Patrick Kennedy, of Bargalton and Camciscan 
2 CONT *Spouse: Sir John Grierson, 6th Lord of Lag. His Spouse #2.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT * (4.) Roger Grierson, 8th Lord of Lag.
2 CONT * (5.) Agnes Grierson.
2 CONT * (6.) Elizabeth Grierson.
2 CONT * (7.) John Grierson.
2 CONT * (8.) Robert Grierson.
2 CONT * (9.) Sir Thomas Grierson
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References  
2 CONT *https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/60601710/egidia-grierson 
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-40001-621950596/egidia-giles-grierson-born-kennedy-in-familysearch-family-tree FamilySearch Family Tree] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Feb 5
2 CONC  2018, 22:27:09 UTC''
2 CONT *“History of the County of Ayr: With a Genealogical Account of the ...,” Volume 1 By James Paterson.  “Balmaclanachan, or Barclanachan.”  Page 385. [https://books.google.com/books?id=BvEHAAAAQAAJ&lpg=PA385&ots=5uukk0p5Xo&dq=Balmac
2 CONC lanachan&pg=PA385#v=onepage&q&f=true GoogleBooks] “III. George Kennedy of Balmaclanachan was on the assize at the trial of George Crawfurd of Lefnoreis, in 1554, for intercommuning with the Laird of Ballagane. He was arraigned, al
2 CONC ong with a number of others, in 1563, for attempting to restore Popery at Kirkoswald, &c.t He married Janet, daughter of Patrick Kennedy of Bargalton and Camciscan. He and his wife were infeft in the lands of Balmaclanachan. Camci
2 CONC scan afterwards fell into the hands of Balmaclanachan, and were sold to Robert Wallace, son of Hugh Wallace of Cairnhill, by Lady Balmaclanachan, with consent of her husband, and her sister, Egldia, widow of John Grierson of Lag. 
2 CONC The resignation is dated at Edinburgh, the 5th of May, 1562, and at Drumlanrig the 4th of April, 1563...”
2 CONT *https://detourthroughhistory.blogspot.com/2011/09/egidia-kennedy-grierson.html?m=1
