3 CONT The old Dunscore cemetery escaped the WWII removal of cast iron railings. It has the grave of Robert Riddel, friend of Robert Burns, and builder of the Friars Carse Hermitage.
3 CONT
3 CONT A memorial exists here to Sir Robert Grierson the 'Cruel Lag' persecutor of Covenanters.The inscription on the gravestone states that it the inset coat of arms was moved to this site from old Lag Tower.
3 CONT
