1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Information from "Irish Pedigrees; or the Origin and stem of the Irish Nation", by John O'Hart, Vol. II, pp. 234-236.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John Grierson was the 6th Lord of Lag. He served his uncle Cuthbert and got sasine of Lag on 9 November 1514. He also had sasine of Rock Hall on 7 November 1514.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Birth:  1490 Dumfries Dumfries and Galloway, Scotland  Death:  Jul., 1559 Dumfries Dumfries and Galloway, Scotland 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John Grierson, 6th Lord of Lag. Born: 1490 in Dumfriesshire, Scotland. Died: Jul 1559 at Dumfriesshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Roger Grierson. Mother: Agnes Douglas
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse #1: Nicolas Herries. Married: 12 Mar 1529 Children: (1.) William Grierson, 7th Lord of Lag. (2.) Nicolas Grierson. (3.) Janet Grierson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse #2: Egidia Kennedy. Married: 20 Aug 1548 Children: (4.) Roger Grierson, 8th Lord of Lag. (5.) Agnes Grierson. (6.) Elizabeth Grierson. (7.) John Grierson. (8.) Robert Grierson. (9.) Sir Thomas Grierson. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
