2 CONT   Roger Grierson (1474 - 1513)
2 CONT   Agnes Douglas Grierson (1467 - 1519)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Spouses:
2 CONT   Egidia Kennedy Grierson (1492 - 1550)*
2 CONT   Nicolas Herries Grierson (1515 - 1548)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   William Grierson (1529 - 1562)*
2 CONT   Roger Grierson (1529 - 1593)*
2 CONT
