3 NOTE Clan GRIERSON
4 CONT ARMS Gules, on a fess Or between three fetterlocks Argent a mullet Azure
4 CONT CREST A fetterlock Argent
4 CONT MOTTO Hoc securior (More secure by this)
4 CONT SUPPORTERS (on a compartment embellished with bluebell flowers) Two cats rampant
4 CONT guardant Sable each charged on the shoulder of a fetterlock Argent
4 CONT STANDARD Azure, a St Andrews’s Cross Argent in the hoist and of two tracts Or and
4 CONT Gules, upon which is depicted three times the Crest upon a chapeau Azure
4 CONT furred Ermine, along with the Motto ‘Hoc securior’ in letters Argent upon
4 CONT two transverse bands Azure
4 CONT PINSEL Gules, displaying the Crest within a strap and buckle Proper with the Motto
4 CONT ‘Hoc securior’ in letters Or and within a circlet Or ensigned of a chapeau
4 CONT Azure furred Ermine the title ‘Grierson of Lag’ in letters Gules, and the fly
4 CONT an Escrol Or with the Slogan ‘Lag’ in letters Azure along with a stem of
4 CONT  bluebells Proper
4 CONT PLANT BADGE A stem of bluebells Proper
