2 CONT Research Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT THE Family Category is Greer, Grier, Grierson, MacGregor
2 CONT
2 CONT     From rootsweb.com the research/hard work of Ralph Terry/his wife. Thank you for sharing with the family. *ID: I752 
2 CONT
2 CONT There is some small doubt about the link between the Greers of Ireland and the Grierson's of Scotland. Burke's Irish Family Records (shown as a source below) starts on the Greers by saying 'This family traditionally claims descent
2 CONC  from the Griersons of Lag...' and continues that 'a proven descent begins with James Greer [Grierson] who married Mary.' This James Greer/Grierson is, however, evidently the same person as the James Grierson described by Burke an
2 CONC d others in the genealogies of the Griersons of Lag. We have therefore chosen to show them as one and the same. Links
2 CONT
2 CONT     https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clan_Grierson
