2 CONT Margaret Ker [1]
2 CONT *F, #28104
2 CONT *Last Edited=15 Nov 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Ker was the daughter of Sir Walter Ker of Cessford.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Alexander Home, 5th Lord Home, son of George Home, 4th Lord Home and Mariot Halyburton, before 4 February 1557/58.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Patrick Gray, 4th Lord Gray, son of Gilbert Gray and Egidia Mercer, before 4 February 1557/58.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT From before 4 February 1557/58, her married name became Home.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT From before 4 February 1557/58, her married name became Gray.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Margaret Ker and Alexander Home, 5th Lord Home
2 CONT *1.Margaret Home+1 b. b 5 Dec 1565, d. May 1598
