2 CONT *created    15 Mar 1618/9 Lord Scott of Whitchester and Eskdale, and Earl of Buccleuch, with remainder to his heirs male (which remainder was apparently altered by a subsequent patent or charter to heirs general)
2 CONT *The Lordship of Scott of Buccleuch has been held by the Earls of Buccleuch (Dukes of Buccleuch from 20 Apr 1663) since 15 Mar 1619.
