1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the wife of https://www.geni.com/people/Maj-James-Ross-of-Balneil/6000000005066631879
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT === Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Scott was the daughter of Sir Walter Scott, 1st Lord Scott of Buccleuch and Mary Ker.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, firstly, James Ross, 6th Lord Ross of Halkhead, son of Robert Ross, 5th Lord Ross of Halkhead and Jean Hamilton, in 1615. Her married name became Ross from between November 1642 and March 1644.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, Alexander Montgomerie, 6th Earl of Eglinton, son of Robert Seton, 1st Earl of Winton and Lady Margaret Montgomerie, between November 1642 and March 1644. Her married name became Montgomerie. As a result of h
2 CONC er marriage, Margaret Scott was styled as Countess of Eglinton.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 5 October 1652.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Margaret Scott and James Ross, 6th Lord Ross of Halkhead
2 CONT # ROSS, Margaret.  Margaret married Sir George STIRLING of Keir in December 1630.
2 CONT # ROSS, James 7th Lord Ross of Halkhead. Died: March 1636, Jaffa, Israel
2 CONT # ROSS, William 8th Lord Ross of Halkhead.  Died: August 1640.  
2 CONT # ROSS, Robert 9th Lord Ross of Halkhead.  Died: August 1648.
2 CONT # ROSS, Jean+.  Jean married Sir Robert INNES 21st of that Ilk, 2nd Baronet, son of Sir Robert INNES 20th of that Ilk, Baronet and Grissell STEWART.1 (Sir Robert INNES 21st of that Ilk, 2nd Baronet was born about 1612.)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT "(James 6th Lord Ross) married (contract 19 December 1614 and 30 January 1615) Margaret, daughter of Walter, first Lord Scott of Buccleuch ... "
2 CONT
2 CONT from Scots Peerage (vol 7) 1
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret next married Sir Alexander MONTGOMERIE Lord Montgomerie, 6th Earl of Eglinton 'Greysteel', son of Robert SETON 1st Earl of Winton and Margaret MONTGOMERIE, between November 1642 and March 1644.1 2 (Sir Alexander MONTGOMER
2 CONC IE Lord Montgomerie, 6th Earl of Eglinton 'Greysteel' was born about 1588.)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
