1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JANET GORDON secunda===
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft/page/109/mode/1up The Scots Peerage V: 109]
2 CONT
2 CONT Janet Gordon was born in 1530. She was the daughter of James Gordon of Lochinvar.1 She married Patrick Agnew of Lochnaw, son of Andrew Agnew of Lochnaw and Agnes Stewart, in 1550.1 She died on 13 February 1577.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Janet Gordon and Patrick Agnew of Lochnaw
2 CONT
2 CONT # Sir Andrew Agnew of Lochnaw+1 d. 1616
2 CONT # Patrick Agnew1
2 CONT # William Agnew1 d. 1625
2 CONT # Thomas Agnew+1
2 CONT # Katherine Agnew+2
2 CONT # Helen Agnew2
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT # [S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 1, page 45. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Peer
2 CONC age and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT # [S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition, volume 1, page 46.
2 CONT
