2 CONT * http://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I50027&tree=CC
2 CONT * http://www.thepeerage.com/p12178.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I50024&tree=CC
