1 NOTE In 1628, Sir William was created Viscount Drumlanrig, and in 1633, Earl of Queensberry. He was the father of 4 sons and 2 daughters including James, eldest son and heir, and Sir William of Kelhead, whose descendants would figure q
2 CONC uite
