2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Margaret (Douglas) Murray - Grierson'''
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH 1593 • Cockpool, Dumfries-shire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH 23 MAY 1655 • Lag, Dumfries-shire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Margaret (Douglas) Murray - Grierson was born in 1593 in Dumfries, Dumfries-shire, Scotland, 
2 CONT
2 CONT to '''Lady Janet (Gordon) Douglas - Murray''', age 34, and '''Sir James 'of Cockpool' (Somerville) Murray''', age 28.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married '''Robert '10th Lord of Lag' Grierson''' in Dumfries, Scotland, on Sept 27, 1614, she was 21 yrs old.
2 CONT
