1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Robert Crichton:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p2398.htm#i23978
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Crichton, 6th Lord Crichton of Sanquhar1
2 CONT *M, #23978, 
2 CONT *d. 1561
2 CONT *Last Edited=8 Feb 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Crichton, 6th Lord Crichton of Sanquhar was the son of William Crichton, 5th Lord Crichton of Sanquhar and Elizabeth Fleming. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Margaret Cuninghame, daughter of John Cuninghame of Caprington.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1561, without issue.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded to the title of 6th Lord Crichton of Sanquhar [S., 1488] on 11 June 1550.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT *1. [S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 1, page 601. Hereinafter cited as Burke's P
2 CONC eerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
