1 NAME Elizabeth /Douglas/
2 GIVN Elizabeth
2 SURN Douglas
2 _MARNM Douglas
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE AFT 1555
1 DEAT
2 DATE FEB 1637
2 PLAC Edinburgh, Midlothian, , Scotland
2 ADDR
1 TITL Lady
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Lady Elizabeth Douglas''' (d. 1637) was the daughter of David Douglas, 7th Earl of Angus and Margaret Hamilton. She married, firstly, John Maxwell, 7th Lord Maxwell, son of Robert Maxwell, 5th Lord Maxwell and B
2 CONC eatrix Douglas, on 17 February 1571/72.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, Sir Alexander Stewart of Garlies, son of Sir Alexander Stewart of Garlies and Catherine Herries, after 1572.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, thirdly, Sir John Wallace in 1598.
2 CONT
2 CONT From 17 February 1571/72, her married name became Maxwell. From after 1572, her married name became Stewart. From 1598, her married name became Wallace.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children of Lady Elizabeth Douglas and John Maxwell, 7th Lord Maxwell===
2 CONT
2 CONT * Elizabeth Maxwell+4 b. b 1579, d. a Dec 1639
2 CONT * Robert Maxwell, 1st Earl of Nithsdale b. a 1586, d. May 1646
2 CONT
