2 CONT Taken prisoner at the rout of Selway 1542. Released 1543 upon giving his son and heir as hostage
2 CONT ______________________________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Alexander Stewart of Garlies is our second cousin 16 times removed.
2 CONT He was Father of Sir Alexander Stewart; and Richard Stewart
2 CONT What was the name of his son who he gave up to be a hostage? Is that correct?
2 CONT His sons above, are our third cousin 15 times removed.
2 CONT
2 CONT Janet Milburn
2 CONT 5/29/23
