1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT 82. <strong>Alexander Dunbar, of Pankill</strong>, nat. circa 1568, was the second son of Alexander Dunbar, of Canzie. He married a daughter of Sir Alexander Stewart, of Garlies (who was created Earl of Galloway by King James VI.,
2 CONC  in 1623). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander Dunbar died in 1630. He left a son and successor — 
2 CONT * John Dunbar, of Pankill
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: Welles, Albert. [http://archive.org/stream/dunbarfamily00well#page/n59/mode/2up Dunbar family]. N.Y., Society Lib. 1880. page 238
