1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT 86. <strong>John Dunbar, of Pankill</strong>, nat. circa Anno 1600. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Dunbar was served heir to his father in the lands of Pankill in 1631, and upon the death of his cousin John Dunbar (No. 85), without issue, succeeded also to the Estate of Mochrum, in 1656. He died Anno 1661. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Margert, daughter of Thomas Urquhart, of Burdsyards. by whom he had one son and two daughters, viz. — 
2 CONT * Thomas Dunbar, born at Mochrum about Anno 1630. 
2 CONT * Elizabeth Dunbar, born at Mochrum about Anno 1632. She married Captain Andrew Agnew, of Lochryan, and had issue. 
2 CONT * Margaret Dunbar, born at Mochrum about Anno 1635. She married Henry Hawtorn, of Ayress and had issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: Welles, Albert. [http://archive.org/stream/dunbarfamily00well#page/n59/mode/2up Dunbar family]. N.Y., Society Lib. 1880. page 238
