2 CONT "Pedigree Resource File," database, FamilySearch (http://familysearch.org/pal:/MM9.2.1/3SRZ-TXF : accessed 2014-02-28), entry for Elizabeth /Stewart/ Countess of Argyll.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ='''Elizabeth (Isabel) Stewart of Lorne'''=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Isabel Campbell (born Stewart of Lorn) was born in 1437 to Alan Stewart and Catherine Stewart (born Seton).
2 CONT * Alan was born in 1408, in Darnley and Crookston, Renfrewshire, Scotland.
2 CONT * Catherine was born in 1410, in Seton, East Luthian, Scotland.
2 CONT * Isabel had 5 siblings: John Stewart, Alexander Stewart and 3 other siblings.
2 CONT * Isabel married Colin McIphryar Campbell, 1st Earl of Argyll in 1465, at age 28.
2 CONT * Colin was born circa 1425, in Glenorchy, Lorn, Argyllshire, Scotland.
2 CONT * His occupations were Lord High Chancellor Of Scotland, Lord Chancellor of Scotland, Justiciary of Scotland, 1st Earl of Argyll and Earl 3 of Argyll, 3rd Earl of Argyll, 1st Lord of Glenorchy, Laird of Ardkinglas, Lochgoilhead, A
2 CONC rgyllshire, I Laird Of Glenorchy.
2 CONT * They had 21 children: Gillespie Archibald Campbell (2nd Earl of Argyll), Margaret Seaton (born Oliphant of Berrydale) and 19 other children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Colin Campbell, 1st Earl of Argyll married Isabelle Stewart, daughter of John Stewart, 2nd Lord Lorne in 1465, and had issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''Archibald Campbell, 2nd Earl of Argyll'''.
2 CONT # '''Thomas Campbell'''
2 CONT # '''Margaret Campbell''', married George Seton, 4th Lord Seton
2 CONT # '''Isabel Campbell''', married William Drummond, Master of Drummond, son to John Drummond, 1st Lord Drummond
2 CONT # '''Mary Campbell''' married Aonghas Óg Lord of the Isles.
2 CONT # '''Helen Campbell''', married to Hugh Montgomerie, 1st Earl of Eglinton
2 CONT # '''Elizabeth Campbell''', married John Oliphant, 2nd Lord Oliphant
2 CONT # '''Catherine Campbell''', married Lachlan Og Maclean
