1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT Not the wife of https://www.geni.com/people/George-Campbell-of-Loudoun/6000000002980014179?through=6000000009617281584
2 CONT Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Katherine-Kennedy/6000000005965664287 who married https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-John-Wallace-of-Craigie-7th-of-Craigie-12th-of-Riccarton/6000000006938454236?through=6000000005965664287
2 CONC  & https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Kennedy-3rd-of-Bargany/6000000008248654020?through=6000000005965664287
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://thepeerage.com/p2150.htm#i21498
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Catherine Kennedy''' was the daughter of Gilbert Kennedy of Dunure, 1st Lord Kennedy and Catherine Maxwell.1 She married Alexander Montgomerie, Master of Montgomerie, son of Alexander Montgomerie, Master of Montgomerie and Eliz
2 CONC abeth Hepburn, before 1459.2
2 CONT
2 CONT From before 1459, her married name became Montgomerie.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Catherine Kennedy and Alexander Montgomerie, Master of Montgomerie
2 CONT
2 CONT # John Montgomerie1  of Bowhouse
2 CONT # James Montgomerie1
2 CONT # Marjorie Montgomerie+3 m. William, Master of Somerville on 13 Jun 147
2 CONT # Margaret Montgomerie+
2 CONT # Hugh Montgomerie, 1st Earl of Eglinton+1 b. c 1460, d. Jun 1545.  succeeded his great-grandfather
2 CONT # Eupheme Montgomerie+1 b. c 1474
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
