1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Thomas Montgomerie of Skelmorlie</strong>, seems to have been of a weak mind, for his brother Robert was appointed tutor to him in 1561. He died without children."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/genealogicalhist00mont#page/136/mode/2up A genealogical history of the family of Montgomery]; by Thomas Harrison Montgomery; 1863; page 137
