2 CONT ;;;31 August 1551: Assize . . . . . Hugh Montgomery of Auchinhude, John M. his brother german, . . . . .  [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi04scot/page/161 Registrum Magni Sigilli Regum Scotorum. The Register of the Gre
2 CONC at Seal of Scotland, A.D. 1546-1580, charter number 723 on p, 161]'''
