1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == SIR JOHN MURE OF CALDWELL ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir John Mure of Caldwell, here treated, is the son of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Mure-of-Caldwell/6000000002713193107?through=6000000010437836860 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Isabel-Montgomery/600000000271297
2 CONC 9892?through=6000000010437836860 [https://archive.org/details/selectionsfromfa01mait/page/13/mode/1up Selections from the Family Papers I: 13]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir John Mure of Caldwell, here treated, was murdered on 10 September 1570 by the Cunninghams of Aiket and the Raeburns of that Ilk. [https://archive.org/details/selectionsfromfa01mait/page/13/mode/1up Selections from the Famil
2 CONC y Papers I: 13-4]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir John Mure of Caldwell, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Jonet-Kennedy/6000000198967858823?through=6000000010437836860 [https://archive.org/details/selectionsfromfa01mait/page/13/mode/1up Family Papers I: 13
2 CONC ] She is noticed as his wife on 16 August 1559. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD60%2f18&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=jonet+kennedy&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1600&di=n NRS: GD60/18]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Children ==
2 CONT
