2 CONT == [https://archive.org/details/selectionsfromfa01mait/page/14/mode/1up Biographical Summary] ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir John Mure of Caldwell: "having been knighted by James V. He married Jonet Kennedy of Bargany in Ayrshire, by whom he had several sons. He was killed on the 10th of September 1570, by the Cuninghams of Aitkett and the Ryebur
2 CONC ns of that ilk, who afterwards, in the sequel of the same series of feuds, slew his kinsman, Hugh Earl of Eglinton, on the 18th of April 1586. [https://archive.org/details/selectionsfromfa01mait/page/14/mode/1up Selections from th
2 CONC e Family Papers Preserved at Caldwell, Part First, pp. 14-17]'''
