1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "SIR JAMES SCHAW OF SAUCHIE, succeeded his father and had a charter from James, Lord Haliburton, for the lands of Auchengownie, in the barony of Forgandenny, on 2 February, 1502. 
2 CONT
