2 CONT '''James Edmonstone of Ballewan, here treated, is the grandfather of https://www.geni.com/people/James-Edmonstone/6000000037933282873 [https://archive.org/details/parishofstrathbl00smit/page/97/mode/1up Strathblane: 97]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the National Records of Scotland===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''31 August 1553: Apud Edinburgh. Regina etc., dedit literas legitimationis JACOBO EDMESTOUN in Bellewin, filio naturali quondam Archibaldo E. de Duntreith. xxxi. 138. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi04scot/page/187/
2 CONC mode/1up Registrum Magni Sigilli Regum Scotorum. The Register of the Great Seal of Scotland, A.D. 1546-1580. Edited by John Maitland Thomson, MA. (H.M. General Register House, Edinburgh, 1886), number 838]'''
