1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===ARCHIBALD EDMONSTONE===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Archibald Edmonstone is the son of Sir William Edmonstone of Duntreath. The name of his mother has not been discovered. He is noticed as the brother-german of William Edmonstone of Duntreath in a charter dated 1553. He married 
2 CONC Agnes Connal, with whom he is said to have had a son named William. [https://archive.org/stream/genealogicalacco00inedmo#page/36/mode/1up Duntreath: 36]'''
