2 CONT The Life Summary of Sibylla
2 CONT
2 CONT When Lady Sibylla Baillie was born about 1478, in Lamington, Lanarkshire, Scotland, her father, Sir William Baillie 5th Lord of Lamington, was 18 and her mother, Marion Home, was 17. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Sir William Edmonstone before 17 May 1497, in Duntreath, Stirlingshire, Scotland, United Kingdom. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1545, in Stirlingshire, Scotland, United Kingdom, at the age of 67.
