2 CONT *4. George Buchanan of that Ilk, c 1557
2 CONT * George Buchanan succeeded his grandfather in 1526. He married twice. (1) Margaret Edmonstone, ( 2 ) Janet Cunningham. '''By his first wife he had John''' and by his second wife William  ( first of Auchmar ) , and Margaret. Georg
2 CONC e died 15 February 1560/61.
2 CONT * A shield of arms couché: Three ( boar's or bear's ) heads and necks erased. Crest unknown. Inscription illegible. Source, ( Leny and Bardowie Ch. ).
