4 CONT
4 CONT When her son, the young Lord Seton, came of age, she retired to the Convent of Saint Catherine of Siena, at Edinburgh. This convent, founded 1517 by a bull of Pope Leo X, also benefited from Lady Seton's donations. She died there 
4 CONC in 1558 and then was buried next to her husband at Seton.
4 CONT
