2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes Drummond [1]
2 CONT *F, #21501, 
2 CONT *d. 21 January 1589/90
2 CONT *Last Edited=29 Apr 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes Drummond married, firstly, Sir Hugh Campbell before 1562.[3] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, Hugh Montgomerie, 3rd Earl of Eglinton, son of Hugh Montgomerie, 2nd Earl of Eglinton and Mariot Seton, before 10 August 1562.[3] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, thirdly, Patrick Drummond, 3rd Lord Drummond, son of David Drummond, 2nd Lord Drummond and Lilias Ruthven, in 1588.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 21 January 1589/90.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Sir John Drummond of Innerpeffray and Margaret Stewart.[2] 
2 CONT *From before 1562, her married name became Campbell.[3] 
2 CONT *From before 10 August 1562, her married name became Montgomerie.[2] As a result of her marriage, Agnes Drummond was styled as Countess of Eglinton. 
2 CONT *From 1588, her married name became Drummond.[3]
2 CONT
