2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.19%
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh Montgomerie, 4th Earl of Eglinton was born in 1563.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, secondly, Helen Kennedy, daughter of Thomas Kennedy of Bargeny.[3] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, firstly, Giles Boyd, daughter of Robert Boyd, 5th Lord Boyd of Kilmarnock and Margaret Colquhoun, between 13 May 1576 and 20 May 1576.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died between 18 April 1586 and 20 April 1586, shot dead by a party of Cunninghams, as part of the feud between the two families.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Hugh Montgomerie, 3rd Earl of Eglinton and Agnes Drummond.[2],[1] 
2 CONT *He succeeded to the title of 4th Earl of Eglinton [S., 1507] on 3 June 1585.[2] 
2 CONT *He succeeded to the title of 5th Lord Montgomerie [S., 1445] on 3 June 1585.[2]
2 CONT
