1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barony_and_Castle_of_Giffen
2 CONT
2 CONT >The direct Montgomerie line ended with the 5th. Earl who had married his cousin-german,[11] Margaret, eldest daughter and heiress of Robert Montgomerie of Giffen and Master of Eglinton. Their marriage was so unsuccessful that the
2 CONC  Earl took the drastic step of revoking her heritable rights as gained through their marriage.[24]
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I18335&tree=CC
2 CONT
2 CONT >Daniel Montgomery of the original Giffen line sold (or otherwise transferred) Giffen to Robert Montgomery , second son of the 3rd Earl of Eglinton. Robert had no sons and his eldest daughter married the 5th Earl of Eglinton so th
2 CONC e estate passed back to the senior Montgomery line.
2 CONT [Stirnet-Montgomery05]
