2 CONT '''1 May 1598: Precept from chancery in favour of Gilbert Kennedy of Bargany as heir of deceased Thomas Kennedy of Bargany, his father in lands of Bargany, Arstincher and Ballantra [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecata
2 CONC logue/details.aspx?reference=GD109%2f15&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=gilbert+kennedy+of+bargany&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the family of Dalrymple-Hamilton of Bargany, Ayrshire, reference GD109
