1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===DAME HELEN KENNEDY===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Helen Kennedy is the daughter of Thomas Kennedy of Bargany. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD220%2f1%2fB%2f1%2f5%2f1&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=helen+kennedy&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1550&d
2 CONC t=1600&di=n NRS: GD220/1/B/1/5/1]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===First Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Helen Kennedy married Hugh Montgomery, Earl of Eglinton. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD3%2f1%2f1%2f1%2f6&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=helen+kennedy&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y NRS: 
2 CONC GD3/1/1/1/6]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Second Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Dame Helen Kennedy, widow of Hugh Montgomery, Earl of Eglinton, married Alexander Kennedy of Craigneill. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD3%2f1%2f1%2f1%2f9&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n
2 CONC &k=helen+kennedy&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y NRS: GD3/1/1/1/9]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Third Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Dame Helen Kennedy, widow of Hugh Montgomery, Earl of Eglinton, and Alexander Kennedy of Craigneill,  married Sir John Graham of Knockdolian. She was his future wife on 8 May 1590. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinec
2 CONC atalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD220%2f1%2fB%2f1%2f5%2f1&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=helen+kennedy&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1550&dt=1600&di=n NRS: GD220/1/B/1/5/1]'''
