2 CONT
2 CONT '''2 June 1636: Disposition and assignation by Margaret Blair, youngest daughter, and one of 2 heirs portioners of deceased James Blair, burgess of Air, and Thomas Neveine, fiar of Monkroddeine, her spouse, to Patrick Davidsoun of
2 CONC  Aird and Janet Blair, his spouse, sister of said Margaret, of wadset, 3 November 1601, by deceased Gilbert Kennedie of Bargany and Jean Stewart, his spouse, in favour of said James and Margaret Sinklear, his spouse, of 40s. land 
2 CONC of Nethir Newwork, in return for 2,000 merks scots. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD109%2f668&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=jean+stewart&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1650&di=n National Records 
