2 CONT *'''     Elizabeth Lindsay married John Drummond, 1st Lord Drummond, son of Sir Malcolm Drummond, Lord Stobhall & Cargill and Mariot Murray.2 Elizabeth Lindsay died after 22 September 1509.
2 CONT *'''Family      John Drummond, 1st Lord Drummond b. c 1438, d. 1519
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Elizabeth Drummond+ d. a 21 Aug 1514
2 CONT **Beatrix Drummond+
2 CONT **Margaret Drummond+2 d. May 1502
2 CONT **Eupheme Drummond+ d. May 1502
2 CONT **Annabel Drummond+ d. a 1492
2 CONT **Malcolm Drummond3 d. b 1519
2 CONT **William Drummond, Master of Drummond+4 d. bt Jul 1503 - Jul 1504
2 CONT **Sibylla Drummond5 d. 1502
2 CONT **Sir John Drummond, 1st Laird of Innerpeffray+6 b. c 1460
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S5308] Unknown author, Magna Charta Sureties, 1215, 4th Ed., by F. L. Weis, p. 54.
2 CONT * 2.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. I, p. 671.
2 CONT * 3.[S11586] The Scots Peerage, Vol. VII, edited by Sir James Balfour Paul, p. 42.
