1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sir John Drummond, 2nd Laird of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Innerpeffray Innerpaffrey], was the son of Sir John Drummond, 1st Laird of Innerpaffrey, who was the son of Sir John, 1st Lord Drummond.  So John Drumm
2 CONC ond and Margaret Stewart were something like 2nd cousins.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born circa 1500. He was the son of John Drummond, 1st Lord Drummond and Lady Elizabeth Lindsay.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married
2 CONT # Margaret Stewart, daughter of James IV Stewart, King of Scotland and Margaret Drummond, on 20 January 1530/31.3
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir John Drummond and Margaret Stewart
2 CONT # Isabel Drummond+1
2 CONT # Agnes Drummond+4 d. 21 Jan 1589/90
2 CONT # Margaret Drummond+5
2 CONT # Jean Drummond+6
2 CONT # Elizabeth Drummond+6
2 CONT
