2 CONT Elizabeth Hay [1]
2 CONT *F, #21441
2 CONT *Last Edited=8 May 2011
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.45%
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Hay married George Seton, 4th Lord Seton, son of George Seton, 3rd Lord Seton and Lady Janet Hepburn, circa 15 June 1527.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of John Hay, 3rd Lord Hay of Yester and Elizabeth Douglas.[1],[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT From circa 15 June 1527, her married name became Seton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Hay and George Seton, 4th Lord Seton
