2 CONT *2. John Seton [1]
2 CONT *3. Margaret Seton [1]
2 CONT *4. Eleanor Seton+[1]
2 CONT *5. Beatrix Seton [1]
2 CONT *6. George Seton, 5th Lord Seton+[1] b. 1531, d. 8 Jan 1585/86
