2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Lady Janet Hepburn was born between 1481 and 1490. She was the daughter of Patrick Hepburn, 1st Earl of Bothwell and Lady Janet Douglas. She married George Seton, 3rd Lord Seton, son of George Seton, 2nd Lord Seton and Lady Margar
2 CONC et Campbell, before 25 January 1506/7. She died after 10 May 1558.2 She was buried at Seton Church, Seton, Midlothian, Scotland. She was also known as Jane. From before 25 January 1506/7, her married name became Seton. She lived a
2 CONC fter 1513 at Convent of St. Catherine of Sienna, Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland.
2 CONT
