1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JANET DOUGLAS===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Janet Douglas is the bastard daughter of Archibald, Earl of Angus. The Scots Peerage account of the Douglas Earls of Angus does not identify her mother, [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun01paul/page/193/mode/1up The 
2 CONC Scots Peerage I: 193] although the Scots Peerage account of the Ruthven Earls of Gowrie identifies her as the unnamed daughter of an unnamed Stewart of Traquair. [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04paul#page/261/mode/1up
2 CONC The Scots Peerage IV: 261] Stirnet identifies the maternal grandfather of Janet Douglas as James Stewart, the first laird of Traquair. However, this should not be regarded as certain. [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ss
2 CONC 4tz/stewart19.php Stirnet: Stewart 19]'''
