2 CONT '''Margaret Hepburn, primus, here treated, is the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Patrick-Hepburn-1st-Earl-of-Bothwell/6000000002277528866?through=6000000018986012932 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Gordo
2 CONC n-Countess-of-Bothwell/6000000002187894707?through=6000000018986012932 According to the Scots Peerage: "Margaret Hepburne, who was married, contract dated 26 June 1509, to Archibald Douglas (son of George, Master of Angus), who af
2 CONC terwards succeeded as sixth Earl of Angus. The contract of marriage is preserved in the Buccleuch charter-chest. John, Prior of St. Andrews, George, Abbot of Aberbrothok, Adam Hepburne of the Craggis, and Mr. George Hepburne, Dean
2 CONC  of Dunkeld, were parties on behalf of Adam, Earl of Bothwell, brother of the bride. She died in 1513, it is said, in childbed, leaving no surviving issue." [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun02paul/page/155/mode/1up The
2 CONC  Scots Peerage II: p. 155]'''
