1 NOTE {geni:about_me} David Douglas, 7th Earl of Angus
2 CONT
2 CONT b. circa 1515, died in June 1557 at Cockburnspath, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Sir George Douglas and Elizabeth Douglas.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Margaret Hamilton, daughter of Sir John Hamilton and Janet Home, after 8 May 1552.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of David Douglas, 7th Earl of Angus and Margaret Hamilton
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Lady Margaret Douglas+2 d. 1640
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Lady Elizabeth Douglas+2 d. 1637
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Archibald Douglas, 8th Earl of Angus+1 b. c 1555, d. 4 Aug 1588
2 CONT
2 CONT  David Douglas, 7th Earl of Angus succeeded to the title of 7th Earl of Angus [S., 1389] in January 1556/57.  He was said to be inactive and sickly.
2 CONT
2 CONT weblinks: http://thepeerage.com/p10959.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=17 May 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
