2 CONT * Alt. date of birth: July 13, 1475
2 CONT * '''Archibald Campbell, 1st of Skipness'''1 
2 CONT * M, #109634, d. 18 July 1537
2 CONT * Last Edited=8 Jun 2012 — Consanguinity Index=0.1%
2 CONT * '''Archibald Campbell, 1st of Skipness''' was the son of Archibald Campbell, 2nd Earl of Argyll and Lady Elizabeth Stuart.1 He married, secondly, Janet Douglas, daughter of George Douglas, Master of Angus and Elizabeth Drummond,
2 CONC  circa 1535.1,2 He died on 18 July 1537 at Edinburgh Castle, Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland, he fell from the Rock and was killed while trying to escape.2
2 CONT * On 30 July 1511 he had a charter of Skipness in the Sheriffdom of Tarbart from his father.2 He lived at Skipnish, Scotland.1 In 1537 at Edinburgh Castle, Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland, he was imprisoned.2
2 CONT * '''Child''' of Archibald Campbell, 1st of Skipness and Janet Douglas
2 CONT ** 1. John Campbell, 2nd of Skipness+3
