2 CONC 106th edition.
2 CONT * 2. H. Pirie-Gordon, editor, Burke's Genealogical and Heraldic History of the Landed Gentry, 15th edition, (London, England: Burke's Peerage Ltd, 1937), page 340. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Landed Gentry, 15th ed.
2 CONT * 3. Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 106th edition, volume 1, page 104.
