1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JOHN CAMPBELL OF SKIPNESS
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Sometime Provost of Kilmun
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Last Will and Testament
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Campbell of Skipnish, Provost of Kilmun,''' here treated, made his last will and testament immediately before he died on 18 September 1573. In the first he nominated his sons, Archibald Campbell and Duncan Campbell, to be 
2 CONC his only executors and assignees. Because his sons were still minor children, he nominated and appointed the Earl of Argyll and the Master of Argyll to be their curators and tutors testamentar. His wife https://www.geni.com/people
2 CONC /Marion-Montgomery-Lady-Sempill/6000000011056651203?through=6000000006444052875 was still alive on 13 September 1573. He does not refere to her by name in his testament but he left legacies to "my spous" and "my lady my spous." Co
2 CONC nfirmation was granted to his sons Archibald Campbell and Duncan Campbell on 10 February 1574. [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Commissary Court, The Testament Testamentar and Inventory of Johne Campbell, Provost of Kilmun
2 CONC , reference CC8/8/3].
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000187743051833 Image of Testament]
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000187742422850 Image of Testament]
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000187742628830 Image of Testament]
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000187742473887 Image of Testament]
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000187743029828 Image of Testament]
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Death
2 CONT
2 CONT John Campbell of Skipnish, Provost of Kilmun, here treated, died on18 September 1573. His place of death is not mentioned in his Testament, but he probably died at Kilmun where he was the Provost. [NRS: CC8/8/3] [https://www.geni.
2 CONC com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000187743051833 Image of Testament]
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT John Campbell of Skipnish, Provost of Kilmun, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Marion-Montgomery-Lady-Sempill/6000000011056651203?through=6000000006444052875  [https://archive.org/stream/abstractsofproto05glas#pag
2 CONC e/12/mode/1up Glasgow Protocols V: 1349]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Children
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Archibald-Campbell/6000000187658247827?through=6000000006444052875
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Duncan-Campbell/6000000187658119842
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Jane-Campbell/6000000187657932862?through=6000000006444052875
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Campbell-of-Skipnish/6000000028240025320?through=6000000006444052875
