2 CONC cotland%20David%20Hume%20angus&f=false
2 CONT
2 CONT Letter 56. Dated: June 25, 1524 Norham. Bulmer to Wolsey. Receipt of letters; one to the Observant Friar. Has conveyed his thanks to the garrison at Norham. Death of David Hume. The Observant Friar will answer the letters addresse
2 CONC d to him within 8 or 10 days.
