2 CONT ***A.	John Charteris, 9th of Amisfield (d 05.03.1577) 	m1. (mcrt 13.02.1548) Nicolas Grierson (dsp, dau of Sir John Grierson of Lag) m2. (1552) Janet Douglas (dau of Sir James Douglas, 7th of Drumlanrig)
