2 CONT *'''     Sir Alexander Gordon of Kenmure and Lochinvar, younger married, firstly, Janet Kennedy, daughter of John Kennedy, 2nd Lord Kennedy and Lady Elizabeth Gordon.2 He died on 9 September 1513 at Flodden Field, Northumberland, 
