2 CONT ******					  m1. Annabella Boyd (dau of Robert, Lord Boyd)
2 CONT *******						(A) .... etc.
2 CONT ******					  m2. (before 19.05.1489) Elizabeth Lindsay
2 CONT *******						(B) .... etc.
2 CONT ******					(2) Alexander Gordon of Auchireoch, etc ancestor of Gordons of Airds of Kells
2 CONT *******						(A) .... etc.
2 CONT ******					(3) George Gordon had issue
2 CONT ******					  m. Janet (da of John Maclellan or Dougalson of Troquhain)
2 CONT ******					(4) Roger Gordon ancestor of Gordons of Crogo
2 CONT ******					  m. Geylles Macnaught (dau of Andrew Macnaught of Crogo)
