2 CONC ; (2) 3 Jun 1514 Alexander [Home], 3rd Lord Home, (3) betw. 1520 and 15 Nov 1525 as his second wife Robert [Maxwell], 4th Lord Maxwell, and (4) bef. 13 Dec 1549 Cuthbert Ramsay, son of Nicholas Ramsay of Dalhousie; she was legitim
2 CONC ated 31 Oct 1552 ; d. Feb 1557), illegit. dau. of James [Stewart], 1st Earl of Buchan, by his mistress Margaret Murray 3. Lady Janet Stewart, Governess to Mary I, Queen of Scotland 1548 and later mistress of Henry II, King of Fran
2 CONC ce (b. 17 Jul 1502; d. betw. 5 Oct 1560 and 20 Feb 1562/3), mar. after 28 Feb 1523/4 Malcolm [Fleming], 3rd Lord Fleming, and had issue
2 CONT
