2 CONT Mary Maxwell
2 CONT F, #10427
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Maxwell is the daughter of John Maxwell, 3rd Lord Maxwell and Agnes Stewart.1 She married James Johnstone of Johnstone, son of Sir Adam Johnstone of Johnstone.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Johnstone.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary Maxwell and James Johnstone of Johnstone
2 CONT
2 CONT William Johnstone of Newbie
