2 CONT When Lady Grissel Maxwell was born on 11 November 1550, in Terregles, Kirkcudbrightshire, Scotland, her father, John Maxwell, was 39 and her mother, Agnes Herries, was 17. She married Sir Thomas MacClellan III, of Bombie,  Gentlem
2 CONC an of the King's Bedchamber in January 1584, in Kirkcudbright, Dumfriesshire, Scotland, United Kingdom. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 3 daughters. She died on 13 July 1597, 
