2 CONT <blockquote>'''Lady Beatrix Douglas, here treated, is not the same person as  https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Douglas-of-Morton/6000000002032127301 Nor is she the same person as https://www.geni.com/people/Beatrix-Douglas/60
