2 CONT From http://thepeerage.com/p63699.htm#i636982
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Maxwell, 6th Lord Maxwell was born between 1549 and 1551.1 He was the son of Robert Maxwell, 5th Lord Maxwell and Lady Beatrix Douglas.1 He died from 21 December 1553 to 26 January 1554/55.1
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded as the 6th Lord Maxwell [S., 1445] on 13 September 1552.2
