2 CONT      Nicola Grierson is the daughter of Sir Robert Grierson of Lag and Margaret Murray.1 She married James Stewart, 2nd Earl of Galloway, son of Alexander Stewart, 1st Earl of Galloway and Grizel Gordon, in 1642.1
2 CONT      From 1642, her married name became Stewart.1 Children of Nicola Grierson and James Stewart, 2nd Earl of Galloway
