2 CONC necatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD77%2f103&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=craigdarroch&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1600&dt=1650&di=n NRS: GD77/103] It follows, therefore, that he is the son of https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Fergusson-of-Cr
2 CONC aigdarroch/6000000014585399699?through=6000000010050732656 [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/overview.aspx?st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=&ko=p&r=GD77%2f98&ro=m&df=&dt=&di=n NRS: GD77/98] The name of his mother h
2 CONC as not been satisfactorily identified.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''William Fergussone of Craigdarroch, here treated, died before 24 March 1643. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD77%2f148&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=john+fergussone&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&
2 CONC dt=&di=n NRS: GD77/148]'''
