2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''William Fergusson of Craigdarroch, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Sara-Grierson/6000000004094874623?through=6000000010050732656 They were contracted on 9 May 1621. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonli
2 CONC necatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD77%2f174%2f2&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=&ko=p&r=GD77%2f174&ro=m&df=&dt=&di=n GD77/174/2]'''
