2 CONC nt of the conditions in GD77/69. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD77%2f74&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Chapelmark&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n Records of Scotland, Papers of the Fergusson
