1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Margaret Home1 F, #28102, b. before 5 December 1565, d. May 1598
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Home|b. b 5 Dec 1565\nd. May 1598|p2811.htm#i28102|Alexander Home, 5th Lord Home|d. 1575|p2811.htm#i28103|Margaret Ker||p2811.htm#i28104|George Home, 4th Lord Home|d. c 15 Apr 1549|p10939.htm#i109384|Mariot Halyburton||p2
2 CONC 810.htm#i28097|Sir Walter Ker of Cessford||p2811.htm#i28105||||
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=22 Apr 2011
2 CONT      Margaret Home was born before 5 December 1565.2 She was the daughter of Alexander Home, 5th Lord Home and Margaret Ker.1 A contract for the marriage of Margaret Home and George Keith, 4th Earl Marischal was signed on 4 Februa
2 CONC ry 1580/81.2 She died in May 1598.2
2 CONT      From 4 February 1580/81, her married name became Keith.2 Children of Margaret Home and George Keith, 4th Earl Marischal 1.Lady Anne Keith+ d. 30 May 1648 2.William Keith, 5th Earl Marischal+3 b. c 1585, d. 28 Oct 1635 Citatio
2 CONC ns 1.[S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 2, page 1949. Hereinafter cited as Burke's
2 CONC  Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition. 2.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britai
2 CONC n and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extinct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume VIII, page 480. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage. 3
2 CONC .[S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition, volume 2, page 2195.
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p2811.htm#i28102
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p34645.htm#i346443
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the first wife(c. Feb. 1581). Margaret (d. 1598), was the daughter of Alexander Home, 5th Lord Home and Margaret Ker, a daughter of Sir Walter Ker of Cessford. Their children included:
2 CONT William Keith, 6th Earl Marischal.
2 CONT Anne Keith who married William Douglas, 7th Earl of Morton.
2 CONT Margaret Keith who married Sir Robert Arbuthnott, of that ilk but had no issue. Mary Keith married John Campbell of Cawdor
2 CONT Gilbert Keith of Benholm who married Margaret Lindsay
