2 CONT '''Patrick Gray, 4th Lord Gray'''1 
2 CONT M, #28229, '''b. circa 1518, d. 1584'''
2 CONT Last Edited=17 Dec 2018
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.32%
2 CONT '''     Patrick Gray, 4th Lord Gray was born circa 1518.2 He was the son of''' Gilbert Gray and Egidia Mercer.3 '''A contract for the marriage of Patrick Gray, 4th Lord Gray and Marion Ogilvy was signed on 21 September 1537.3 He d
2 CONC ied in 1584.'''3
2 CONT '''     He succeeded as the 4th Lord Gray [S., 1445] in April 1541.3 After 24 November 1542 he was captured by the English after the Battle of Solway Moss, and ransomed for £500.'''3
2 CONT '''Children of Patrick Gray, 4th Lord Gray and Marion Ogilvy'''
2 CONT 1. Agnes Gray+3
2 CONT 2. James Gray1 d. 1585/86
2 CONT 3. Mary Gray+4
2 CONT 4. Marion Gray+4 d. Jun 1582
2 CONT 5. Janet Gray+3
2 CONT 6. Lilias Gray+4
2 CONT 7. Walter Gray5 d. 1601
2 CONT 8. Patrick Gray, 5th Lord Gray+3 b. 1538, d. b 10 Mar 1607/8
2 CONT 9. Elizabeth Gray+5 b. b 1550
2 CONT 10. Isobel Gray+6 b. c 1560, d. 20 Oct 1589
