1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Wikipedia Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Francis Scott, 2nd Earl of Buccleuch</strong> (21 December 1626 – 22 November 1651) was the son of Walter Scott, 1st Earl of Buccleuch.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 25 July 1646, he married Lady Margaret Leslie, daughter of John Leslie, 6th Earl of Rothes and they had three children:
2 CONT * Mary Scott, 3rd Countess of Buccleuch (1647–1661)
2 CONT * Walter Scott, Baron Scott of Buccleuch (b. & d. 1648), died in infancy.
2 CONT * Anne Scott, 1st Duchess of Buccleuch (1651–1732)"
2 CONT
