2 CONT A childhood companion of Mary, Queen of Scots. One of the Four Marys (Mary Livingston, Mary Beaton, Mary Seton, and Mary Fleming).
2 CONT
2 CONT Her mother was an illegitimate daughter of James IV of Scots, making her first cousin to Mary Queen of Scots.
