2 CONT   James Scrymgeour, 2nd Viscount Dudhope was the son of John Scrymgeour, 1st Viscount Dudhope and Margaret Seton.2 He married Lady Isabella Ker, daughter of Robert Ker, 1st Earl of Roxburghe and Margaret Maitland, on 4 August 1618
2 CONC .1 He died in 1644, killed in action.1
2 CONT      He succeeded to the title of 2nd Lord Scrimgeour [S., 1641] on 7 March 1643.1 He succeeded to the title of 2nd Viscount Dudhope [S., 1641] on 7 March 1643.1 He fought in the Battle of Marston Moor in 1644.1
