1 OCCU Earl, 2nd Earl of Perth, Scottish Earl
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on John Drummond, 2nd Earl of Perth:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p2216.htm#i22155
2 CONT
2 CONT John Drummond, 2nd Earl of Perth [1]
2 CONT *M, #22155, 
2 CONT *b. circa 1584, 
2 CONT *d. 11 June 1662
2 CONT *Last Edited=22 May 2007
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.69%
2 CONT
2 CONT John Drummond, 2nd Earl of Perth was born circa 1584.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Jean Ker, daughter of Robert Ker, 1st Earl of Roxburghe and Margaret Maitland, on 28 August 1613. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 11 June 1662.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Patrick Drummond, 3rd Lord Drummond and Lady Elizabeth Lindsay. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded to the title of 2nd Earl of Perth [S., 1605] on 8 December 1611.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Drummond, 2nd Earl of Perth and Jean Ker
2 CONT *1. Henry Drummond [1] b. 1 Aug 1614, d. Sep 1622
2 CONT *2. James Drummond, 3rd Earl of Perth+ b. 1615, d. 2 Jun 1675
2 CONT *3. Robert Drummond [1] b. 1618
2 CONT *4. Sir John Drummond [1] b. 1620, d. Jun 1678
2 CONT *5. Lady Lilias Drummond+[4] b. c 1622, d. b 12 Jan 1663/64
2 CONT *6. William Ker, 2nd Earl of Roxburghe+ b. 1622, d. 2 Jul 1675
2 CONT *7. Lady Jean Drummond+ b. 1623/24, d. 12 Jan 1663
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT *1. [S1224] Derek Hughes, "re: 1st Lord Drummond," e-mail message to Darryl Lundy, 22 December 2004, 13 February 2005 and 2 March 2005. Hereinafter cited as "re: 1st Lord Drummond."
2 CONT *2. [S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Exti
2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume X, page 478. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT *3. [S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume IV, page 471.
2 CONT *4. [S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume XII/2, page 69.
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT From the English Wikipedia page on John Drummond, 2nd Earl of Perth:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Drummond,_2nd_Earl_of_Perth
2 CONT
2 CONT John Drummond, 2nd Earl of Perth (1588 – 11 June 1662) was a Scottish nobleman.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family and titles
2 CONT
2 CONT Drummond was the son of Patrick Drummond, 3rd Lord Drummond and Lady Elizabeth Lindsay. He married Jean Kerr, daughter of Sir Robert Kerr, 1st Earl of Roxburghe and Mary Maitland, on 28 August 1613. He succeeded to his father's ti
2 CONC tle of 4th Lord Drummond in 1602 and then on 8 December 1611 (by special remainder) to the title of Earl of Perth created for his brother James Drummond (1586–1611).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT The second Lord Perth's children were -
2 CONT *1. Henry Drummond, born 1 August 1614, died September 1622
2 CONT *2. James Drummond, 3rd Earl of Perth, born 1615, died 2 June 1675
2 CONT *3. Robert Drummond, born 1618
2 CONT *4. Sir John Drummond, born 1620, died June 1678
2 CONT *5. Lady Lilias Drummond, born circa 1621, died before 12 January 1663/1643
2 CONT *6. Sir William Drummond, later Sir William Ker, 2nd Earl of Roxburghe, born 1623, died 2 July 1675
2 CONT *7. Lady Jean Drummond, born 1623/24, died 12 January 1663
2 CONT
