1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Lady Jean Drummond was born in 1623/24.1 She was the daughter of John Drummond, 2nd Earl of Perth and Jean Ker. She married John Fleming, 3rd Earl of Wigton, son of John Fleming, 2nd Earl of Wigton and Margaret Li
2 CONC vingstone, on 10 March 1633. She died on 12 January 1663.1      Her married name became Fleming.
