1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Elizabeth Hay of Yester===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Hay, daughter of Sir John, second Lord Hay of Yester, and his wife, Elisabeth Crichton, was born about 1508. She is listed in a Scottish peerage account as having married James Tweedie of Drumelzier.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
