1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===James Tweedie, Baron of Drumelzier===
2 CONT
2 CONT James Tweedie was married three times:
2 CONT
2 CONT James married Elizabeth Hay, daughter of John 2nd Lord Yester, in 1511
2 CONT he married Marjorie, daughter of 5th Lord Somerville, in 1536
2 CONT finally he married Mariote Stewart in June 1540.
2 CONT James inherited Drumelzier from his father in October 1531, the charter confirmed in December 1531.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT *The history of the Tweedie, or Tweedy, family; a record of Scottish lowland life & character; Michael Forbes Tweedie; London; 1902; p 157; https://archive.org/stream/historyoftweedie00twee#page/n231/mode/2up
2 CONT * The Scots Peerage, Vol 8, p 434, https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun08pauluoft#page/434/mode/2up
2 CONT * Register of the Great Seal of Scotland; Vol 3; p 488-489; https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi03scot#page/488/mode/2up
2 CONT * The register of the Great seal of Scotland; Vol 3; Edinburgh; 1882; p238; https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi03scot#page/238/mode/2up
2 CONT See also:
2 CONT
2 CONT *http://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I29896&tree=CC
