2 CONT Sir Andrew Agnew, Justiciar as well as Sheriff, s 1591, having m 1577 Agnes, dau. of Sir Alexander Stewart of Garlies by Katherine, dau. of Lord Herries of Terregles, and had by her Patrick; Andrew, in Knocktym, m Mary M'Dowell ; 
2 CONC Alexander of Barvennan; Quentin; Jean, m James Kennedy of Cruggleton, son of Sir John Kennedy of Blairquhan by Margaret, dau. of the 4th Earl Marischal ; Rosina, m William M'Clellan of Glen Shannoch, by whom she had Thomas, 2nd Lo
2 CONC rd Kirkcudbright.
