2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Mary Dalzell, here treated, is the daughter of Robert Dalziel, first Earl of Carnwath. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun02pauluoft/page/411/mode/1up The Scots Peerage II: 411]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Mary Dalzell, here treated, married Sir James Muirhead of Lauchope. She is noticed as his wife on 25 February 1654. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun02pauluoft/page/411/mode/1up The Scots Peerage II: p. 411, no
2 CONC te 12, which cites Registrum Magni Sigilli Regum Scotorum]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Children ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Claud-Muirhead-of-Lauchope/6000000011336165012?through=6000000011336633715
