2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''4 January 1659 x 28 September 1660: Sir James Muirhead of Lauchope. Mary or Margaret Dalziel, spouse of Sir James Muirhead of Wauchope. Claud Muirhead, son of Sir James Muirhead of Lauchope. [Particular Register of Sasines for 
2 CONC the Sheriffdom of Lanark, reference RS41/III/58]
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''28 March 1666: Marie Dalzell or Lady Lauchope. Anna Muirhead, daughter of Marie Dalziel. Bethea Muirhead, daughter of Marie Dalziel. Claud Muirhead, son of Marie Dalziel. David Muirhead, son of Marie Dalziel. [Register of Deeds
2 CONC , Grantees of a Bond registered in the Office of Dalrymple. Volume 16. Page 204] [https://archive.org/details/indexes500scotuoft/page/341/mode/1up Scottish Record Office Index for 1666: 341-2]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''22 June 1666: Sir James Muirhead of Lauchope (Principal Party). Marie Dalzell, spouse of Sir James Muirhead of Lauchope. Claud Muirhead, son of Sir James Muirhead of Lauchope. [Register of Deeds, Granters in a Contract of Wadse
2 CONC tt registered in the office of Dalrymple. Volume 16. Page 763] [https://archive.org/details/indexes500scotuoft/page/341/mode/1up Scottish Record Office Index for 1666: 341-2]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     4
2 CONT
2 CONT '''2 July 1667 x 23 September 1671: Sir James Muirhead of Lauchope. Mary or Margaret Dalziel, spouse of Sir James Muirhead of Wauchope. Claud Muirhead, son of Sir James Muirhead of Lauchope. [Particular Register of Sasines for the
2 CONC  Sheriffdom of Lanark, reference RS42/IV/55]
