2 CONT 9. WILLIAM6 DOUGLAS (William5, James4, William3, James2, William1) was born in 1618 in Dumfries-shire, Scotland. He died in 1673 in Scotland. He married Agnes Fawside in 1637 in Scotland. She was born in 1618 in Scotland. She died
2 CONC  in 1649 in Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT William Douglas and Agnes Fawside had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 14. i. JAMES7 DOUGLAS was born on 19 Sep 1639 in Scotland. He died in 1708. He married Catherine Douglas, daughter of James Douglas and Margaret Stewart in 1661. She was born in 1650 in Durisdeer, Dumfries-shire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. ARCHIBALD DOUGLAS was born on 02 Jan 1643 in Edinburgh, Midlothian,
2 CONT Scotland. He died in 29 1729 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. GEORGE DOUGLAS was born in 1646 in Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT 15. iv. ROBERT DOUGLAS was born on 02 Jan 1643 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland. He died in 29 1729 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland. He married Harriet Ella Gifford in 1663 in Midlothian, Scotland. She was born in 1645 in Sco
2 CONC tland.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. WILLIAM DOUGLAS was born in 1637 in Dumfries-shire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Source: < [http://www.thetintypeshop.com/family/Douglas/Surnames/DtoF/Douglas/kathrynpegelowgedcom_2012-03-09_2012-04-04_2012-08-18.pdf “Descendants of William Douglas”] > (2013) Page 4 of 178.
2 CONT
