2 CONT Elizabeth (Montgomerie) Cochrane was born in Scotland. Elizabeth Montgomerie was the daughter of Robert Montgomerie of Skelmorlie. She married William Cochrane of that Ilk, son of John Cochrane of that Ilk and Elizabeth Sempill, b
2 CONC efore 11 Jul 1579.[1] She died on 15 August 1594. https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Montgomerie-103
