2 CONT Johanna Fleming is the daughter of Malcolm Fleming, 3rd Lord Fleming and Janet Stewart.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, firstly, John Livingston, Master of Livingston, son of Alexander Livingston, 5th Lord Livingston and Lady Agnes Douglas.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married by contract, secondly, John Sandilands, 8th of Calder, son of Sir James Sandilands, 7th of Calder and Mariot Forrester, on 24 May 1560.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, thirdly, David Crawford, 5th of Kerse, son of David Crawford, 4th of Kerse and Catherine Hamilton, before November 1567.3
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Livingston.3 From 24 May 1560, her married name became Sandilands.1 From before November 1567, her married name became Craufurd.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Johanna Fleming and David Crawford, 5th of Kerse
