2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Crichton, 4th Lord Crichton of Sanquhar [1]
2 CONT *M, #23972, 
2 CONT *b. between 1515 and 1520, 
2 CONT *d. before 7 January 1535/36
2 CONT *Last Edited=8 Feb 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Crichton, 4th Lord Crichton of Sanquhar was born between 1515 and 1520. He was the son of Robert Crichton, 3rd Lord Crichton of Sanquhar and Elizabeth Murray.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Elizabeth Campbell, daughter of John Campbell, before 1 December 1534.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died before 7 January 1535/36, without issue.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded to the title of 4th Lord Crichton of Sanquhar [S., 1488] between 1516 and 1520.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT *1. [S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 1, page 601. Hereinafter cited as Burke's P
2 CONC eerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Notes 	
2 CONT
2 CONT This Robert is not recorded by Burkes Peerages 1934 which shows William (The Scots Peerage's 5th Lord) as the 3rd Lord  
