2 CONC d Walter Grahame, her son, for the sum of £400 Scots, 26 July 1548. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD22%2f1%2f452&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=margaret+mowbray&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1600&dt=1
