2 CONT 1. Patrick "Dubh Beg" Campbell, of Innerzeldies, 1st of Barcaldine, b. 1592<br>
2 CONT 2. Katherine Campbell, b. Abt 1595, Glenorchy, Argyllshire, Scotland<br>
2 CONT 3. Janet Campbell, b. Abt 1600, Glenurchy, Argyllshire, Scotland<br>
