1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == MARGARET DUNBAR lady of Clugston ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret Dunbar''' (d. circa 1552) was the daughter of Sir Patrick Dunbar of Clugston.1 She married Sir Alexander Stewart, 5th of Garlies, son of Sir Alexander Stewart, 4th of Garlies and Elizabeth Kennedy.1 She died circa 1552
2 CONC .1
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children of Margaret Dunbar and Sir Alexander Stewart, 5th of Garlies===
2 CONT * Sir Alexander Stewart of Garlies, younger+1 d. 1571
2 CONT * John Stewart2 d. 10 Aug 1592
2 CONT * Margaret Stewart1
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Citations===
2 CONT
