2 CONT ----------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=canucktwo&id=I13135
2 CONT
2 CONT ame: Margaret Dunbar Surname: Dunbar Given Name: Margaret Sex: F Birth: ABT 1511 in Clugston, Wigtownshire, Scotland Death: BEF 13 Apr 1552
2 CONT
2 CONT Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT     Sir Alexander Stewart married first, Katherine, daughter of Sir James Crichton of Cranstonriddel, as appears from a charter of Garlies granted to them on 12 July 1521, following on his own resignation with consent of his tutor
2 CONC , Archibald Stewart, parson of Kirkmaho.
2 CONT
2 CONT     He married secondly Margaret Dunbar, only daughter and heiress of Sir Patrick Dunbar of Clughstone. On 6 May 1532, she as his wife confirmed a charter to William Gordon of Craiglaw. Margaret Dunbar must have died before 13 Apr
2 CONC il 1532 when he married thirdly, Catherine, daughter of his cousin Walter Stewart of Barclye, who is styled his spouse in a charter of that date of the lands of Grenan.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Alexander and Margaret (Dunbar) Stewart had three children:
2 CONT
2 CONT     - Alexander (c.1527 to 9-4-1571) married Catherine Herries on 14 Feb 1551.
2 CONT
2 CONT     - John (c.1530 to 8-19-1592) married Margaret Stewart of Barclye.
2 CONT
2 CONT     - Margaret (c.1535) married Patrick McKie.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Patrick Dunbar of Clugstone b: ABT 1490 in Clugston, Wigtownshire, Scotland Mother: Margaret Vans of Barnbarroch b: ABT 1492
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Alexander Stewart (5th of Garlies) b: 1507 in Garlieston, Wigtownshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT     Married: ABT 1526 in Wigtownshire, Scotland 2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT     Has Children Alexander Stewart of Garlies b: ABT 1527 in Garlieston, Wigtownshire, Scotland
2 CONT     Has No Children John Stewart of Physgil b: ABT 1530 in Physgill, Wigtownshire, Scotland
2 CONT     Has No Children Margaret Stewart b: ABT 1535 in Garlieston, Wigtownshire, Scotland
2 CONT
