1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Notes for Elizabeth Dampier: Elizabeth Dampier was a cousin of Dampier the famous navigator who was born in East Oker, Near Yeovil, Somerset in 1652. The family originally hailed from the Dampierre in Normandy. At 
