1 NAME Thomas Dunbar of Mochrum
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1633
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1675
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT 87. <strong>Thomas Dunbar, of Mochrum</strong>, nat. circa 1630, the first son of John Dunbar, of Pankill (No. 86).
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Dunbar was put in possession of the Estate of Pankill in his father's lifetime, and was served heir to him in the Estate of Mochrum. by a precept from the Chancery, dated 20th October, 1661. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Christian, daughter of Major James Ross, of Balneil (and sister of Margaret, first Viscountess of Stair), by whom. he had issue a son and six daughters, viz. — 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Sir James Dunbar, born at Mochrum about Anno 1655. 
2 CONT * Sarah Dunbar, born at Mochrum about Anno 1657. She married Sir James Stewart, of Stenartfield. 
2 CONT * Margery Dunbar, born at Mochrum about Anno 166o. She married a Stewart of Fintallich. 
2 CONT * Margaret Dunbar, born at Mochrum about Anno 1662. She married a Ramsay of Boghouse. 
2 CONT * Nicholas Dunbar, born at Mochrum about Anno 1665, She married a Baillie, of Dunraggol.
2 CONT * Agnes Dunbar, born at Mochrum about Anno 1667. She married a Campbell. of Skeldon. 
2 CONT
2 CONT All of these daughters had issue. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Mary Dunbar, born at Mochrum about Anno 1670. She married a Hawthorn, of Aires, and had no issue. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Dunbar died about the beginning of the year 1675, and was succeeded by his only son.
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: Welles, Albert. [http://archive.org/stream/dunbarfamily00well#page/n59/mode/2up Dunbar family]. N.Y., Society Lib. 1880. page 238
