1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir Archibald Stewart, Baronet [S. 1687], of Burray</strong>, 1st s. and h., suc. to the Baronetcy, 13 May 1689 ; was M.P. [S.] for Orkney and Zetland, 1702-07. He m. Margaret, 1st da. of the Hon. Archibald Stuart, of Dun
2 CONC earn, co. Fife (yr. s. of James, Earl of Moray [S.]), by [ — ] da. of Sir John Henderson, of Fordel. He d. 1704. His widow m. David (Leslie), 5th Lord Lindores [S.] (who d. s.p. July 1719), and d. a few months after him, Oct. 1719
2 CONC ."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524408#page/n373/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1904; Vol. IV; page 355
