1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Through the tears I am letting you know that beautiful Beattie East, mom, grandmother, great-grandmother and great-great grandmother died last night (Saturday February 19th) at 9:15 pm. She planned her own journey 
2 CONC to end this life and carried her 3 daughters and grand-daughter, Lori with her on the trip. It took 5 1/2 weeks as we literally lived with her in her hospital room day and night. Then she was able to go on her own in her usual qui
2 CONC et, classy and polite manner. She will be missed so, so much by many.
2 CONT
2 CONT Esther, Linda, Debbie and Lori
