2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Elizabeth Baroness Campbell Somerville - Campbell (Archibald Campbell)
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Elizabeth Gillespie Billeasbuig Ruadh Master Campbell Van Lochow/campbell Master Of Campbell (born Somerville), William Somerville
2 CONT
