2 CONT ----------------------------------
2 CONT Agnes MACDONALD
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Birth: 1410, Dingwall, Cromarty, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Partnership with: John STEWART
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Child: Isabel STEWART Birth: 1435, Lorn, Argyllshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendants of Agnes MACDONALD
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 Agnes MACDONALD
2 CONT
