2 CONT
2 CONT       2 Isabel STEWART
2 CONT
2 CONT         =Colin of Argyll CAMPBELL
2 CONT
2 CONT             3 Archibald CAMPBELL
2 CONT
2 CONT               =Elizabeth STEWART
