2 CONT '''22 February 1600: Charter by Torquil Makcloid of Lewis to Donald McAngus of Glengarrie and Katherine McIntosche his spouse, in conjunct fee and to the heirs of their bodies whom failing to the heirs and assignees of the said Do
2 CONC nald whomsoever, of the town and lands of Ullobill in the barony of Cogeache and shire of Inverness. To be held by the said Donald and his foresaids in feu heritage and blench farm for payment to the King and his successors of a p
2 CONC enny Scots yearly in name of blench farm if asked only. Dated at Inverness. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD305%2f1%2f28%2f4&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=&ko=a&r=GD305%2f1%2f28%2f4+&ro
