1 NOTE {geni:about_me} styled "of Hedderwick"
2 CONT --------
2 CONT '''JOHN, SECOND LORD OLIPHANT''', who m. Lady Elizabetth Campbell, third daughter of Colin, first Earl of Argyle, and had two sons, Colin. - Laurence, abott of Inchaffray, who fell at [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Flodd
2 CONC en '''Flodden''']<br/>
2 CONT '''Note:''' [https://www.geni.com/people/Colin-Oliphant-Master-of-Oliphant/6000000002188088804 '''Colin Oliphant, Master of Oliphant''']  died from Battle wounds at Flodden
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://books.google.com/books?id=FBtVAAAAcAAJ&pg=PA494&lpg=PA494&dq=Laurence+Oliphant,+Abbot+of+Inchaffray&source=bl&ots=puMumYXzTn&sig=ORly3ur2RX41YbZu5u7PGJn-oKk&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiIsZ2DztfdAhUh8YMKHdsWATEQ6AEwBnoECAYQAQ#v
2 CONC =onepage&q=Laurence%20Oliphant%2C%20Abbot%20of%20Inchaffray&f=false '''A Genealogical and Heraldic History of the Landed Gentry; Or ..., Volume 1'''] page 494<br/>
2 CONT '''OLIPHANT, OF CONDIE.'''
2 CONT
