2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == [http://www.thepeerage.com/p10921.htm#i109206 BIOGRAPHY COPIED FROM DARRYL LUNDY'S PEERAGE] ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Elizabeth Stuart was the daughter of John Stuart, 1st Earl of Lennox and Margaret Montgomerie.2,1 She married Archibald Campbell, 2nd Earl of Argyll, son of Colin Campbell, 1st Earl of Argyll and Isabel Stewart.3
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Stuart and Archibald Campbell, 2nd Earl of Argyll
2 CONT
