2 CONT Janet Campbell
2 CONT
2 CONT married to John Stewart, 2nd Earl of Atholl
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#John2Atholldied1521
2 CONT
2 CONT JOHN Stewart, son of Sir JOHN Stewart of Balveny 1st Earl of Atholl & his second wife Eleanor Sinclair (-1521). 2nd Earl of Atholl.
2 CONT
2 CONT m JANET Campbell, daughter of ARCHIBALD Campbell 2nd Earl of Argyll & his wife Elizabeth Stewart of the Earls of Lennox (-[2 Feb 1546]).
2 CONT
2 CONT Earl John & his wife had six children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. HELEN (-1577).
2 CONT
2 CONT m firstly JOHN 5th Lord Lindsay (-1562). m secondly THOMAS Morieux .
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. JEAN .
2 CONT
2 CONT m (1507) JAMES Arbuthnott of Arbuthnott (-before 1521).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. ELIZABETH .
2 CONT
2 CONT m (1538) KENNETH Mackenzie of Kinkall (-1568).
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. JOHN (6 Oct 1507-[Nov] 1542). 3rd Earl of Atholl.
2 CONT
2 CONT m firstly (1521) GRIZEL Rattray, daughter of Sir JOHN Rattray of that Ilk & his wife --- (-after 1533).
2 CONT
2 CONT m secondly (1541) as her first husband, JEAN, daughter of JOHN 6th Lord Forbes & his third wife Elizabeth Lady Elphinstone née Barlow. She married secondly (after 17 Nov 1545) Alexander Hay of Dalgety, and thirdly (before 17 Jan 1
2 CONC 550) as his first wife, William Leslie of Balquhar. Earl John & his first wife had eight children:
2 CONT
2 CONT a) BARBARA .
2 CONT
2 CONT m (1536) JAMES Menzies .
2 CONT
2 CONT b) ISABEL .
2 CONT
2 CONT m (1552) WILLIAM Stuart of Grandtully.
2 CONT
2 CONT c) MARGARET (-1540).
2 CONT
2 CONT m (1539) JOHN Grant Lord of Freuchie.
2 CONT
2 CONT d) HELEN . m JOHN Macfarlane .
2 CONT
2 CONT e) JOHN (-Stirling 24 Apr 1579, bur Edinburgh St Giles´s Church). 4th Earl of Atholl.
2 CONT
2 CONT m firstly (before 26 May 1547) ELIZABETH Gordon, daughter of GEORGE Gordon 4th Earl of Huntly & his wife Elizabeth Keith.
2 CONT
2 CONT m secondly (contract 1 Apr 1557) as her third husband, MARGARET, widow firstly of ROBERT Graham Lord Graham and secondly of THOMAS Erskine Master of Erskine, daughter of MALCOLM 3rd Lord Fleming & his wife Joan Stewart [of Scotlan
2 CONC d] (-after 15 Aug 1584). Earl John & his first wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) ELIZABETH (-1595).
2 CONT
2 CONT m firstly (1567) HUGH Fraser 5th Lord Lovat (-1577).
2 CONT
2 CONT m secondly (1578, divorced 1581) ROBERT Stuart Earl of Lennox [Bishop of Caithness].
2 CONT
2 CONT m thirdly (1581) JAMES Stuart Earl of Arran, son of ANDREW Stewart 2nd Lord Ochiltree & his wife Agnes Cuningham (-1595).
2 CONT
2 CONT Earl John & his second wife had five children:
2 CONT
2 CONT ii) MARGARET . m (before 1578) GEORGE Abernethy 7th Lord Saltoun .
2 CONT
2 CONT iii) JEAN (-1593). m (1573) Sir DUNCAN Campbell of Glenorchy (-1631).
2 CONT
2 CONT iv) JOHN (Dunkeld 22 May 1563-Perth 25 Aug 1595). 5th Earl of Atholl.
2 CONT
2 CONT m (Perth 24 Jan 1580) as her first husband, MARY Ruthven, daughter of WILLIAM Ruthven 1st Earl Gowrie & his wife Dorothea Stewart of Methven. She married secondly (contract 31 Mar 1596) as his second wife, John Stewart Earl of Ath
2 CONC oll. Earl John & his wife had five children:
2 CONT
2 CONT (a) MARGARET (-young).
2 CONT
