2 CONT
2 CONT ''Lady'' '''Isabel Campbell''' was the daughter of Archibald Campbell, 2nd Earl of Argyll and Elizabeth Stuart.1 She married Gilbert Kennedy, 2nd Earl of Cassillis, son of Sir David Kennedy, 1st Earl of Cassillis and Agnes Borthwi
2 CONC ck.1  As a result of her marriage, Lady Isabel Campbell was styled as ''Countess of Cassillis''.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Isabel Campbell and Gilbert Kennedy, 2nd Earl of Cassillis
2 CONT * Janet Kennedy+ d. 1566  
2 CONT * Gilbert Kennedy, 3rd Earl of Cassillis+ b. 1515, d. 28 Nov 15581 
2 CONT
