1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT === Catherine Maxwell1 
2 CONT * F, #108227
2 CONT * Last Edited=30 Oct 2018
2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine Maxwell was the daughter of Herbert Maxwell, 1st Lord Maxwell and unknown daughter Herries.1,2 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Gilbert Kennedy of Dunure, 1st Lord Kennedy, son of Sir James Kennedy of Dunure, younger and Lady Mary Stewart, circa 1440.1
2 CONT
2 CONT She was also known as Katherine Maxwell.2 From circa 1440, her married name became Kennedy.2,1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Catherine Maxwell and Gilbert Kennedy of Dunure, 1st Lord Kennedy
2 CONT
2 CONT # Catherine Kennedy+
2 CONT # Agnes Kennedy+3
2 CONT # James Kennedy, 2nd of Row3
2 CONT # Walter Kennedy4
2 CONT # John Kennedy, 2nd Lord Kennedy+1 b. b 12 Oct 1454, d. bt 24 Jul 1508 - 13 May 1509
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
