1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === Elizabeth Hepburn, of Hailes
2 CONT * Father 	Adam Hepburn, of Hailes 
2 CONT * Mother 	Janet Borthwick 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Married
2 CONT # Alexander Montgomery, Master of Montgomery  
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 	
2 CONT *  	1. Robert Montgomery, of Braidstone
2 CONT * >	2. Hugh Montgomery, of Hessilheid (Hazelhead)
2 CONT * >	3. Margaret Montgomery
2 CONT * >	4. Alexander Montgomery, 2nd Lord, b. Abt 1455
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT When Lady Elizabeth "Eliza" Hepburn was born about 1420, in Hailes Castle, Haddingtonshire, Scotland, her father, Sir Adam de Hepburn, Master of Hailes, was 39 and her mother, Janet Borthwick, was 33. She married Alexander Montgom
2 CONC ery in 1444, in Eaglesham, Renfrewshire, Scotland, United Kingdom. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 1 daughter. She died in 1495, in North Ayrshire, Scotland, United Kingdom, at the age of 76, and was buried in Kirknew
2 CONC ton and East Calder, Midlothian, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Found on Family Search
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
