2 CONT      Margaret Montgomerie is the daughter of Alexander Montgomerie, Master of Montgomerie and Elizabeth Hepburn.2 She married Alexander Home, 1st Lord Home, son of Sir Alexander Home of Home and Dunglas and Janet Hay, before 1461.
2 CONC 3 She married John Stuart, 1st Earl of Lennox, son of Sir Alan Stuart of Darnley and Catherine Seton, in 1460.2
