2 CONC er husband gave ger sasine of the lands of Langshaw and others on 10 September 1459. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD3%2f1%2f1%2f41%2f8&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=margaret+montgomer
