1 NAME Robert /Bruce of Airth/
2 GIVN Robert
2 SURN Bruce of Airth
2 _MARNM Bruce of Airth
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1505
1 DEAT
2 DATE BEF 14 NOV 1561
1 TITL Sir
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == ROBERT BRUCE OF AIRTH ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[23 March 1529]: Dispensation in form of apostolic letters by Antonius, cardinal of the Four Crowned Saints, in favour of Robert Bruce of Artht and Marion [or Marjorie] Bruce, for their marriage, in spite of fact that they are 
2 CONC related in third and fourth degrees of affinity, by her relationship to Margaret Schaw who has known said Robert carnally. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD37%2f358&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=
2 CONC n&tp=n&k=margaret+schaw&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Bruce family of Airth, reference GD37/358]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1 July 1547: Charter under the Great Seal of Scotland which confirmed possession of two bovates of the land of Airth, and other lands, to Alexander Bruce and his wife Jonete Levingstoun. Alexander is identified as the son and a
2 CONC pparent heir of Robert Bruce of Airth, who had previously resigned these lands in favour of his son. Robert Bruce of Airth reserved his own liferent and that of his wife Mariote Bruce. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi
2 CONC 04scot/page/29/mode/1up RMS 1546-80: charter number 118]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence cited in the Bruces of Airth and their Cadets ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''14 May 1548:  Charter by Robert Bruce of Airth to Robert Bruce, his son and apparent heir, and Jonet Livingston his spouse, of the Mill of Airth, reserving Robert's liferent, and a terce to " Mariote Bruce spouse mee moderne." 
2 CONC At Airth, Witnesses, Mr. Thomas Bruys, James Brus, etc. [https://archive.org/details/brucesofairththe00arms/page/n380/mode/1up The Bruces of Airth: xxxiii]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biographical Summaries Follow ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert Bruce of Airth1
2 CONT *M, #185116
2 CONT *Last Edited=19 Mar 2008
2 CONT *'''     Robert Bruce of Airth is the son of Sir Robert Bruce of Airth and Eupheme Montgomerie.1 He married, firstly, Janet Forrester, daughter of Sir Walter Forrester of Carden.1 He married, secondly, Marion Bruce, daughter of Si
2 CONC r David Bruce of Clackmannan and Janet Blackadder.1
2 CONT *'''Child of Robert Bruce of Airth and Janet Forrester
2 CONT ** 1.Sir Alexander Bruce of Airth+1
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S37] Volume 1, page 547. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p18512.htm#i185116 ______________________
2 CONT *	'Bruce08'I
2 CONT * Families covered: Bruce of Airth, Bruce of Kinnaird, Bruce of Stenhouse
2 CONT * Most of the upper section of this page was previously within the old version of Bruce02. It was redone in June 2007 as part of a review of various Bruce families. See here for more details.
2 CONT *Sir Edward Bruce of Airth
2 CONT *  m. (by 1417) Agnes Airth (dau of Sir William Airth of Airth) 
2 CONT **	1. Sir Robert Bruce of Airth (d 01.1450) 
2 CONT **	  m. Janet Livingston (dau of Sir Alexander Livingston of Callendar)
2 CONT ***		A. Sir Alexander Bruce of Airth and Stenhouse (d 1488) 
2 CONT ***		  m. Margaret or Janet Forrester (dau of Sir Malcolm Forrester, 3rd of Torwood)
2 CONT ****			i. John Bruce of Stenhouse (dvp by 1483) 
2 CONT ****			   m. (1471) Elizabeth Menteith (dau of William Menteith of Kerse) 
2 CONT *****				a. Sir Robert Bruce of Airth and Stenhouse (d 10.1513) 
2 CONT *****				  m. Euphemia Montgomery (dau of Alexander Montgomery, 2nd Lord) 
2 CONT ******'''					(1) Robert Bruce of Airth (d by 14.11.1561) 
2 CONT ******'''					  m1. (by 09.09.1523) Janet Forrester (dau of Sir Walter Forrester of Carden) 
2 CONT *******						(A) Sir Alexander Bruce of Airth (d 16.03.1600)
2 CONT *******						  m. Janet Livingston (d 04.10.1599, dau of Alexander Livingston, 5th Lord) 
2 CONT ******** .... etc.
2 CONT *******                                            (B) Robert Bruce, 1st of Baldrig had issue
2 CONT *******                                              m. Helen Drummond (dau. of Sir Alexander Drummond, 1st of Medhope
2 CONT *******                                            (C) James Bruce 'of Newburn (Newbirnie)' (d 04.1610)
2 CONT *******                                              m. Catherine or Jean Hamilton
2 CONT ********  .... etc.
2 CONT *******                                            (D) John Bruce had issue
2 CONT *******                                            (E) Andrew Bruce
2 CONT *******                                              m. Margaret Duddingston
2 CONT *******                                            (F) Margaret Bruce
2 CONT ******'''					  m2. Marion Bruce (d 05.1575, dau of David Bruce, 7th of Clackmannan)
2 CONT ******					(2) Thomas Bruce, 1st of Larbertscheills "had numerous issue"
2 CONT ******                                        m. Elizabeth Auchmuthie
2 CONT ******			        	(3) Janet Bruce probably of this generation
2 CONT ******			         	  m. (mcrt 16.10.1504) William Livingston of Kilsyth (d before 21.07.1545)
2 CONT *****				b. .... etc.
2 CONT *Main source(s): BP1934 (Bruce of Stenhouse), RedBookScot (Perthshire, Bruce of Airth + Bruce of Kinnaird (1st Family))
2 CONT *From: Stirnet.com ________________________
