2 CONT *'''ACCORDING TO THE OTHER REFERENCES THIS ROBERT & HIS LISTED FATHER ARE THE SAME PERSON & WAS MARRIED TO BOTH MARIOTA/JANET FORRESTER AND MARION BRUCE
