2 CONT *'''     Robert Bruce was born at of Airth, Stirlingshire, Scotland.1 He married Marion Bruce, daughter of Sir David Bruce, Baron O'Lack Manor and Janet Blackadder, before 1 July 1547.1 Robert Bruce died before 6 December 1561.1
