2 CONT == Second Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marian Montgomery, here treated, married William, Lord Semple. [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun07paul#page/536/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VII: pp. 536-37] She is noticed as Dame Marioun Montgomery, Lady Semple, on 2
2 CONC 1 June 1547, [https://archive.org/details/scottishrecordso45scotuoft/page/24/mode/1up Hunter Papers: pp. 24-5] and as Dame Mariota Montgomery, Lady Symple on 8 November 1555. [https://archive.org/details/criminaltrialsin01pitc/pag
2 CONC e/n428/mode/1up Ancient Criminal Trials I - II: 381*]'''
2 CONT
