2 CONT '''Generation No. 16. Robert Crawford (Malcolm, Malcolm, John, Roger ,Malcolm, Roger, Reginald, John, Reginald, Galfridus, Johannes (John), Reginald, Reginald, Domincus, Reginald, Alan) was born 1480 in Kilbirine, Ayrshire, Scotla
2 CONC nd, and died 1513 Kilbirine, Ayrshire, Scotland. He married Margaret Semple/ Semphill the daughter of Thomas Semple/Semphill.'''
