2 CONC ) James Hamilton, 1st of Stonehouse (d 1548, younger of Raploch) m3. (sp) [https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-Patrick-Learmonth-of-Dairsie-Kt/6000000034912372749 Sir Patrick Learmonth of Dairsie] (d by 1593, 'Provost for Life' of St.
2 CONC  Andrews) comment: it appears this marriage never happened, Isobel Balfour was Sir Patrick's wife according to [https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi05scot#page/97/mode/1up Great Seal Register, charter 298] in 1581
