2 CONT # [http://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ww/wallace03.php Stirnet: Wallace 03] membership needed to view (i)	[https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-William-Wallace-of-Craigie-12th-of-Craigie/6000000001745181417 Sir William Wallace o
2 CONC f Craigie] (b c1507, d 1538)	m1. Margaret Kennedy (dau of Alexander Kennedy of Bargany) m2. (1532) Grisel Sempill (d 10.1575, dau of Robert Sempill, 3rd Lord) comment: it appears this marriage never happened, Margaret Kennedy was 
2 CONC Sir Williams's widow according to [https://archive.org/stream/bookofwallace01roge#page/n115/mode/2up/search/Glencairn Book of Wallace]
