2 CONT
2 CONT '''Quintin Mure of Aird married Lady Katherine Kennedy (contract 4 October 1510). He and his wife had a precept of sasine for the lands of Kilmore on 7 January 1510-11. They had one child, a daughter named Margaret who was married
2 CONC  first to Neil Montgomery of Lainshaw, and second to John Kennedy of Skeldon. [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun02paul#page/461/mode/1up The Scots Peerage, page 461]'''
