2 CONT                    1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1 September 1570: Assignation by Hugh Montgomery, Laird of Stane in favour of Hugh, Earl of Eglinton of a reversion by Hugh Montgomery of Auchinhuid and Bessie Blair, hi spouse for redemption of an annualrent of 20 merks furth 
2 CONC of the two merk land of Bowhouse lying within the lordship of Stane on payment of 100 merks dated at Irvine 24 March 1572; another reversion made by Hugh Montgomery of Auchinhuid and his spouse to Hugh Montgomery, Laird of Stane a
2 CONC nd his spouse, their heirs and assignees for redemption of an annualrent of 20 merks Scots furth of the said lands upon payment of 200 merks. Dated at Irvine, 8 Sept 1570 and a reversion granted by William Berclay of Perstoun and 
2 CONC Margaret Montgomery, his spouse made to unquhile Arthur Montgomery, Laird of Stane for the redemption of the 20s land called Fensydik and Litilbrydis Kirk on payment of 8 score merks dated [ ] 1546. Date of the assignation at Egli
2 CONC nton. Witnesses: Gawand Baillie in Garthamlock, son of Alexander Baillie of Carfyn, Hugh Montgomery, sometime of the Gard and others. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD3%2f1%2f1%2f66&
2 CONC st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=+Auchinhuid&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Montgomerie Family, Earls of Eglinton, reference GD3/1/1/66]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''8 September 1570: Letter of reversion granted by Hugh Montgomery of Achinheid and Bessie Blair his spouse whereby they declare that notwithstanding Hugh Montgomery of Stane and Marion Montgomery his spouse had infeft them in a 
2 CONC yearly annualrent of 20 merks furth of the two merk land of Bowhous, yet on Hugh Montgomery of Stane paying to them 200 merks Scots on the high altar of the parish church of Irvine, on a warning of 40 days before any of the feasts
2 CONC  of Whitsunday or Martinmas they would discharge the said annualrent. Dated at Irvine. Witnesses: Laurence Lyn of Bourtreehill and others. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD3%2f1%2f10
2 CONC %2f15%2f2&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=bessie+blair&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=yNational Records of Scotland, Papers of the Montgomerie Family, Earls of Eglinton, reference  GD3/1/10/15/2]'''
