2 CONT
2 CONT '''22 June 1584: nstrument of sasine following on GD3/1/7/7/11 in favour of Robert Montgomery as heir of his father in the lands of Lochliboside reserving the liferent, Hugh Montgomery, younger of Auchinhuid, baillie. Dated at Tho
2 CONC rntonburn in Lochliboside John Mor, notary. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD3%2f1%2f7%2f7%2f12&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=+Auchinhuid&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of S
2 CONC cotland, Papers of the Montgomerie Family, Earls of Eglinton, reference GD3/1/7/7/12]'''
