1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == JONET KENNEDY Lady of Caldwell ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jonet Kennedy, here treated, is the sister of https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Kennedy-of-Bargany/6000000011616285594. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD60%2f18&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn
2 CONC =n&tp=n&k=jonet+kennedy&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1600&di=n NRS: GD60/18]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jonet Kennedy, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/John-Mure-of-Caldwell/6000000010437836860?through=6000000198969330867. [https://archive.org/details/selectionsfromfa01mait/page/13/mode/1up Caldwell Papers I: 13]
2 CONC  They are noticed as man and wife on 16 August 1559.  [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD60%2f18&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=jonet+kennedy&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1600&di=n NRS: GD60/18]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Children ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # ''' https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Mure-of-Caldwell/6000000003043297800?through=6000000198969330867 '''
