2 CONC y, x ll, assedatur Johanni Murray de Hangandschaw et Jonete Forester sponse sue pro terminis ut supra, inde pecunia ut in margine, gressuma x ll., cum serviciis consuetis. [https://archive.org/details/exchequerrollsof10scot/page/7
