2 CONC Home, Master of Wedderburn and Elizabeth Carmichael, before 24 March 1490) 2) [https://www.geni.com/people/Janet-Schaw/6000000000769956422?through=6000000147594922821 Janet Shaw] married [https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-Archibald-
2 CONC Edmonstone-of-Duntreath-Kt/6000000000769956412?through=6000000000769956422 Sir Archibald Edmonstone], 3rd Laird Edmonstone, son of Sir William Edmonstone and Matilda Stewart.1 Janet Shaw was born circa 1455 at of Sauchie, Clackman
2 CONC nan, Scotland 3) Joan Shaw+3 b. c 1495 (??) m William Wallace, Laird of Johnston & Auchenbathie-Wallace (son of John Wallace and Catherine Cunningham, circa 1519 at Scotland.1)
