2 CONT ** 	i.	William Graham, 2nd Lord (d 1472)	m. (by 1460) Helen Douglas (dau of 2nd Earl of Angus)
2 CONT *** 	a.	William Graham, 1st Earl of Montrose (b 1463/4, d Flodden 09.09.1513)	m1. (25.11.1479) Annabel Drummond (dau of John Drummond, 1st Lord)
2 CONT ****(3)	Elizabeth Graham	-- 	Elizabeth is shown by BP1934 as by her father's 2nd marriage but both TSP (Montrose) and TCP (Drummond) identify her mother as Annabel Drummond.	m. (02.1513-4) Walter, Master of Drummond (d 1518)
