2 CONT Citations
2 CONT 1.[S746] Unknown author, Lineage and Ancestry of HRH Prince Charles by Paget, Vol. II, p. 249.
2 CONT 2.[S11649] Clan MacFarlane & Associated Clans Genealogy.
