1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == LADY JANET STEWART Lady Ross of Hawkhead ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Disputed Ancestry'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''The ancestry of Lady Janet Stewart, here treated, has not been satisfactorily identified. For example, according to Daryll Lundy's Peerage, she was the daughter of Matthew Stewart, 2nd Earl of Lennox. [https://www.t
2 CONC hepeerage.com/p525.htm#i5247 Darryl Lundy's Peerage] This proposition is followed by [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ninian_Ross,_3rd_Lord_Ross Wikipedia] and [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Stuart-1320 Wikitree] However, according 
2 CONC to Sir William Fraser, Lady Janet Stewart, here treated, was the daughter of John Stewart, Earl of Lennox. [https://archive.org/details/lennoxvol1memov100fras/page/329/mode/1up The Lennox I: 329] This view was supported by A. Fran
2 CONC cis Steuart, writing in his account of the family of Ross, Lord Ross, [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun07pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun07pauluoft/page/251/mode/1up The Scots Peerage V: 251-2] and Evelyn G. M. Carmichael, wr
2 CONC iting in an account of the family of Stewart, Duke of Lennox. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun05paul/page/350/mode/1up The Scots Peerage V: 350]'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Fake Genealogy'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''According to Wikitree, Lady Janet Stewart, here treated, the first wife of https://www.geni.com/people/Ninian-Ross-3rd-Lord-Ross-of-Hawkhead/6000000003646015147?through=6000000078406505695, was previously married to
2 CONC  https://www.geni.com/people/John-Mure-of-Caldwell/6000000002881023204?through=6000000003275349031. [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Stuart-1320 Wikitree] For the following reason this is wrong. Lady Janet Stewart, here treated, pro
2 CONC bably died before 9 December 1523 and https://www.geni.com/people/Jonet-Stewart/6000000003275349031?through=6000000002881023204 the wife of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Mure-of-Caldwell/6000000002881023204?through=600000000327
2 CONC 5349031 was still alive on 25 June 1546. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD19%2f7&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=roger+kirkpatrick&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1500&dt=1590&di=n NRS: GD19/7]'''</blockq
2 CONC uote>
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''It follows, therefore, that Lady Janet Stewart, here treated, is not the same person as https://www.geni.com/people/Jonet-Stewart/6000000003275349031 '''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death == 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Janet Stewart, here treated, probably died before 9 December 1523, the date upon which her husband, Ninian, Lord Ross of Hawkhead and Melville, was contracted to marry https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Ruthven-Countess
2 CONC -of-Erroll/6000000002187985208.  [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04paul#page/259/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 259]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Janet Stewart, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Ninian-Ross-3rd-Lord-Ross-of-Hawkhead/6000000003646015147?through=6000000078406505695. [https://archive.org/details/lennoxvol1memov100fras/page/329/mode/1up 
2 CONC The Lennox I: 329]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Stuart-1320 Flawed Biographical Summary by Wikitree] ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Janet (Stuart) Ross (1498 - 1523) Privacy Level: Open (White) Janet Ross formerly Stuart aka Mure Born 1498 in Renfrewshire, Scotlandmap ANCESTORS ancestors Daughter of Matthew (Stewart) Stuart and Margaret (Lyle) Stuart Sister
2 CONC  of John (Stewart) Stuart [half], Catherine Stewart [half], Margaret (Stuart) Fleming [half], Elizabeth Stewart [half], Margaret (Stewart) Fraser [half], William Stuart [half], Mungo Stewart [half] and Agnes Stewart [half] Wife of
2 CONC  John Mure — married 1503 in Lennox, Stirlingshire, Scotlandmap Wife of Ninian Ross — married 15 Nov 1515 in , Lanarkshire, , Scotlandmap DESCENDANTS descendants Mother of William Mure, John Mure, Robert Ross and James Ross Died 1
2 CONC 2 Dec 1523 in , , Scotlandmap Profile manager: John Hunter private message [send private message] Profile last modified 18 May 2019 | Created 31 Mar 2013 This page has been accessed 1,622 times. Contents [hide] 1 Biography 1.1 Not
2 CONC e 2 Sources 3 Acknowledgments Biography Janet Stewart was the daughter of Matthew Stuart, 11th Earl of Lennox and Margaret Lyle. She married Ninian Ross, 3rd Lord Ross of Halkhead, son of John Ross, 2nd Lord Ross of Halkhead, befo
2 CONC re 15 November 1515.1 She died before 12 December 1523. She is more usually described as a daughter of John, 1st Earl of Lennox, but Cockayne concludes she is more likely a daughter of Matthew "for chronological reasons."'''
