2 CONT '''Hugh Ross is the son of https://www.geni.com/people/Ninian-Ross-3rd-Lord-Ross-of-Hawkhead/6000000003646015147?through=6000000221747743843. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun07pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun07pauluoft/page/
2 CONC 252/mode/1up The Scots Peerage: 252] The name of his mother has not been satisfactorily identified. [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/qr/ross03.php Stirnet: Ross 03] He was a witness to a contract by Lord Ross on 11 Nove
2 CONC mber 1573. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun07pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun07pauluoft/page/252/mode/1up The Scots Peerage: 252]'''
