2 CONT  	3. Marjory Edmonstone,   d. Yes, date unknown
2 CONT  	4. Helen Edmonstone,   d. Yes, date unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 2 	Margaret Colquhoun,   d. Duntreath, Stirling, Scotland  Marriage Contract 	Dec 1585  	Glasgow, Lanarkshire, Scotland  Married 	1585-1586 
