2 CONC ve and to hold of the Superior. Dated at Stirling and Duntreath and registered in the Books of Council and Session, 18 July 1611.Witnesses: Robert Edmestoun, son lawful to Sir James Edmestoun of Duntreath, knight, Mr James Stirlin
2 CONC g, minister at Strablane and others. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD3%2f1%2f1%2f2%2f8&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=james+edmestoun&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1601&dt=1650&di=n National Records o
