1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''(Miss) Buchanan1 
2 CONT *''''''F, #66828, b. circa 1510
2 CONT *Father      Patrick Buchanan1 b. c 1460
2 CONT *Mother     Marion (Margaret) Campbell2
2 CONT *''''''     (Miss) Buchanan was born circa 1510 at of Buchanan, Stirlingshire, Scotland.1,2 She married Duncan Campbell, Capt. of Castle Sween, son of Archibald Campbell and Margaret Campbell, circa 1539.1,2
2 CONT *''''''Family      Duncan Campbell, Capt. of Castle Sween b. c 1511, d. 3 Oct 1594
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S147] Burke's Genealogical and Heraldic History of the Peerage, Baronetage, and Knightage, 1938 ed., by Sir Bernard Burke, p., 480.
2 CONT * 2.[S11649] Clan MacFarlane & Associated Clans Genealogy.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2224.htm#i66828
2 CONT *_______________
2 CONT *''''''unknown daughter Buchanan1 
2 CONT *F, #200878
2 CONT *Last Edited=17 Jul 2006 
2 CONT *''''''     unknown daughter Buchanan is the daughter of Patrick Buchanan of that Ilk.2 She married Duncan Campbell, son of Archibald Campbell of Auchinbreck and Kilmichael and Margaret Campbell of Ardkinglass.1
2 CONT *''''''      Her married name became Campbell.1
2 CONT *''''''Child of unknown daughter Buchanan and Duncan Campbell
2 CONT ** 1.Duncan Campbell+2 d. 1594
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 1, page 666. Hereinafter cited as Burke's P
2 CONC eerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT * 2.[S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p20088.htm#i200878
2 CONT *________
2 CONT *From: Stirnet
2 CONT * 'Buchanan02'
2 CONT *Patrick Buchanan of that ilk, 13th of Buchanan (d before 07.1477)
2 CONT *m. Jonet Cunynghame
2 CONT *Patrick's wife if identified by BLG1962 as the daughter and heiress of Galbraith of Killearn, Balmois, etc.
2 CONT **1. Walter Buchanan of that ilk, 14th of Buchanan (d 1526)
2 CONT **   m. (before 26.11.1463) Isabelle Graham (dau of William Graham, 2nd Lord)
2 CONT ***	A. Patrick Buchanan, younger of Buchanan (dvp before 09.03.1502-3)
2 CONT ***	   m. _ Campbell (dau of Earl of Argyll) suggested by BLG1952
2 CONT ****		i. George Buchanan of that ilk, 15 Buchanan (d 1561)
2 CONT ****		m1. Margaret Edmonstone (dau of Sir Archibald Edmonstone, 3rd of Duntreath)
2 CONT ****		m2. Janet Cunynghame
2 CONT ****		ii. Walter Buchanan (a 1539)
2 CONT ****		The following were reported by BLG1952 but not by 'Strathendrick'
2 CONT ****''''''		iii. daughter
2 CONT ****''''''		   m. Duncan Campbell of Auchinbreck, Captain of Castleswene (d 1594)
2 CONT ****		iv. daughter
2 CONT ****		   m. laird of Calder
2 CONT *Main sources:
2 CONT *(1) "Strathendrick and its Inhabitants from Early Times" by John Guthrie Smith, published in Glasgow in 1896
2 CONT *(2) BLG1952 (Murray-Buchanan of Leny).
