2 CONT '''14 January 1613: Charter under the Great Seal of Scotland which confirms possession of certain lands to Alexander Menteith, including the forty shilling land of Cammusbeg-Wester, located in the Stewartry of Menteith and sheriff
2 CONC dom of Perth, which had previously been resigned by Archibald Edmonstoun of Ballintone, his wife Marjorie Edmonstoun, and his eldest son and apparent heir John Edmonstoun: "quas Arch. Edmonstoun de Ballintone et Marjoria Edmonstou
2 CONC n ejus sponsa et Jo. E. eorum filius natu maximus et heres apparens resignaverunt". [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi07scot/page/296/mode/1up RMS 1609-20: charter number 797]
