2 CONC reasurer of Scotland, vol. 7 (1907), 140. ^ Register of the Privy Seal of Scotland, vol. 5 part 1 (1957), p.644 no.2245. ^ Wood, vol. 1 (1923), 245-7. ^ Maitland, (1829), 42. ^ A Diurnal of Remarkable Occurents in Scotland, Bannat
