2 CONT
2 CONT From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Hugh Semphill:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p11037.htm#i110363
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh Sempill, 5th Lord Sempill [1]
2 CONT *M, #110363, 
2 CONT *b. 1592, 
2 CONT *d. 19 September 1639
2 CONT *Last Edited=16 Jan 2011
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.54%
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh Sempill, 5th Lord Sempill was born in 1592.[1],[2] He was the son of Robert Sempill, 4th Lord Sempill and Lady Agnes Montgomerie.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, firstly, Lady Anne Hamilton, daughter of James Hamilton, 1st Earl of Abercorn and Marion Boyd, circa 7 November 1611.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, secondly, Lady Elizabeth Hay, daughter of Francis Hay, 9th Earl of Erroll and Elizabeth Douglas, circa 27 November 1620.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 19 September 1639.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He gained the title of 5th Lord Sempill.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Hugh Sempill, 5th Lord Sempill and Lady Anne Hamilton
2 CONT *1. Marion Sempill+[2] b. 1617, d. 1706
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Hugh Sempill, 5th Lord Sempill and Lady Elizabeth Hay
2 CONT *1. Francis Sempill, 6th Lord Sempill [3] b. c 1622, d. 3 Nov 1644
2 CONT *2. Robert Sempill, 7th Lord Sempill+[3] b. a 1622, d. Jan 1674/75
2 CONT *3. Archibald Sempill+[4] b. c 1635
2 CONT
