2 CONT Giles Boyd [1]
2 CONT *F, #21514
2 CONT *Last Edited=15 Jan 2008
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=6.31%
2 CONT
2 CONT Giles Boyd married Hugh Montgomerie, 4th Earl of Eglinton, son of Hugh Montgomerie, 3rd Earl of Eglinton and Agnes Drummond, between 13 May 1576 and 20 May 1576.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She is the daughter of Robert Boyd, 5th Lord Boyd of Kilmarnock and Margaret Colquhoun.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT From between 13 May 1576 and 20 May 1576, her married name became Montgomerie.[1] As a result of her marriage, Giles Boyd was styled as Countess of Eglinton on 3 June 1585.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Giles Boyd and Hugh Montgomerie, 4th Earl of Eglinton
