2 CONC led of Craigneill, then her spouse and also with the consent of Josias Stewart of Bonytoun as Principal and Hugh Kennedy of Girvanmaynes as Cautioner in favour of Alexander, Earl of Eglinton as heir of tailzie and provision to dec
2 CONC eased Hugh, 5th Earl of Eglinton, of annualrent from the Barony of Ardrossan [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD3%2f1%2f1%2f1%2f9&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=helen+kennedy&ko=p&r=&ro=s&d
