2 CONC  of Eglinton 1588–1661 Sir Thomas Seton 1589–1609 John Seton 1591–1634 Hugh Seton 1593–1669 Margaret Seton 1595–Deceased Margaret Seton 1595–Deceased Agnes Seton Deceased John Seton Deceased
