2 CONC ell of Loudoun, and 1st dau. of Sir Matthew Campbell of Loudoun by his wife Isabel Drummond, dau. of Sir John Drummond of Innerpeffrey, and had issue:
2 CONT *1a. '''Margaret Montgomerie (b. c. 1590; dsp. 1616),''' 
