2 CONT == [http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1258.htm#i37781 BIOGRAPHICAL SUMMARY BY OUR ROYAL ANCESTORS] ==
2 CONT
2 CONT *''''''Margaret Douglas1,2,3,4 
2 CONT *''''''F, #37781, d. after 24 May 1579
2 CONT *Father      James Douglas, 3rd Earl Morton2,3,4 d. b 4 Nov 1550
2 CONT *Mother     Catherine Stewart2,3,4 d. a 22 Apr 1543
2 CONT *     Margaret Douglas married James Hamilton, 2nd Earl Arran, Duc de Chatellerault, Regent of Scotland, son of Sir James Hamilton, 2nd Lord Hamilton, 1st Earl of Arran and Janet Beaton, circa 23 September 1532; They had 5 sons (J
2 CONC ames, 3rd Earl of Arran; Gavin; John, 1st Marquess of Hamilton; David; & Claude (Lord Paisley) & 3 daughters (Barbara, wife of Alexander, Lord Gordon, & of James, 4th Lord Fleming; Jean, wife of Hugh Montgomery, 3rd Earl of Eglint
2 CONC on; & Anne, wife of George Gordon, 5th Earl of Huntley).2,3,4 Margaret Douglas died after 24 May 1579.2
2 CONT *''''''Family       James Hamilton, 2nd Earl Arran, Duc de Chatellerault, Regent of Scotland d. 22 Jan 1575
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Anna Hamilton+ d. a 17 Apr 1574
2 CONT **Barbara Hamilton+5
2 CONT **Jane (Jean) Hamilton5 d. a 25 Jun 1562
2 CONT **James Hamilton, 4th Earl of Arran, Lord Hamilton6 b. 1537 or 1538, d. Mar 1609
2 CONT **John Hamilton, 1st Marquess of Hamilton+7 b. 1542, d. 6 Apr 1604
2 CONT **Claud Hamilton, Lord Paisley, Dean of Dunbar, Canon of Glasgow+8,2 b. c 1544, d. 1621
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S11547] Unknown author, The Complete Peerage, by Cokayne, Vol. IX, p. 287, Vol. I, p. 221; The Scots Peerage, by Sir James Balfour Paul, 1904, Vol. IV, p. 541.
2 CONT * 2.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 403-404.
2 CONT * 3.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 592.
2 CONT * 4.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. I, p. 670.
2 CONT * 5.[S11566] The Scots Peerage, Vol. IV, edited by Sir James Balfour Paul, p. 370.
