2 CONC xtinct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume I, page 221. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT *3. [S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume I, page 222.
