2 CONT *''''''John Hamilton, 1st Marquess of Hamilton1 
2 CONT *''''''M, #72732, b. 1542, d. 6 April 1604
2 CONT *Father      James Hamilton, 2nd Earl Arran, Duc de Chatellerault, Regent of Scotland1 d. 22 Jan 1575
2 CONT *Mother     Margaret Douglas1 d. a 24 May 1579
2 CONT *''''''     John Hamilton, 1st Marquess of Hamilton was born in 1542.1 A contract for the marriage of John Hamilton, 1st Marquess of Hamilton and Margaret Lyon was signed on 30 December 1577 at Maybole, Scotland.2 John Hamilton, 1
2 CONC st Marquess of Hamilton died on 6 April 1604.1
