2 CONT * [https://books.google.com/books?id=kjme027UeagC&lpg=RA1-PA263&ots=qvFoLy-9im&dq=gilbert%20kennedy%204th%20earl%20of%20cassilis%20scots%20peerage&pg=RA1-PA263#v=onepage&q=gilbert%20kennedy%204th%20earl%20of%20cassilis%20scots%20p
2 CONC eerage&f=true Plantagenet Ancestry:] A Study In Colonial And Medieval Families, 2nd Edition, 2011 by Douglas Richardson
