2 CONT *2. Sir John Hamilton+8 b. a 1576, d. b 1604
2 CONT *3. Sir Claud Hamilton+9 b. bt 1576 - 1588, d. 19 Oct 1614
2 CONT *4. Sir George Hamilton+10 b. a 1577, d. b 1657
2 CONT *5. Margaret Hamilton11 b. 1 Sep 1577, d. 23 Dec 1577
2 CONT *6. Sir Frederick Hamilton+12 b. bt 1578 - 1603, d. 31 Mar 1646
