2 CONC  died before 10 February 1615/16.2 She was buried on 12 February 1615/16.[2] She was the daughter of George Seton, 5th Lord Seton and Isabel Hamilton.[1],[2] From 1 August 1574, her married name became Hamilton. Children of Margar
