2 CONT '''John Cunningham of Caprington. here treated, is reported to have died in 1564. [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/cc4rz/cunningham04.php Stirnet: Cunningham 04] He certainly died before 20 May 1574. [http://catalogue.n
2 CONC rscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD39%2f1%2f76&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=william+cunningham+of+caprington&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1600&di=n NRS: GD39/1/76]''
