2 CONT '''27 February 1612: Precept under quarter seal, in name of prince Henry, to Robert Grhame of Growgar, ordering him to infeft James, earl of Abercorn, in £10 land of Auchindrane with mill and £10 lands of Ballauchtoull, Garvane, C
2 CONC orvar, Culroy and Chappell Donald; which lands belonged formerly to deceased John Mure of Auchindrane, younger and deceased James Mure, apparent of Auchindrane, his son, and were escheated by them, 17 July 1611. [http://catalogue.
