2 CONC ence GD109/19]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     4
2 CONT
2 CONT '''16 May 1614: 16 May 1614, following on precept from chancery, 16 March 1614, in favour of Thomas Kennedy of Bargany, as heir of deceased Gilbert Kennedy of Bargany, his father, in 40 merkland of Bargany, (specified), and in lan
2 CONC ds and barony of Arstinchire, (specified), with 12 acres of Kirkoswald alias Ballochtneill, with mill, £3 8s. 6d. land of Brigend, alias Newwark, 40s. land of Brigend of Dune, 13s. 8d. land of McHutchistoun, £3 land of McCrochetie
2 CONC stoun alias Dinduff Hallim, 30s. land of Pinwirrie, 20s. land of Duwpein, £3. 6s. 8d. land of Tormichell and Dewpein, £3 land of Troveire, 50s. land of Barba, 50s. land of Dalfask, 50s. land of Milntounis and Tueschelleng, with mi
2 CONC ll, 50s. land of Lettirpyne, £5 land of Daltippen and Schallocht, 26s. 8d. land of Clondrissak, 40s. land of Pinmanach, 40s. land of Pinmacher, 10s. land of Clonyren, with mill, 6s. 8d. land of Corshallan, 20s. land of Craigocht, 
2 CONC 20s. land of Chang, £5 land of Creachdw, 40s. land of Laggane, 40s. land of Dynwin, 20s. land of Brigend of Drumellane, alias Baldraynane, 40s. land of McCrochirstoun, earldom of Carric [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlin
