2 CONT 24 September 1617: Extract contract of marriage between '''Hew Kennedie of Girvanemaynes, with consent of Anna Kennedie, his spouse, and Hew Kennedie, their eldest son, on the one part''', and '''Thomas Kennedie of Bargany, with c
2 CONC onsent of Josias Stewart of Bonytoune, his tutor, and Helen Kennedie, his sister, on the other part, for the marriage of the said Hew, younger, and Helen''' '''Hew, elder, to infeft Hew, younger, and Helen''' in the 11 mark lands 
2 CONC of Montgomriestoune, McCroreistoune, McInvainstoune and Fardinewilliame in the parish of Kirkmichaell, the 9 mark lands of Dalquhorrane, 40/- lands of Thang, Mylne of Daljerberie in the parish of Dallie, 20/- lands of Dalquhornell
2 CONC  in parish of Calmonell, mark land of Glaik in parish of Girvane, and Mylne of Girvane Maynes in the parish of Kirkoswald, all in the earldom of Carrick, with some liferent reservations to '''the said Hew, elder, and Anna''' Regis
2 CONC tered: B. of C. and S., 16 December 1633. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD180%2f197&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=hew+kennedie&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Pa
2 CONC pers of the Cathcart Family of Genoch and Knockdolian, reference GD180/197]
