1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == ALEXANDER BOYD OF KILMARNOCK ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Chamberlain of Kilmarnock (but for the attainder of 1469 de jure third Lord Boyd, though no evidence can be produced that he ever bore the title of Lord Boyd)'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Alexander Boyd of Kilmarnock, here treated, was the second son of https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Boyd-1st-Lord-Boyd-of-Kilmarnock/6000000000642082925?through=6000000002116095957 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Mari
2 CONC ota-Maxwell-of-Calderwood/6000000006444357850?through=6000000002116095957. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft/page/150/mode/1up The The Scots Peerage V: 150-2]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Alexander Boyd of Kilmarnock, here treated, was the heir male of his nephew https://www.geni.com/people/James-Boyd-2nd-Lord-Boyd-of-Arran/6000000006444441981, following whose death in 1484 the Lordship of Kilmarnock revereted t
2 CONC o the crown. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft/page/150/mode/1up The Scots Peerage V: 150]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''A date and place of death has not been identified for Alexander Boyd of Kilmarnock, here treated. He was alive on 26 June 1508, when Queen Margaret set the lands of Kilmarnock and others to him in tack for nine years,[http://ca
2 CONC talogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD8%2f29&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=alexander+boyd&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1510&di=n NRS: GD8/29] but he died before 1510, when Queen Margaret acknowledged that his s
2 CONC on Robert Boyd had paid the mails of Kilmarnock to Mr. Francis Bothwell, burgess of Edinburgh. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD8%2f35&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Robert+Boyd&ko=p&r=&r
2 CONC o=s&df=1508&dt=1560&di=n NRS: GD8/35]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Alexander Boyd of Kilmarnock, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Janet-Colville/6000000002979961619?through=6000000002116095957. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft/
2 CONC page/151/mode/1up The Scots Peerage V: 151]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Children ==
