2 CONT Katherine Stirling married Alexander Home, 3rd Lord Home, High Chamberlain of Scotland, son of Alexander Home, 2nd Lord Home and Nichola Ker, DID NOT MARRY; 
2 CONT
2 CONT By her, he had 1 son (John) & 2 daughters (Alison, wife of Henry Wardlaw of Torrie; & Isobel (Elizabeth)).4
2 CONT
2 CONT Katherine Stirling married Archibald 'Bell the Cat' Douglas, 5th Earl Angus, son of George Douglas, 4th Earl Angus and Elizabeth (Isabella) Sibbald, before 1 June 1500.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Katherine Stirling and an unknown person were divorced circa 1510.
