2 CONT "Robert Graham of Fintry, married, under an indenture 7 August 1476, Elizabeth, third daughter of, George Douglas, fourth Earl of Angus. The Grahams of Fintry, Forfar, descend from this marriage."
2 CONT
2 CONT from Scots Peerage (vol 3) 1
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Douglas daughter of George Douglas 4th Earl of Angus married Sir Robert Graham son of William Graham and Lady Mary Stewart. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_Douglas,_4th_Earl_of_Angus
2 CONT
2 CONT Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Douglas daughter of George Douglas 1st Earl of Angus married Alexander Forbes 1st Lord Forbes and David Hay of Yester. 
2 CONT
