1 NOTE {geni:about_me} >>>'''CONCERN:''' Viable, sourced proof needed to support parentage
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Wikitree: [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Douglas-818 Margaret (Douglas) Campbell (abt. 1456)]
2 CONT * '''Margaret Douglas'''[1][2][3][4] '''presumed daughter of George Douglas,''' 4th Earl of Angus '''and Isabella Sibbald''' daughter of Sir John Sibbald of Balgonie[5
2 CONT * '''Birth Estimate''' about 1456 
2 CONT * '''Place''': Of, Kilmaurs, Ayrshire, Scotland[6][4]
2 CONT * '''Marriage Estimate''' 1479 Sir Duncan Campbell, 2nd of Glenorchy, son of Sir Colin Campbell, 1st of Glenorchy and Janet Stewart,Death Estimate Unknown - Most likely after 1500-1510 (vs Death Date: 1472 Scotland Age: 15-16). 
2 CONT ** ''Reportedly'', Duncan Campbell married, secondly, after 1479, Margaret Moncreiffe, daughter of John Moncreiffe, 8th of that Ilk and Margaret Levingston and died about 1515 Battle of Flodden.
2 CONT * '''Presumed Children of Sir Duncan Campbell, 2nd of Glenorchy and Margaret Douglas''' 
2 CONT * (Estimated Children Births 1479-1500)
2 CONT ** Sir Colin Campbell (c.1480-1523), 3rd of Glenorchy (married Lady Marjory Stewart, daughter of John Stewart, 1st Earl of Atholl and Lady Eleanor Sinclair}
2 CONT ** Patrick Campbell1 d. 14 Jan 1507 (died young probably unmarried)
2 CONT ** Elizabeth Campbell (married David Tosbach before 7 December 1518)
2 CONT ** (1490-1552) Archibald Campbell , 1st of Glenlyon (b. c 1490, d. 29 Apr 1552) (married Lady Marjory Stewart, daughter of John Stewart, 1st Earl of Atholl and Lady Eleanor Sinclair)
2 CONT * '''NOTE:''' POORLY SOURCED
2 CONT <nowiki>————————————————————————————————————————————</nowiki>
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Margaret Douglas''' was born on January 1, 1456 in Kilmaurs, Ayrshire, Scotland. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-47096044 George Douglas , 4th Earl of Angus] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-4517816 Isabel Sibba
2 CONC ld of Balgony]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret married [https://www.geni.com/profile-38479114 Duncan Campbell, 2nd Lord of Glenorchy] on October 14, 1479 in Glenorchy, Lorn, Argyllshire, Scotland. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-60414238 Colin Campbell, 3rd of Glenorchy]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-38485924 Elizabeth Campbell]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-38485925 John Campbell of Crannich, Bishop of the isles]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-61549347 Christian Campbell]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34625934146 Archibald Campbell, 1st of Glenlyon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died before 1505 in Glenorchy, Argyllshire, Scotland. 
2 CONT ----
