1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===ARCHIBALD DOUGLAS OF KILSPINDIE===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Archibald Douglas of Kilspindie, here treated, is the son of Archibald Douglas of Kilspindie, sometime Provost of Edinburgh, and his wife Isabel Hoppar [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?referen
2 CONC ce=GD243%2f23%2f3&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=hoppar&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1600&di=n NRS: GD243/23/3]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
