1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===MARGARET DUNBAR===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===First Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret Dunbar, daughter and heiress of David Dunbar of Cockburn, Alexander Lindsay, fourth Earl of Crawford. [http://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ww/wallace03.php Stirnet: Wallace 03]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children of First Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/David-Lindsay-5th-Earl-of-Crawford-1st-Duke-of-Montrose/6000000006444360681?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1599498420796&through=6000000015801167887
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Alexander-Lindsay-of-Auchtermonzie-7th-Earl-of-Crawford/6000000002187896966?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1599498612630&through=6000000015801167887
2 CONT # 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Second Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret Dunbar, daughter and heiress of David Dunbar of Cockburn, married Sir William Wallace of Craigie.[http://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ww/wallace03.php Stirnet: Wallace 03]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children of Second Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/John-Wallace-of-Craigie-7th-of-Craigie-12th-of-Riccarton/6000000006938454236?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1599496964399&through=6000000006938454236
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/William-Wallace/6000000150393251840?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1599497109295&through=6000000015801271647
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/dd/dunbar02.php#dau4 Stirnet: Dunbar 02]
2 CONT # [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ll/lindsay03.php#top Stirnet: Lindsay 03]
2 CONT # [http://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ww/wallace03.php Stirnet: Wallace 03]
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/bookofwallace01roge/page/n94/mode/1up The Book of Wallace. Volume I: pp. 33-91 for Wallace of Craigie]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===BIOGRAPHICAL SUMMARY BY DARRYL LUNDY'S PEERAGE===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret Dunbar was the daughter of Sir David Dunbar of Cockburn. She married, firstly, Alexander Lindsay, 4th Earl of Crawford, son of David Lindsay, 3rd Earl of Crawford and Marjory Ogilvy. She married, secondly, Sir William 
2 CONC Wallace of Cragie after 1453. She died from July 1498 to January 1499/0. As a result of her marriage, Margaret Dunbar was styled as Countess of Crawford on 17 January 1445/46. Children of Margaret Dunbar and Alexander Lindsay, 4th
2 CONC  Earl of Crawford  (1) Lady Elizabeth Lindsay+ .d a 22 Nov 1509 (2) David Lindsay, 1st Duke of Montrose+ b. 1440, d. 25 Dec 1495 (3) Alexander Lindsay of Auchtermonzie, 7th Earl of Crawford+ b. c 1443, d. May 1517 Links: [http://w
2 CONC ww.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I2216&tree=CC Clan MacFarlane]'''
