2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 	Marion Murray [68, Drummond earls of Perth, vol VII, p. 40], [68, Murray dukes of Atholl, Vol I, p. 458], 16G Grandmother
2 CONT
