2 CONT      Margaret Hamilton was born illegitimately before 1505. She was the daughter of James Hamilton, 1st Earl of Arran and Beatrix Drummond. She married Andrew Stewart, 1st Lord Stewart of Ochiltree, son of Andrew Stewart, 1st Lord
2 CONC  Avandale and Margaret Kennedy, before 22 August 1515.
