2 CONT '''6 September 1560: Letter of procuracy by which Williame, Maister of Ruthuen, with the consent of his father Patrick, Lord Ruthuen, appoints Alexander Blair of Freretoun, John Peblis and James Thomsoun to act as his procrators a
2 CONC nd mandates them to appear before Patrick, Bishop of Moray, Commendator of the Monastery of Scone, and there resign his lands of Over Collane in favour of Thomas Scott of Cambusmychell. [https://archive.org/details/liberecclesiede
2 CONC s78sconuoft/page/207/mode/1up Scone Liber: pp. 207-09]'''
