2 CONT
2 CONT '''9 April 1562: Charter by which the Queen of Scots confirms that she has given the lands of Haliland in the barony of Ruthven to William, Master of Ruthven, and his wife Dorathie Stewart. This land was previously resigned by Wil
2 CONC liam's father, Patrick, Earl of Gowrie. It was to be held William and Dorathie in conjuct fee and liferent, and it was destined to be held by their legitimate male heirs, whom failing by William's heirs. [https://archive.org/detai
2 CONC ls/registrummagnisi04scot/page/320/mode/1up The Register of the Great Seal of Scotland, A.D. 1546-1580, charter number 1413 on p, 320]'''
