2 CONC jects in Dirltoun (as in No 125). [Granters' seals, in poor condition]. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD6%2f181&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Gowrie&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1650&di=y  Natio
