2 CONT '''28 December 1601: Precept of clare constat by Dame Dorothy Stewart, countess of Gowrie, in favour of Sir Hugh Carmichell of that ilk, as heir to his brother, James Carmichell, son of deceased John Carmichell, yr, of that ilk, i
