1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===PATRICK, MASTER OF RUTHVEN===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Patrick, Master of Ruthven, is the eldest son of William, Lord Ruthven, and Lady Janet Douglas. He married Lady Marion Gray and died before 1565, when his younger brother William is styled Master. [https://archive.org/details/s
2 CONC cotspeeragefoun04paul/page/261/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 261-2]
