2 CONC  Lady Margaret Tud 6 July 1544 at St. James's Palace, St. James's, London, England.2 He died on 4 September 1571 at age 54 at Stirling Castle, Stirling, Stirlingshire, Scotland, shot dead while on a raid on Stirling Castle. He was
2 CONC  also known as Matthew Stewart. He gthe title of 4th Earl of Lennox.1 He held the office of Regent of Scotland between 1570 and 1571.
