2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>John, eighth Lord Glamis</strong> was born about 1544...
2 CONT
2 CONT ...He was nominated by the Regent Lennox an Extraordinary Lord of Session 30 September 1570, resigning that post on 8 October 1573, when he received a commission from James VI with consent of the Earl of Morton as Regent, appointi
2 CONC ng him Chancellor of the Kingdom and Keeper of the Great Seal during his life...
2 CONT
2 CONT ...He married, 11 April 1561, Elizabeth, daughter of William, fifth Lord Abernethy of Saltoun, widow of William Meldrum of Fyvie."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun08pauluoft#page/288/mode/2up The Scots peerage], Vol. VIII, page 288-291
2 CONT
