1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == MARIOTA JOHNSTONE ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Mariota, daughter of Andrew Johnstone of Elphinstone. She was celebrated for her charities,and was known in the country as the good Lady Wedderburn.
