2 CONT
2 CONT [From History of Dunbar Hume and Dundas from Drummond's Noble British Families, William Pickering, London 1846, pages 21-22]
2 CONT
2 CONT David Home married Mariota Johnstone, daughter of Andrew Johnstone and Unknown, in 1543.12 (Mariota Johnstone died in 1564.)
2 CONT
2 CONT David Home next married Margaret Ker. (Margaret Ker died on 24 Feb 1589 88 and was buried in 1588-1589 in Melrose, Roxburghshire, Scotland.)
