2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''23 July 1537: Charter by which William Kirkpatrick of Kirkmichael confirms that he has sold the lans of Dunspark and Caldsydeis in the Earldom of March to George Hume of Aytoun, who obtained a charter of confirmation under the 
2 CONC Great Seal of Scotland on 16 March 1538-39. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi03scot/page/434/mode/1up RMS 1513-46: charter number 1948]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''30 January 1549-50: Viceoomes respondebit pro £1920 de firmis decern libratarum terrarum de villa de Kirkmichell et Plewlandis antiqui extentus, cum molendino et multuris earundem, existentium in manibus regine et  quondam suor
2 CONC um avi et patris per spatium sexaginta quatuor annorum ultimo elapsorum sasina non recuperata, et pro £30 de relevio earundem ' ac pro £5376 de firma viginti libratarum terrarum de Molin antiqui extentus, cum molendino et multuris
2 CONC  earundem ; et quod dicti decem librate terrarum de Kirkmichell et Plevlandis et viginti librate terrarum de Molin antiqui extentus jacent infra vicecomitatum de Drumfres ; ac viginti duarum libratarum terrarum de Dryvisdaill anti
2 CONC qui etentus, cum molendino et multuris earundem et dicti viginto due librate terrarum de Dryvisdaill antiqui extentus in senescallatu Vallis Annadie et infra vicecomitatum de Drumfres predictum ; unacum piscationibus omnium et sin
2 CONC gularum prescriptarum terrarum ville de Kirkmichell et Plewlandis, Molin, et Drivisdaill ; existentium in manibus regine et dictorum quondan sui avi et patris per prefactum spatium ratione supradicta ; et pro £84 de relevio earund
2 CONC em ; regine debitia per sasinam datam Willelmo Kirkpatrik de Kirkmicbell. [Edinburgh, 30 January.] [https://archive.org/details/exchequerrollss02exchgoog/page/n565/mode/1up RSRS 1543-1556: p. 488]'''
2 CONT
