2 CONT James Hamilton, 1st Lord Hamilton  Birth: 1416  Hamilton, Lanarkshire, Scotland, (Present UK)  Death: November 6, 1479 (64)  Scotland, (Present UK)  Immediate Family:  Son of Sir James Hamilton, 5th of Cadzow and Janet Bruce Husba
2 CONC nd of Janet Calderwood; Eupheme Graham, Lady Hamilton and Princess Mary of Scotland Father of John Hamilton of Broomhill; Elizabeth Lindsay (Hamilton); James Hamilton, 1st Earl of Arran; Hon. Elizabeth Hamilton; Sir Robert Hamilto
2 CONC n, 1480; and Patrick Hamilton, of Kincavil « less Brother of Alexander Hamilton; John Hamilton; Gavin Hamilton, Provost of the Collegiate Church of Bothwell and Sir James Hamilton, Baron of Cadzow Half brother of sir james ll hami
2 CONC lton -baron; Sir Alexander Bruce of Airth and Stenhouse; Isabella Bruce and Helen Menteith
