2 CONT Marriage and issue[edit]
2 CONT
2 CONT Hamilton married first, Lady Euphemia Graham, daughter of Patrick Graham, de jure Earl of Strathearn and Euphemia Stewart, Countess of Strathearn and widow of Archibald Douglas, 5th Earl of Douglas. They had a daughter: Elizabeth 
2 CONC Hamilton (c. 1442 – c. 1517), who married David Lindsay, 1st Duke of Montrose
