2 CONT '''R1b-DF21 y-Haplogroup (S192) aka R1b1a1a2a1a2c1a5, R1b1a2a1a2c1g (Isogg 2015)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT R1b-DF21 y-Haplogroup (S192) aka R1b1a1a2a1a2c1a5, R1b1a2a1a2c1g (Isogg 2015); (large clade); (some of its `children' are FGC3213 's children -- Yfull and R_org trees are hard to line up); (very prominent early; RATHLIN ISLAND of 
2 CONC Northern IRELAND; TORRES of Iberia; FUSTON nr. Rhine; MONTGOMERY of Normandy; McDONALD; McDANIEL; ALEXANDER; McKELLAR, HAMILTON, SLOAN, etc.; ALLEN-YYRYG).
2 CONT
2 CONT Born:  2200 BC.
2 CONT
2 CONT Transcription of text in document
