2 CONT __________________________________________________________________
2 CONT R-DF21 Computed Origin Near Isle of Man.
2 CONT
2 CONT R-DF21 is a major British Isles lineage that was born in the British Isles 1900 BC. It is one of 22 established child lineages of parent R-DF13 who was also likely born and spent his entire life in the British Isles. It had 125 sa
2 CONC mples on YFull as of Dec 29, 2019 that have been geolocated to the Old World. (Jan 12, 2020)
2 CONT
2 CONT https://phylogeographer.com/r-df21-computed-origin-near-isle-of-man/#:~:text=R%2DDF21%20is%20a%20major,geolocated%20to%20the%20Old%20World.
2 CONT __________________________________________________________________
2 CONT ... map only reflect a haplogroup distribution from the SNP-typed samples...
2 CONT
