1 NOTE {geni:about_me}      Janet McCulloch is the daughter of Sir Simon McCulloch of Myrtoun.1 She married John Vaus of Barnbarroch, son of Patrick Vaux of Barnbarroch and Margaret Kennedy.1
2 CONT       Her married name became Vaus.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Janet McCulloch and John Vaus of Barnbarroch
2 CONT  1.Alexander Vaus of Barnbarroch+1 d. 1567
2 CONT  2.Sir Patrick Vaus, Lord Barnbarroch+1 d. 22 Dec 1597
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT  1.[S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 1, page 263. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Pe
2 CONC erage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT
