2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir Robert Crichton of Sanquhar married a lady named Elizabeth before 13 March 1433; [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/54/mode/1up RMS, 1424-1513: charter 227]
2 CONT
2 CONT Scots Peerage https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun03paul#page/220/ didn't know the maiden name of his wife.  It seems unlikely she was an Erskine of Kinnoull, as his son married an Erskine of Kinnoull.
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Robert Crichton III, 1409 - 17 Oct 1478, 
2 CONT *Birth: 1409 at Elgin; Dumbfrieshire; Scotland
2 CONT *Marriage: ? at ? to Elizabeth Erskine, 1415 - ? [20]
2 CONT *Death: 17 Oct 1478 at ?
2 CONT *Sex: M 
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **1. Christian Crichton		1439 - Mar 1477/1478 
2 CONT **2. Patrick Crichton		Apr 1445 - ? 
2 CONT **3. Robert Crichton		? - 1502 
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
