2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: 1465 at ? to Robert Colville, 1445 - ? [21]
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: Mar 1477/1478 at Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: ? at ?
2 CONT
2 CONT Sex: F 
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander Erskine  married, firstly, Christian Crichton, daughter of Sir Robert Crichton of Sanquhar and Elizabeth Erskine, before 9 October 1466.
