1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Sir Simon Carruthers, 8th of Mouswald and 3rd Bt., became chief in 1484. He was murdered in 1504.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 
2 CONT #Isabella, daughter of David Scott of Buccleuch
2 CONT # daughter of Douglas of Drumlanrig
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: (which wife is uncertain)
2 CONT # 	Simon Carruthers, 9th of Mouswald (b c1491, d 04.1531)  	m. (1516) Katherine Carlile (dau of William Carlile, Lord)
2 CONT #   	Archibald Carruthers in Hetlandhill
2 CONT #  Ellen Carruthers 	m. (17.02.1502) Adam Carlyle (son of Adam of Brydekirk)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT The records show that Archibald 7th of Mouswald (younger) married twice. The first to the daughter of John Johnstone, chief of that clan, (d. 1493), and secondly to Marion Scott.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/cc4aq/carruthers01.php
2 CONT
2 CONT * John Carruthers, 6th of Mouswald (d c1454, captain of Lochmaben Castle) m. ?
2 CONT **  	(a) 	Archibald Carruthers, 7th of Mouswald (d 1484) -   	m1. ?? Johnstone (dau of John Johnstone of that ilk) m2. Marion Scott
2 CONT *** Not known which wife was mother of 1. 	Sir Simon Carruthers, 8th of Mouswald (d 1504)  	m1. Isabella Scott (dau of David Scott of Buccleuch) m2. ?? Douglas (dau of ?? Douglas of Drumlanrig)
2 CONT **** 	Not known which wife was mother of ...  	A. 	Simon Carruthers, 9th of Mouswald (b c1491, d 04.1531)  	m. (1516) Katherine Carlile (dau of William Carlile, Lord)
2 CONT *** 	William Carruthers
2 CONT
2 CONT
