1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===ROBERT CATHCART OF KILLOCHAN===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Death===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert Cathcart of Killochan was killed in battle on 9 September 1513, at Flodden near Branxton in Northumberland, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''I've heard the lilting, at the yowe-milking, Lassies a-lilting before dawn o' day; But now they are moaning on ilka green loaning; "The Flowers of the Forest are a' wede away".'''
2 CONT
