2 CONT * Thomas (ancestor of the Maxwells of Gleneslan)
2 CONT * Herbert (ancestor of the Maxwells of Hills and Drumcotran)
2 CONT * Janet, married William, son of John, 1st Lord Carlyle
2 CONT * John, 4th Lord Maxwell, married Agnes, daughter of Sir Alexander Stewart of Garlies.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT Crichton married firstly, about 1425, a daughter of Sir William Douglas of Strathbrock, by whom he had a son, James. About 1450, he married secondly Janet, a daughter of Sir William Borthwick of that Ilk, who was the widow of Sir 
2 CONC James Douglas of Dalkeith and also of Sir Colin Campbell of Glenorchy. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1454 their daughter Janet married Robert Maxwell, 2nd Lord Maxwell (who died c. 1485).[1]
2 CONT
