1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JANET MAXWELL===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Janet Maxwell is the daughter of John, third Lord Maxwell, and his wife Lady Janet Carlyle. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06paul/page/477 The Scots Peerage etc. Edited by Sir James Balfour Paul, Lord Lyon king of
2 CONC  Arms. Volume VI (David Douglas, Edinburgh, 1909), for the children of John, third Lord Maxwell, see pp. 477-78]'''
