2 CONT
2 CONT '''''Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Janet was born about 1470. She is the daughter of John Maxwell[1] and Janet Crichton.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married William Carlyle[2][3][4][5][1] They had issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT James, third Lord Carlyle[2][1]
2 CONT Michael, fourth Lord Carlyle[2]
2 CONT Catherine, m. Simon Carruthers of Mouswald bef. 8 Jul 1516[6]
2 CONT Elizabeth[6]
2 CONT
