2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT "Johnston of Caroline" - Sir James Johnstone married Lady Sarah, daughter of John Lord (sic) Harris, knighted at the coronation of Queen Anne of Denmark and appointed Warden of the West Marches. He was murdered by Lord Maxwell in 
2 CONC 1608
2 CONT
