1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===HEW MAXWELL===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Edward Maxwell, Commendator of Dundrennan, died 29 September 1598. He married, before 1597, Margaret, daughter of William Baillie of Lamington. She married, secondly, John Livingston of West Quarter. For a pedigree of Edward's 
2 CONC descendants, Baillies of Lamington, and Maxwells of Newlaw and Breoch, see Book of Carlaverock; one son, however, Hew Maxwell, a highwayman, is there omitted. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/411/mode/1
2 CONC up The Scots Peerage IV: 412]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/411/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 412]'''
