2 CONC irs, which
2 CONT failing to his heirs and assignees whosoever, heritably and irredeemably, of all and sundry the lands and others underwritten, namely the twenty pound land of old extent of Holmains, Little Dalton, Daltonhook and Blackberry ward, 
2 CONC commonly
