1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''== Biography =='''
2 CONT
2 CONT William 'of Breckonside' (Grierson) Carruthers 
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH 1675 • Dumfries, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH FEB 1720 • Breckonside, Moffat, Kirkcudbright, Kirkcudbrightshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT '''== Sources =='''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Commissariot Record of Dumfries · Register of Testaments, 1624-1800'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Carruthers, William and Chalmers, Margaret Dates10 Nov 1720PlaceBreckenside Moffat, Kirkcudbright, ScotlandBookMarriagesCollectionDumfries and Kirkcudbright: - The commissariot record of Dumfries, Register of testaments, 1624-1800
2 CONC VolumeThe Commissariot Record of DumfriesChapterRegister of Testaments, 1624-1800TextCarruthers, William, of Breckenside, par. of Moffat 10 Nov 1720 and 26 Dec 1723 See also Chalmers, Margaret.
2 CONT
2 CONT William 'of Breckonside' Carruthers was born in 1675 in Dumfries, Dumfries-shire, Scotland,
2 CONT
2 CONT to Helen (Murray) Grierson - Carruthers, age 37, and John '9th of Holmains' (Lockhart) Carruthers, age 41.
2 CONT
2 CONT Carruthers, William. '''Married Margaret Chalmers'''. Probate record. 10 Nov 1720. Breckenside Moffat, 
2 CONT
2 CONT Kirkcudbright, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''== Reference =='''
2 CONT
