2 CONT == The Question of Identity ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert Fergusson of Craigdarroch, here treated, is the son and heir of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Fergusson-8th-Laird-of-Craigdarroch/6000000024871543697?through=6000000014585399699 He is noticed on 3 February 1601, durin
2 CONC g his father's lifetime, as Robert Fergusson, younger of Craigdarroch, [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD77%2f173&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=craigdarroch&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1620&di=n
2 CONC  NRS: GD77/173] and on 3 December 1610, as Robert Fergusson, apparent of Craigdarroch. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD39%2f1%2f156&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=craigdarroch&ko=p&r=&r
2 CONC o=s&df=&dt=1620&di=n NRS: GD39/1/156]'''
2 CONT
