2 CONC gham — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Husband of Jean Cuninghame — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Husband of Margret (Gardner) Ferguson — married 19 Aug 1600 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotlandmap Father of Jo
2 CONC hn Ferguson, Barbara Ferguson, Elizabeth Ferguson, William Ferguson, Edward Ferguson, Thomas Ferguson, Thomas Ferguson, William Ferguson, John Fergussone, William Fergusson and	Robert Ferguson Died 9 Nov 1611 in Scotland [http://w
2 CONC ww.wikitree.com/wiki/Ferguson-3288 Wikitree]'''
