2 CONT
2 CONT == Fake Genealogy 6 ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert Fergusson was the 9th Laird of Craigdarroch, he was Seedman, & Burgess of Edinburgh. Robert was born in c. 1566, Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland ; he died on November 9, 1611, at the Estate of Craigdarroch, Glencairn, Du
2 CONC mfries-shire, Scotland. He married as his 2nd wife, JEAN CUNNINGHAME, born c. 1567, Dumfries-shire, Scotland ; died c. 1596, Scotland. She is the mother of both the 10th, & the 11th Lairds of Craigdarroch. Robert Fergusson & his 2
2 CONC nd wife, Jean Cunninghame, had issue two known, viz.: (1) John Fergusson, born c. 1585, Craigdarroch ; he died c. 1628, he was the 10th Laird of Craigdarroch, nothing futher. (2) William Fergusson, born c. 1590, Glenncairn, Dumfri
2 CONC es-shire, Scotland ; he died AFTER 1631, Craigdarroch ; he was the 11th Laird of Craigdarroch. William Fergusson married SARA GRIERSON, born BEFORE 1598, Lag Tower, Dumfries-shire, Scotland, they had a marriage contract dated May 
2 CONC 9, 1621 ; she died AFTER 1631, at the Estate of Craigdarroch, in Glencairn, Dumfries-shire, Scotland. [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/147533635/robert-fergusson Find A Grave]'''
2 CONT
