2 CONC Robert by Catharine Cunyghame [Cunningham], now his relict, of an annualrent of 300 merks from lands of Courig and Graindes, under reversion of 3000 merks. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?refer
