1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Tennessee Cousins, Pg. 424:
2 CONT
2 CONT The TARIETONS, who intermarried with the Quaker Bates family gave the name UNITY to a daughter, who married CAPTAIN GEORGE KEELING, from Lower Norfolk who settled in New Kent County, and this was the origin of the name UNITY in th
2 CONC e HENDERSON FAMILY in North Carolina.
2 CONT
