2 CONC 31 [patent book 14, p. 198] as found in 'Some Ancient Landowners in St. Martin's Parish, Hanover County, Virginia'. pp 13-15. Capt. KEELINGs land, Fall Point, to the east of WILLIAMS.
2 CONT - - -
