2 CONT >'''d.''' January 1618
2 CONT >'''was the son''' of James Henderson, 3rd of Fordell and Jean Murray.[2] 
2 CONT >'''married''', firstly, Agnes Balfour, daughter of David Balfour of Balbouthie.[3] 
2 CONT >'''married''', secondly, Anna Halkat, daughter of Sir Robert Halkat of Pilfivrane.[3] 
2 CONT >died in January 1618.[3]
2 CONT >'''was invested''' as a Knight by King James VI.[3]
2 CONT
