1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Francis Henderson:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p43745.htm#i437447
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Francis Henderson of Easter Duvis in Newbottle [1]
2 CONT *M, #437447, 
2 CONT *d. 1628
2 CONT *Last Edited=2 Mar 2012
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Francis Henderson of Easter Duvis in Newbottle was the son of James Henderson, 3rd of Fordell and Jean Murray.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1628, killed in action.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was invested as a Knight in 1616.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was Colonel of the Buccleuch's Regiment on 17 September 1622.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
