2 CONT <blockquote>'''Katerine  (1488) Katrina Turing (1489) Katerine Turing (1490) Katharine Turyne (1494) Katerine Turing (1494-5) Karine Turyng (1495) Katherine Turing (1503-4) Katrine Turing (1507)'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''According to Clan MacFarlane, Katherine Turing, here treated, is the daughter of John Turing and Agnes Preston. Clan MacFarlane cite rootsweb, who cite, in their turn, an account of the Crichtons of Nauchtan in "The Red Book of
2 CONC  Fife" by Gordon A. MacGregor. Neither Clan MacFarlane or rootsweb refer to a verifiable piece of evidence in their accounts. [https://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I28939&tree=CC Cla
2 CONC n MacFarlane and associated clans genealogy]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Katherine Turing married Patrick Crichton of Cranston-Riddell. A date for the marriage has not been identified but they were married before 14 Junly 1488, the date upon which the lands of Ralestoun was set to them in rental for
2 CONC  three years. [https://archive.org/details/exchequerrollsof10scot/page/630/mode/1up RSRS 10: 630]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the National Records of Scotland===
2 CONT
