2 CONC mmond, justiciarios DOMINI REGIS, MAGISTRUM ALEXANDRUM INGLIS. . . . . . Ralestoun assedatur KATERINE sponse Patricii Crechton de Cranstoun pro terminis trium annorum, inde pecunia xij li. cum serviciis debitis et consuetis, grass
2 CONC uma tantum. [https://archive.org/details/exchequerrollsof10scot/page/630/mode/1up RSRS 10: 630]'''
