2 CONC iam per literas suppremi domini nostri regis suo secreto sigillo, assedatur Archibaldo Diksoun et Mariote Mowbra ejus sponse conjunctim et divisim pro terminis novemdecim annornm, etc. prout in dictis literis lacius continetur, qu
