2 CONT '''Thomas Kerr of Ferniehirst (d1585)''' 
2 CONT s/o Sir John Kerr of Ferniehirst & Katherine Kerr
2 CONT x Janet Kirkcaldy d/o William Kirkcaldy of Grange & Margaret Learmonth
2 CONT *Andrew Kerr  called Lord Jedburgh *Mary *Julian Kerr x Patrick xx Thomas Hamilton *Margaret 
2 CONT xx 1569 Jean/Janet Scott (c.1548 - >1593) d/o Sir William Scott of Kirkurd, Younger of Buccleuch 
