1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://era.ed.ac.uk/handle/1842/6875 ''Lairds and gentlemen: A study of the landed families of the Eastern Anglo-Scottish Borders c.1540-1603''] Vol 2 pp 55-8 & 118-9
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------
2 CONT
2 CONT TITLE: Baron of FERNIEHURST
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas (3rd son), initially of Smailholm, later of Ferniehirst; in 1483 exchanged Smailholm for Crailing and Hownam with John Home of Whitrig; married Margaret, daughter and heiress of Sir Thomas Ker of Ferniehirst, which he thus 
2 CONC acquired, holding it from the Earl of Angus. [Burke's Peerage]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Thomas Kerr lived at Smailholm, Berwickshire, Scotland. He lived at Ferniehirst, Midlothian, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died after 24 June 1484.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Message sent to manager regarding this profile on 20th Dec 2015:
2 CONT
2 CONT I have linked this profile as son of Andrew Kerr and second wife Margaret Tweedle however the birth date you have for him, 1529 is a little late, I think. Do you have any reliable sources and do you think this is a good match or d
2 CONC o you think I should reverse this?
2 CONT
2 CONT Terry Jackson (volunteer curator) This profile previously had no relationships recorded and b:1529 d: 1598 (may not be the same profile)
2 CONT
2 CONT According to [http://www.thepeerage.com/p1490.htm#i14898 The Peerage:]
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Kerr, 1st of Ferniehirst was the son of Andrew Kerr of Auldtounburn and Cessford and Margaret Tweedie.1
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Margaret Ker, daughter of Sir Thomas Ker of Ferniehurst.1 He died on 24 June 1484.1
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived at Smailholm, Berwickshire, Scotland.1 He lived at Ferniehirst, Midlothian, Scotland.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Thomas Kerr, 1st of Ferniehirst and Margaret Ker
2 CONT
2 CONT # Sir Andrew Kerr of Ferniehirst+1 d. c 4 Oct 1545
2 CONT # Ralph Kerr+2 d. b 29 Nov 1525
2 CONT # Thomas Kerr2 d. b 14 Aug 1539
2 CONT # George Kerr2 d. a 1539
2 CONT # William Kerr2 d. a 1568
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations [S37] BP2003 volume 2, page 2400. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37] [S37] BP2003. [S37]
