1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In a short-lived attempt to resolve the Scott-Kerr feud,[8] in 1530 the widowed Sir Walter married as his second wife '''Janet Kerr, daughter of Andrew Kerr of Fernihirst, widow of George Turnbull of Bedrule'''. Th
