1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Find a Grave Memorial [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/161997280/george-keith George Keith]==
2 CONT
2 CONT George Keith, 5th Earl Marischal, 4th Baron Lord Keith, 2nd Lord Altrie
2 CONT
2 CONT *b. 1553,  d. 2 April 1623
2 CONT
2 CONT George Keith, 5th Earl of Marischal by George Jamestone [1]     
2 CONT
2 CONT George Keith, 5th Earl Marischal was born in 1553.[3] He was the son of William Keith, Master of Marischal and Lady Elizabeth Hay.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married by contract, firstly, Margaret Home, daughter of Alexander Home, 5th Lord Home and Margaret Ker, on 4 February 1580/81.[5] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, secondly, Margaret Ogilvy, daughter of James Ogilvy, 5th Lord Ogilvy of Airlie and Jean Forbes.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 2 April 1623.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT George Keith, 5th Earl Marischal 
2 CONT *succeeded to the title of 4th Lord Keith [S., 1451] on 7 October 1581.[4] 
2 CONT *He succeeded to the title of 5th Earl Marischal [S., 1458] on 7 October 1581.[4] 
2 CONT *He was invested as a Privy Counsellor (P.C.) [Scotland] in 1585.[4] 
2 CONT *He held the office of Scottish Ambassador to Denmark in 1589, to negotiate King James VI's marriage.[4] 
2 CONT *He succeeded to the title of 2nd Lord Altrie [S., 1587] in 1592.[2] 
2 CONT *In 1593 he founded Marischal College, Aberdeen.[4] 
2 CONT *He held the office of High Commissioner of Parliament [Scotland] in 1609.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of George Keith, 5th Earl Marischal and Margaret Ogilvy
2 CONT *1.unknown son Keith[4]
2 CONT *2.unknown son Keith[4]
