2 CONC talogue/details.aspx?reference=GD267%2f27%2f73%2f828&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=patrick+home+of+ayton&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Home-Robertson Family of Paxton, Berwickshire (Home of Wed
