2 CONT
2 CONT '''7 March 1609: Feu Charter by Sir Patrick Hume of Aitoun Knight, Elizabeth Edmondstoun, his second spouse, and John Hume, his son, to James Swyne and Issobelle Haistie his spouse of subjects in Duns. [http://catalogue.nrscotland
2 CONC .gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD1%2f200%2f11&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=hume+of+aitoun&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotland, Title Deeds relating to land in Berwickshire, reference GD1/200/11]
