2 CONT
2 CONT                     3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''7 March 1609: Charter de me by Sir Patrick Home [Hume] of Aitoun [Ayton] with consent of Elizabeth Edmonstoun [Edmiston], his spouse, and John Home [Hume], his son, to Alexander Burne [Burn] and Jonet Scott, his spouse, of a te
2 CONC nement and two yards in the burgh of Duns. 3 tags, with the seals of Sir Patrick and John Home [Hume] of Aytoun [Ayton]. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD216%2f6&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&t
