2 CONT
2 CONT                     4
2 CONT
2 CONT '''25 May 1609: Charter de me by Sir Patrick Home [Hume] of Aitoun [Ayton], with consent of Elizabeth Edmonstoun [Edmiston], his spouse, and John Home [Hume], his son, to John Smyth [Smith], son of Simon Smyth [Smith] in Duns, of 
2 CONC a tenement of land in the burgh of Duns. 3 tags. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD216%2f8&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=hume+of+aitoun&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotl
2 CONC and, Papers of the Family of Cockburn of That Ilk, reference GD216/8]'''
