2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walter_Scott_of_Branxholme_and_Buccleuch
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT "William died before 19 May 1552.
2 CONT Called "Whitecloak," younger of Buccleuch; married Grisel, daughter of John Betoun, and sister to his step-mother. and d. 1552 during the lifetime of his father. [from Source #3]
2 CONT Succeeded his father in 1552. [from Source #1]
2 CONT Sir William Scott of Kirkurd, Knight, ... Early took part with his father in the Border Forays, and was present at the battle of Pinkie. He entered in 1549 into a bond of manrent with Mary of Lorraine, the Queen Regent. [from Sour
2 CONC ce #1]
2 CONT The only remarkable thing about William is that he chose for his wife Grissel Beaton, sister of his father's third wife. She bore him one son and three daughters. Of these, the eldest married Kerr of Fernihirst, and had a younger 
2 CONC son, Robert, who became Earl of Somerset; the second married a Johnston, and was ancestress of the Earls of Annandale; while the third, after escaping a sacrificial marriage with one of the clan Kerr, became husband of Carmichael 
2 CONC of Meadowflat, whose heir was Earl of Hyndford. Sir William Scott predeceased his father by about five months. His widow married Sir Andrew Murray of Blackbarony, "from whom," says Mr. Fraser[from Source #5], "the Murrays of Eliba
2 CONC nk are descended." [from Source #6]
2 CONT William married Grizel Bethune/Beaton, 34, F, daughter of John Betoun of Creich, 220, M & , 221, F. They had the following children:
2 CONT 58 Walter, 35, M. (~1549-1574) see notes below in "16th Generation"
2 CONT Janet, 147, F. Janet married Thomas Kerr of Ferniehurst, 148, M.
2 CONT Margaret, 228, F. Buried on 1 February 1618. On 7 August 1568 Margaret married Robert Scott of Thirlestane, 229, M.
2 CONT Elizabeth, 230, F. Elizabeth married John Carmichael of Meadowflat, 232, M.
2 CONT UNNAMED, 388, F. She married John Johnston of Johnston, 389, M.
2 CONT UNNAMED, 390, F. She married Walter Scott of Headshaw, 391, M."
2 CONT "Border Clan Scott History & Genealogy." 
2 CONT https://www.jamesette.com/border_scott/#58
