2 CONT
2 CONT *The Royal Families of England Scotland and Wales, with their descendants etc., by John and John Bernard Burke, London, 1848, volume 1, pedigree CXXXIX. 
2 CONT
2 CONT *The Register of the Privy Council of Scotland, edited by David Masson, LL.D., vols. IV & V, 1585-1592, 1592-1599, Edinburgh, 1881/1882, see index for two columns of Bothwell references in both editions. 
2 CONT
2 CONT *Scottish Kings, a Revised Chronology of Scottish History, 1005 - 1625 by Sir Archibald H. Dunbar, Bart., Edinburgh, 1899, p239. 
2 CONT
2 CONT *The Scots' Peerage by Sir James Balfour Paul, Edinburgh, 1905, vol. ii, p.169-171. 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Earl Francis STEWART 1st of Bothwell (1563-1613)
