1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "<strong>Sir Robert Innes, Baronet [S 1625] of that Ilk</strong>, 1st son and heir; succeeded to the Baronetcy on this father's death, and had (being then a Baronet) charter of his lands, 15 July 1661; was M.P. [S]
2 CONC  for Elgin, 1661-63 and 1678. He married Jean, daughter of James (Ross), 6th Lord Ross of Halkhead [S], by Margaret, daughter of Walter (Scott), 1st Lord Scott of Buccleuch [S]. She was served, 6 February 1649, coheir to her broth
2 CONC er, and again 19 October 1653, coheir to her mother."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524382#page/n299/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. II; page 281<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p20030.htm#i200296
2 CONT
2 CONT ''' Sir Robert Innes of that Ilk, 2nd Bt.''' 
2 CONT * Born after 1611.
2 CONT * Son of Rt. Hon. Sir Robert Innes of that Ilk, 1st Bt. and Lady Grizel Stuart.
2 CONT * Married Jean Ross, daughter of James Ross, 6th Lord Ross of Halkhead and Margaret Scott.
2 CONT * Died in February 1689.
2 CONT * Succeeded as the 2nd Baronet Innes [N.S., 1625] on 17 November 1658.
2 CONT * Member of Parliament (M.P.) for Elgin and Forres between 1661 and 1678.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Child of Sir Robert Innes of that Ilk, 2nd Bt.'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT * Margaret Innes d. 20 May 1676 '''Children of Sir Robert Innes of that Ilk, 2nd Bt. and Jean Ross'''
2 CONT * Elizabeth Innes
2 CONT * Marie Innes
2 CONT * Sir James Innes of that Ilk, 3rd Bt.
2 CONT * Jean Innes d. 11 Feb 1684
2 CONT * William Innes
2 CONT * John Innes
2 CONT * Idonea Innes
2 CONT * Grizel Innes  b. 20 Jul 1654, d. 1742 See link for sources
2 CONT <br/>
2 CONT
