1 TITL Col. Sir
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir James Innes, Baronet [S 1625] of that Ilk</strong>, 1st son and heir; succeeded o the Baronetcy on his father's death. He married (contract 18 July 1666) Margaret, 3rd daughter and coheir of Harry Ker, styled Lord Ker
2 CONC , by Margaret, daughter of William (Hay), Earl of Erroll [S], which Marry was only surviving son and heir apparent of Robert (Ker), 1st Earl of Roxburgh [S], but died v.p. and s.p.m. February 1642/3. She died before 25 February 16
2 CONC 91."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524382#page/n299/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. II; page 281
