1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===COLONEL SIR ALEXANDER MONTGOMERY===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Colonel Sir Alexander Montgomery is the son of Alexander, sixth Earl of Eglinton, and Anne Livingstone. He was born on 8 November 1615. He was educated with his elder brothers at Glasgow and in France, staying abroad until near
2 CONC  the close of 1635, when he returned to Scotland and served with the army. He rose to the rank of colonel, and was made a knight, as he is styled "Sir Alexander the Golonel". He served in the Scots army against the rebels, and die
2 CONC d unmarried in July 1642, leaving issue a natural daughter Katherine. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft/page/448/mode/1up The Scots Peerage III: 446-7]'''
