1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Margaret Montgomerie''' was born on 20 February 1617 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland, the daughter of Alexander Montgomerie, 6th Earl of Eglinton, and Lady Anna Livingstone.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1642, she married John Hay, 1st Earl of Tweeddale, as his second wife; they were the parents of William Hay of Drummelzier. Her second husband was William Cunningham, 9th Earl of Glencairn, Lord High Chancellor of Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in Edinburgh on 27 January 1665.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References'''
2 CONT *[https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft/page/446/mode/2up The Scots Peerage, Vol. 3, p. 450]; [https://books.google.ht/books?id=6UhmAAAAMAAJ&hl=fr&pg=PA450#v=onepage&q&f=true GoogleBooks] 
2 CONT *[https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun08pauluoft/page/446/mode/2up The Scots Peerage, Vol. 8, p. 446]
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
