1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==brief biography==
2 CONT 4th and youngest son
2 CONT
2 CONT <This> John inherited the title Lord Bellenden as he was the heir of his mother's father's cousin, Sir William Bellenden, 1st Lord Bellenden of Broughton.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2nd Lord Bellenden
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Date and place of birth have also been erroneously reported to be 1683 at an unspecified location.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==sources==
2 CONT * [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun02pauluoft#page/72/mode/2up The Scots peerage], Vol. II, page 72
2 CONT
