1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Is there any '''EVIDENCE''' that Thomas Stockton, a son of Robert and Isabel Stockton of Sadsbury Township, Lancaster County, Pennsylvania, married a Margaret Fleming / Flemming or that he married a Margaret?
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1743 Thomas Stockton and '''Frances''' were witnesses to a will, and in 1752 "'''Thomas Stockton & wife, Frances'''" are shown on a deed. The will of Thomas Stockton does not mention a wife, so it appears that Frances preceded 
2 CONC Thomas in death.
1 FAMC @F6000000002689486479@
1 RFN geni:6000000003124884134
1 SUBM @S6000000002574595678@
1 NOTE 2nd wife found on 1743 deed, leading to the conclusion that Margaret died before 1743, and was mother of only 4 of Thomas' children.
