1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Wikipedia Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>John Kennedy, 6th Earl of Cassilis</strong>, PC (d. April 1668) was a Scottish peer, the son of Hew Kennedy, Master of Cassillis and Katherine Macdowall...
2 CONT
2 CONT ...He succeeded to the titles of 8th Lord Kennedy and 6th Earl of Cassillis on on 25 July 1616. He was a non-sitting member of Cromwell's House of Lords, and was invested as a Privy Counsellor of Scotland on 13 Feb. 1660/61. He he
2 CONC ld the office of Justice-general 1649-1651 and of an Extraordinary Lord of Session for Scotland June 1661-July 1662...
2 CONT
2 CONT ...He married Lady Jean Hamilton, daughter of Thomas Hamilton, 1st Duke of Haddington and Margaret Foulis, on 7 January 1621/22.[2] They had three children:
2 CONT * Lady Catherine Kennedy d. c Feb. 1700
2 CONT * James Kennedy, Lord Kennedy d. 1642/43
2 CONT * Lady Margaret Kennedy He married Lady Margaret Hay, daughter of William Hay, 10th Earl of Errol and Lady Anne Lyon, on 15 March 1643/44. They had one child:
2 CONT * John Kennedy, 7th Earl of Cassilis (Nov. 1653 - 23 Jul, 1701)"
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: Wikipedia contributors, 'John Kennedy, 6th Earl of Cassilis', <em>Wikipedia, The Free Encyclopedia</em>, 16 November 2012, 18:10 UTC, <http://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=John_Kennedy,_6th_Earl_of_Cassilis&oldid=523
2 CONC 360993> [accessed 17 November 2012]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://www.kennedydna.com/Colonel_Gilbert_Kennedy_of_Ardmillan.htm%5D
2 CONT
2 CONT Proof for John as 6th Earl were
2 CONT *1.Retour as heir male of Earl John his uncle 21st Jan 1623
2 CONT *2.Retour as heir male of Earl Gilbert his grandfather 25th Jan 1623
2 CONT
2 CONT In GD25 exists a document 13 Dec 1634 'Extract Registered Renunciation by John, Earl of Cassillis, to be heir, or to enter heir in general or special, to Hew, Master of
2 CONT
2 CONT == Other References ==
