2 CONT *The Scots peerage : founded on Wood's ed. of Sir Robert Douglas's Peerage of Scotland; containing an historical and genealogical account of the nobility of that kingdom Author Paul, James Balfour, Sir, 1846-1931.  “Kennedy, Earl 
2 CONC of Cassillis.”  Page 475 [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun02pauluoft/page/475 Archive.Org]
