1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun02pauluoft#page/482/mode/2up The Scots peerage], Vol. II, page 482-485
2 CONT
2 CONT ===John Kennedy, 7th Earl of Cassillis1
2 CONT *M, #109748, b. November 1653, d. 23 July 1701
2 CONT *Last Edited=23 Jan 2011
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=1.33%
2 CONT
2 CONT John Kennedy, 7th Earl of Cassillis was born in November 1653. He was the son of John Kennedy, 6th Earl of Cassillis and Lady Margaret Hay.2 He married by contract, firstly, Lady Susannah Hamilton, daughter of James Hamilton, 1st 
2 CONC Duke of Hamilton and Lady Margaret Feilding, on 26 December 1668.1,2 He married, secondly, Mary Fox, daughter of John Fox and Mary Weld, on 27 February 1697/98.2 He died on 23 July 1701 at age 47.1
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded as the 9th Lord Kennedy [S., 1458] on 22 September 1668.2 He succeeded as the 7th Earl of Cassillis [S., 1509] on 22 September 1668.1,2 In 1670 he was the only person in Parliament who voted against the Act for punish
2 CONC ing coventicles, and for his illegal rotection of them, was outlawed.2 He was appointed Privy Counsellor (P.C.) [Scotland] in 1689 to King William II.2 He held the office of Lord of the Treasury [Scotland] between 1689 and 1695.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Kennedy, 7th Earl of Cassillis and Lady Susannah Hamilton
2 CONT #Anne Kennedy+3 d. c Feb 1699/0
2 CONT #John Kennedy, Lord Kennedy+2 b. c 1672, d. 1700
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Kennedy, 7th Earl of Cassillis and Mary Fox
2 CONT #Hon. James Kennedy4 b. b 1701, d. b 1759
2 CONT #Lady Elizabeth Kennedy4 b. b 1701
2 CONT #Lady Mary Kennedy4 b. b 1701
2 CONT
