1 NOTE {geni:about_me} According to the citation source at the Peerage Hugh Innes died without Issue, this would mean the source states there are no known children and all children should be disconnected until proof can be found. Also he
2 CONC  is not the father of Elizabeth ‘Bettie’ Innes Mitchell, her babtism record states, her father is Andrew Innes not Hugh. I suspect that Elizabeth Innes Foote is also not Hugh’s.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also According to the source at Peerage.com, this Hugh Innes died in Belgium and only 1 wife is mentioned.
2 CONT
2 CONT Name
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Hugh /Innes/[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources
2 CONT *http://www.thepeerage.com/p68737.htm#i687365 Hugh Innes was the son of Sir James Innes of that Ilk, 3rd Bt. and Margaret Ker.1 He died at Flanders, Belgium, without issue.1     He gained the rank of Sergeant in the Colonel Munro'
2 CONC s Regiment.1
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
