1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Katherine Campbell:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p10924.htm#i109235
2 CONT
2 CONT Katherine Campbell [1]
2 CONT *F, #109235, 
2 CONT *d. 1 October 1578
2 CONT *Last Edited=27 Jan 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Katherine Campbell married, firstly, James Ogilvy, Master of Ogilvy, son of James Ogilvy, 4th Lord Ogilvy of Airlie and Helen Sinclair, before 1 October 1539.[3],[4] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, David Lindsay, 9th Earl of Crawford, son of Walter Lindsay and unknown Erskine, in 1550.[5] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 1 October 1578 at Brechin Castle, Angus, Scotland.[3] Her will was probated on 2 June 1579.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Sir John Campbell of Calder and Muriel Calder.[1],[2] 
2 CONT *She was also known as Catherine.[6] 
2 CONT *From before 1 October 1539, her married name became Ogilvy. As a result of her marriage, Katherine Campbell was styled as Countess of Crawford in 1550. 
2 CONT *From 1550, her married name became Lindsay. 
2 CONT *Her last will was dated from 10 June 1578 to 10 August 1578.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Katherine Campbell and David Lindsay, 9th Earl of Crawford
2 CONT *1. Sir David Lindsay, Lord Edzell+[3] d. Dec 1610
2 CONT *2. John Lindsay of Balcarres, Lord Menmuir+[3] d. 3 Sep 1590
2 CONT *3. Sir Walter Lindsay [7]
2 CONT *4. Lady Elizabeth Lindsay+[7] d. May 1585
2 CONT *5. Lady Margaret Lindsay+[1] d. a 16 Jun 1589
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Katherine Campbell and James Ogilvy, Master of Ogilvy
2 CONT *1. Helen Ogilvy+[8]
2 CONT *2. Archibald Ogilvy [4]
2 CONT *3. Alexander Ogilvy [4]
2 CONT *4. Agnes Ogilvy [4]
2 CONT *5. James Ogilvy, 5th Lord Ogilvy of Airlie+[6] b. c 1541, d. Oct 1606
2 CONT
