1 NAME Alexander Elphinstone, 5th Lord Elphinstone
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 13 NOV 1577
2 PLAC Elphinstone, Stirlingshire, Scotland
2 ADDR
1 BURI
2 DATE 27 AUG 1648
