2 CONT
2 CONT http://records.ancestry.com/Grizel_Beaton_records.ashx?pid=39320372
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Hamilton, Lankashire, Scotland on 1500. Janet married David John Bethune and had a child. Janet married John Hopton and had 3 children. Janet married John Bethune and had 5 children. She passed away in Creich, Fife, Scotla
2 CONC nd. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://records.ancestry.com/Janet_Hay_records.ashx?pid=12685919
