2 CONT
2 CONT '''Anne Hamilton is the bastard daughter of James Hamilton, Earl of Arran, and Mary Boyd. [https://archive.org/stream/historicalgeneal00ande#page/84/mode/1up Hamilton Memoirs: p. 84-5] She married Hugh Somerville, Lord Somerville.
2 CONC  [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun08paul#page/18/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VIII: p. 18] [https://archive.org/stream/memorieofsomerv11815some#page/321/mode/1up Memorie of the Somervilles etc. Vol I, p. 321]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Anne Hamilton married Hugh, Lord Somerville, and they had two sons who died of smallpox. Anne died of smallpox in 1516. All three died within one quarter of a year. [https://archive.org/stream/memorieofsomerv11815some#page/332/
2 CONC mode/1up Memorie of the Somervilles etc. Vol I, p. 332]'''
