1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JEAN HAMILTON===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jean Hamilton, here treated, is one of the bastard daughters of James Hamilton, first Earl of Arran. In 1529 she is mentioned in her father's will, where she is said to be "now married to the first born son of Lord Somerville".
2 CONC  He left her £866.13.4 for "her dowry and bodily attire". [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft#page/365/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 365] The first born son of Lord Somerville appears to be James, Lord Somervil
2 CONC le. [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun08paul#page/21/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VIII: 21]'''
