1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Robert Crichton:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p524.htm#i5237
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Crichton of Kinnoull [1]
2 CONT *M, #5237, 
2 CONT *d. from February 1483/84 to February 1491/92
2 CONT *Last Edited=3 Feb 2012
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Crichton of Kinnoull was the son of Sir Robert Crichton, 1st Lord Crichton of Sanquhar and Margaret Hay.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Lady Marion Stuart, daughter of John Stuart, 1st Earl of Lennox and Margaret Montgomerie, in 1472.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died from February 1483/84 to February 1491/92.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived at Kinnoull, Perthshire, Scotland.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Robert Crichton of Kinnoull and Lady Marion Stuart
2 CONT *1. Robert Crichton, 2nd Lord Crichton of Sanquhar+[1] d. bt 13 Jul 1513 - 6 Nov 1513
2 CONT
