2 CONC am Fergusone [Ferguson] of Craigdarroch. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD77%2f105&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=craigdarroch&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1600&dt=1700&di=n National Records of Scotl
