2 CONT == [http://thepeerage.com/p20495.htm#i204945 COPIED FROM DARRYL LUNDY'S PEERAGE] ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Isabel Ruthven married, firstly, Sir Robert Gordon of Lochinvar. She and Sir Robert Gordon of Lochinvar were divorced in 1608. She married, secondly, Sir Hugh Campbell, 1st Lord Campbell of Loudoun, son of Sir Matthew Camp
2 CONC bell of Loudoun and Isabel Drummond, after 1608. She is the daughter of William Ruthven, 1st Earl of Gowrie and Dorothea Stewart. Children of Lady Isabel Ruthven and Sir Hugh Campbell, 1st Lord Campbell of Loudoun (1) Jean Campbel
2 CONC l (2) Margaret Campbell.'''
