2 CONT
2 CONT James Gordon of Buittle husband James Maxwell of Breckonside husband Alexander Maxwell son (son Alexander was born 1638 and died 1684, the Alexander that was born in 1671 is the grandson of James and Margaret (Vans) Maxwell of Bre
2 CONC ckonside) John Maxwell, 2nd of Breconside andTerraughty son
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Vans of Barnbarroch mother Sir John Vans of Barnbarroch father Rev. John Vans, AM brother Joseph Vance brother Andrew Vans half brother Janet Maxwell half sister Grizell Glendinnen half sister Florence Gordon half sister
