1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>John, third Viscount of Kenmure</strong>. He came of age in October 1641, and died, unmarried, in October 1643, aged twenty-three, and was succeeded by his brother."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft#page/120/mode/2up The Scots peerage], Vol. V, page 120
1 FAMC @F6000000014986859557@
1 RFN geni:6000000018575883156
