1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == JANET HAMILTON ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Janet Hamilton is the daughter of Margaret Hamilton of Broomhill. [https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi04scot#page/304/mode/1up RMS: 1364]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Janet Hamilton married Robert Dalziel, son and apparent heir of Robert Dalziel of that Ilk. [https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi04scot#page/304/mode/1up RMS: 1364]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Children ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Dalzell-1st-Lord-Dalzell-and-Liberton/6000000011336499861?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1526887338185&through=6000000009945619911
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Archibald-Dalzell/6000000011336657079?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1526887413306&through=6000000009945619911
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Dalzell/6000000011336650066?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1526887566858&through=6000000009945619911
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Gavin-Dalzell/6000000011338411384?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1526887665888&through=6000000009945619911
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Claude-Dalzell/6000000011338159781?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1526887709970&through=6000000009945619911
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Dalzell/6000000011337641826?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1526887793693&through=6000000009945619911
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Janet-Dalzell/6000000011338110034?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1526887809959&through=6000000009945619911
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Marion-Dalzell/6000000011338726230?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1526887940859&through=6000000009945619911
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Dalzell/6000000011338159826?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1526888022648&through=6000000009945619911
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Christian-Dalzell/6000000009945607511?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1526888060882&through=6000000009945619911
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''16 August 1559: Charter by which Robert Dalziel of that Ilk confirms that he has given his lands of Dalziel to his son and apparent heir Robert Dalziel and his wife Janet Hamilton, daughter of Margaret Hamilton of Broomhill. Hi
2 CONC s charter follows from a marriage contract dated 1 May 1558, agreed between him and Gavin Hamilton, commendator of Kilwinning Abbey, John Hamilton of Stanehouse, Archibald Hamilton of Raploch, John Hamilton of Broomhill, and Rober
2 CONC t Hamilton, chancellor of the Kilwinning Abbey, all of which Hamiltons are identified as the cousins of Janet Hamilton: "pro ipsis et onus super ipsis acceptantes pro eorum consanguinea Jonet H. filia Margarete H. de Broomhill." [
2 CONC https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi04scot#page/304/mode/1up Registrum Magni Sigilli Regum Scotorum.The Register of the Great Seal of Scotland, A.D. 1546-1580, charter number 1364 on p. 304]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[http://www.thepeerage.com/p20882.htm#i208815 Darryl Lundy's Peerage: Janet Hamilton]'''
