0 @I6000000026259493852@ INDI
1 NAME Margaret /Fleming/
2 GIVN Margaret
2 SURN Fleming
2 _MARNM Fleming
2 NICK Margaret Charteris
1 SEX F
1 DEAT
2 DATE BEF 6 JUN 1622
1 TITL Lady
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret Fleming''' was the daughter of John Fleming, 1st Earl of Wigton[1][2] and Lilias Graham, daughter of John, 3rd Earl of Montrose.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret (Fleming) Charteris married Sir John Charteris of Amisfield, Knight,[4] in 1613[5][6] and thereafter they had daughter Agnes Charteris.[7]
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter Agnes Charteris married Thomas Kirkpatrick, son of Thomas Kirkpatrick and probably Barbara Stewart, daughter of Sir Alex Stewart of Garlies and of Katherine, daughter of Andrew, Lord Herries of Terregles.[8]
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter Agnes and Thomas Kirkpatrick had son Robert Kirkpatrick[9] and daughter Margaret Kirkpatrick, grandmother of Margaret (Fleming) Charteris.[10]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From Burke's:
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret, m. in 1613, to Sir John Charteris, of Amisfield, and had issue. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Son:	
2 CONT # Francis Amisfield Charteris 1611 - 1636. ??
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===  Charteris of Amisfield
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/cc4aq/charteris02.php
2 CONT
2 CONT * 	A.	John Charteris, 9th of Amisfield (d 05.03.1577) 	m1. (mcrt 13.02.1548) Nicolas Grierson (dsp, dau of Sir John Grierson of Lag) m2. (1552) Janet Douglas (dau of Sir James Douglas, 7th of Drumlanrig)
2 CONT ** 	i.	Sir John Charteris, 10th of Amisfield (d c1616) 	m. (1581) Agnes Maxwell (dau of Sir John Maxwell, 4th Lord Herries)
2 CONT ***  	a.	Sir John Charteris, 11th of Amisfield and of Kirkmichael (d c1639) 	m. (1613) Margaret Fleming (d c1622, dau of John Fleming, 1st Earl of Wigtown)
2 CONT
2 CONT **** 	(1)	Sir John Charteris, 12th of Amisfield (d before 1654) 	m. (c1634) Catherine Crichton (dau of William Crichton, 1st Earl of Dumfries)
2 CONT
2 CONT ***  	b.	Robert Charteris of Kelwood and Duchra 	m. (1626) Barbara Maxwell (dau of Robert Maxwell of Dinwoodie)
2 CONT
2 CONT ***  	c.	William Charteris of Auchinstrowane (bur 06.06.1661) 	m. Catherine Marjoribanks (dau of Joseph Marjoribanks of Edinburgh)
2 CONT *** d.	Janet Charteris (d after 1636) 	m. (1605) David Dunbar of Baldoon
2 CONT *** 	e.	Elizabeth Charteris (d after 1645)	m1. John Jardine of Applegirth 	m2. (before 1645) John Maxwell of Castlemilk
2 CONT *** 	f.	Agnes Charteris 	m. (1599) Thomas Kirkpatrick of Closeburn (son of Sir Thomas)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
