2 CONT
2 CONT His son : — 
2 CONT James Douglas of Dornock married Isabella Man, and had three sons : — 
2 CONT (a) James (below). 
2 CONT (b) John Douglas. Will recorded 13th September 1717 (Dumfries). 
2 CONT (c) William Douglas of Bodisbeck, who apparently died s.p., as his brother James was retoured his heir, 21st September 1736. 
