2 CONC ueensberry, and Kelhead.”  Pedigree ll.  Page 23.  < [https://archive.org/details/heraldryofdougla00john/page/22/mode/1up Archive.Org] Person (38). 
2 CONT * Source: [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/dd/douglas09.php Stirnet: Douglas 09]
