1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===COLONEL ARCHIBALD DOUGLAS===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Archibald Douglas, here treated, is the son of https://www.geni.com/people/William-Douglas-of-Kelhead/6000000002415517066?through=6000000031857403287 and https://www.geni.com/people/Agnes-Fawsyde/6000000009688957189?through=600
2 CONC 0000031857403287 He entered the Army and attained the rank of colonel. He married, with issue one daughter. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun07pauluoft/page/147/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VII: 147]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Also see:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Sir William Douglas, 1st Earl of Queensberry (d 08.03.1640) m. (mcrt 20.07.1603) Isabel Kerr (d 1628, dau of Mark Kerr, 1st Earl of Lothian)
2 CONT **2. Sir William Douglas of Kelhead, Governor of Carlisle (d 1673) m1. Agnes Fawside (dau of George Fawside of Fawside)
2 CONT ***B. Archibald Douglas (Colonel, 4th son)
2 CONT ****i. daughter
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Source: [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/dd/douglas09.php#maxsp2 Stirnet - ‘Douglas09’]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. WILLIAM6 DOUGLAS (William5, James4, William3, James2, William1) was born in 1618 in Dumfries-shire, Scotland. He died in 1673 in Scotland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Agnes Fawside in 1637 in Scotland. She was born in 1618 in Scotland. She died in 1649 in Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT William Douglas and Agnes Fawside had the following children:.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 14. i.  JAMES7 DOUGLAS was born on 19 Sep 1639 in Scotland. He died in 1708. He married Catherine Douglas, daughter of James Douglas and Margaret Stewart in 1661. She was born in 1650 in Durisdeer, Dumfries-shire, Scotland.
2 CONT * ii. ARCHIBALD DOUGLAS was born on 02 Jan 1643 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland. He died in 29 1729 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland.
2 CONT * iii. GEORGE DOUGLAS was born in 1646 in Scotland.
2 CONT *iv.  ROBERT DOUGLAS was born on 02 Jan 1643 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland. He died in 29 1729 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland. He married Harriet Ella Gifford in 1663 in Midlothian, Scotland. She was born in 1645 in Scotl
2 CONC and.
2 CONT * v. WILLIAM DOUGLAS was born in 1637 in Dumfries-shire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT
