2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ROBERT7 DOUGLAS (William6, William5, James4, William3, James2, William1) was born on 02 Jan 1643 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland. He died in 29 1729 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''He married Harriet Ella Gifford in 1663 in Midlothian, Scotland. She was born in 1645 in Scotland.'' [NO: that’s a mixup with https://www.geni.com/people/Harriet-Douglass/6000000009688533551 who married Lt Col Hon Archibald Char
2 CONC les Henry Douglas-Pennant (b. 22 Nov 1837; d. 7 Sep 1884)] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Douglas and [Harriet Ella Gifford] ('''sic: his wife''') had the following child:
2 CONT
2 CONT 22. i. ARCHIBALD8 DOUGLAS was born in 1665 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland. He died on 29 Feb 1728 in Kent, Delaware, USA. He married Margaret Smith on 23 Feb 1699. She was born in 1665 in North Leith, Midlothian, Scotland.  
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>Record evidence needed for https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Douglas/6000000198189323821 as father of https://www.geni.com/people/Lord-Archibald-Douglas/6000000031856176588?through=6000000198189323821.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Source: < [http://www.thetintypeshop.com/family/Douglas/Surnames/DtoF/Douglas/kathrynpegelowgedcom_2012-03-09_2012-04-04_2012-08-18.pdf “Descendants of William Bruce”] > (2013) page 6 of 178
