1 NAME Agnes Douglas, Countess of Argyll
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Westminster, City of Westminster, Greater London, England
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1574
2 PLAC Morton, Dumfriesshire, Scotland
