1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lady Anne Campbell was born in 1594. She was the daughter of Archibald Campbell, 7th Earl of Argyll and Lady Agnes Douglas. She married George Gordon, 2nd Marquess of Huntly, son of George Gordon, 1st Marquess of H
2 CONC untly and Lady Henrietta Stuart, in 1607.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 14 June 1638.
2 CONT
2 CONT       Her married name became Gordon. As a result of her marriage, Lady Anne Campbell was styled as Viscountess of Aboyne on 20 April 1632. As a result of her marriage, Lady Anne Campbell was styled as Marchioness of Huntly on 13 
2 CONC June 1636.
