2 CONC bond by Alexander, earl of Eglinton to the lords of the treasury for accounts as sheriff of Renfrew, discharge by James Laurie to earl of Winton, post-nuptial contract between Sir Robert Montgomerie of Skelmorlie and Dame Anna Sco
2 CONC tt, bond of provision by earl of Eglinton in favour of Mr Hugh Montgomerie, his second son, discharge by Dame Barbara Gilmour, wife of Sir George Lockhart, advocate and other papers [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecat
2 CONC alogue/details.aspx?reference=GD3%2f2%2f66&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=robert+montgomerie+of+skelmorlie&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Montgomerie Family, Earls of Eglinton, reference GD3/2/66
