1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00042754&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT From the looks of it, Jean had Lady Margaret at age 13, then married Duncan.  Not sure how that all played out. She was born in Atholl, Argyall, Scotland and died at Glenorchy, Scotland.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sir Duncan had a 3rd family through liason with mistress Janet Burden-no marriage contract- which bore 2 children, James Campbell of Dalmarglen, and Patrick Campbell, 1st of Murlagenburg, later 1st of Edinchip. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Campbell-6404
