2 CONC the marriage of John Stewart, 8th Lord Innermeath, 25th Earl of Atholl and Mary Ruthven was signed on 31 March 1596.1,2 John Stewart, 8th Lord Innermeath, 25th Earl of Atholl died between August 1603 and October 1603 at Kincardine
2 CONC , Strathern, Scotland; Age about 37.1
