2 CONT >"In 1635 the estate was purchased from the Craufords by William Crichton, 2nd Earl of Dumfries (1598–1691). The estate, and the title, passed via his daughter to his grandson William Dalrymple-Crichton, 5th Earl of Dumfries and 4
2 CONC th Earl of Stair (1699–1768). He commissioned the Adam brothers to design a new house for the estate."
