2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander, Alexander (d. 1580/1).  Eldest son of William Alexander (d. 1574) and his wife Elizabeth, daughter of Alan Coutts or Couttie.  
2 CONT
2 CONT He married c.1567, Marion, daughter of Gilbert Graham of Gartavertane and had issue: 
2 CONT
2 CONT * (1) Sir William Alexander (c.1577-1640), 1st bt. and 1st Earl of Stirling (q.v.); 
2 CONT * (2) Janet Alexander, married Walter Cowan of Stirling and had issue; 
2 CONT * (3) Christian Alexander, married 25 September1592 Walter Neisch of Dubbiehead, bailie of Stirling (d. 1606) and had issue; died about 1618.
2 CONT * (4) A daughter;
2 CONT * (5) A daughter.
2 CONT
2 CONT He inherited Menstrie Castle from his father in 1574. He died 10 February 1580/81.
