2 CONT Margaret Seton[1]
2 CONT *F, #109520, 
2 CONT *b. between 1551 and 1558, 
2 CONT *d. before 10 February 1615/16
2 CONT *Last Edited=24 Mar 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Seton was born between 1551 and 1558. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Claud Hamilton, 1st Lord Paisley, son of James Hamilton, 2nd Earl of Arran and Lady Margaret Douglas, on 1 August 1574 at Niddry Castle, Scotland.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died before 10 February 1615/16.2 She was buried on 12 February 1615/16.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of George Seton, 5th Lord Seton and Isabel Hamilton.[1],[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT From 1 August 1574, her married name became Hamilton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Margaret Seton and Claud Hamilton, 1st Lord Paisley
2 CONT *1. James Hamilton, 1st Earl of Abercorn+[3] b. 12 Aug 1575, d. 23 Mar 1618
2 CONT *2. Sir John Hamilton+[4] b. a 1576, d. b 1604
2 CONT *3. Sir Claud Hamilton+[5] b. bt 1576 - 1588, d. 19 Oct 1614
2 CONT *4. Sir George Hamilton+[6] b. a 1577, d. b 1657
2 CONT *5. Margaret Hamilton [7] b. 1 Sep 1577, d. 23 Dec 1577
2 CONT *6. Sir Frederick Hamilton+[8] b. bt 1578 - 1603, d. 31 Mar 1646
2 CONT *7. Hon. Margaret Hamilton+[1] b. c 1585, d. 11 Sep 1623
2 CONT *8. Henry Hamilton [7] b. 13 Jan 1585, d. 15 Mar 1585
2 CONT *9. Alexander Hamilton [7] b. 3 Sep 1587, d. 11 Dec 1587
