2 CONT http://www.walkhighlands.co.uk/lothian/garleton-hills.shtml
2 CONT
2 CONT Athelstaneford and the Garleton Hills
2 CONT
2 CONT A panoramic walk along the spine of a modest range of hills offering substantial views over the surrounding countryside and coastline.
2 CONT
2 CONT Walk Description
2 CONT
2 CONT STAGE 2  [Photo of castle ruins]
2 CONT
2 CONT Turn left after the bridge and follow the field margin uphill to reach a farm track and a path junction. Now upon the ridge turn right along the track to pass the small fort atop Seaton Law and reach the remains of Barnes Castle, 
2 CONC a curious vaulted fortification that was never finished after being commissioned by Sir John Seton of Barnes who died in 1594. Continue past the ruins - now reappropriated for use as farm storage - to reach Barney Mains farm.
2 CONT
