2 CONT Children
2 CONT *	((1))	George Seton of Ramelrie, or also as "of Rameldrie" (Charter to his brother John Seton, and his uncle Patrick Seton, of the vicarage of Strathmiglo, dated 1590)
2 CONT * 	((2))	John Seton of Strathmiglo (Charter dated 1590), heir of his uncle, Captain Patrick Seton.	m. unknown
2 CONT *	((3))	Isabella Seton (b.c.1566, d?). m. Robert Maxwell of Calderwood.  They settled in Kilbride, County Armagh, Ireland.
2 CONT * 	((4))	Jane Seton (b.c.1580, d16??). m. Robert Echlin of Pitaddro (b.1576, d.1635).  He was later, in 1601, Minister of Inverkeithing in Fife, and in 1613 became Bishop of Down and Connor in Ireland.  They settled in Ardquin, Co
2 CONC unty Down, Ireland.
