2 CONC al Register House, Edinburgh, 1890), 1141 pp. including index]
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi08scot/page/n6/mode/1up Registrum Magni Sigilli Regum Scotorum. The Register of the Great Seal of Scotland, A.D. 1620-1633. Edited by John Maitland Thomson, MS., Advocate. (H.M. Gener
2 CONC al Register House, Edinburgh, 1894), 1095 pp. including index]
2 CONT
