1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===ALEXANDER COLQUHOUN===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Alexander Colquhoun is the third son of Sir Alexander Colquhoun of Luss. His mother is very likely Helen Colquhoun. He married Marian Stirling and they had a daughter named Jean Colquhoun, whose baptism was registered on 18 Jun
2 CONC e 1632. According to William Fraser: "Alexander Colquhoun appears to have died without surviving issue". [https://archive.org/stream/chiefsofcolquhou01fras#page/234/mode/1up Colquhoun I: 234-35]'''
2 CONT
