1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == NANCY COLQUHOUN ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Nancy Colquhoun is the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Alexander-Colquhoun-of-Luss/6000000007048442434?through=6000000005062324762 [https://archive.org/details/chiefsofcolquhou01fras/page/238/mode/1up The Chiefs of Colq
2 CONC uhoun I: 238] She and her brothers and sisters are mentioned in their father's last will and testament: "Att Rosdo, the sextein and sevintein dayes of Maij, the zeir of God jm vjc; and sevintein zeiris, the quhilk day the said All
2 CONC exander Colquhoun of Lus declairis out of his mouth that his bairnis, viz., Vmphra, Jeane, Allexander, Nans, Kathrein, Walter, Adame, Helein, Marie, and George Colquliounes, his la^vfll sones and dochteris, [are] to be his executo
2 CONC uris and intromettouris with his guidis and geir . . . . ." [https://archive.org/details/chiefsofcolquhou01fras/page/230/mode/1up Ibidem I: 230-1] The late Sir William Fraser had this to say about Nancy and her sisters Helen and M
2 CONC ary: "It has not been ascertained whether Nancy, Helen, and Mary Colquhoun had ever married, although it is understood that one of them became the wife of William Cunninghame of Laigland, in the parish and county of Ayr. [https://
2 CONC archive.org/details/chiefsofcolquhou01fras/page/238/mode/1up Ibidem I: 238]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
