2 CONC , and had issue : — 7. Mariot, married to William Stewart of Baldoran before 5 October 1498. p. 180 < [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun02paul/page/179/mode/1up?view=theater Archive.Org] > Sir Colin Campbell of Glenurch
2 CONC y, the eldest son, is said to have been "ane great justiciare all his tyme," and to have built the Chapel of Pinlarig." ... having married Marjory, daughter of John Stewart, Earl of Atholl.By her he had three sons, successively la
