2 CONC tewart, 1st Earl of Atholl, (she survived him and d. on the Isle of Toch Lay, on 26 July 1524), d. on 11 August 1523, and was the father of: 1. Sir Duncan Campbell, 4th of Glenorchy 2) Sir John Campbell, 5th of Glenorchy 3) Sir Co
