2 CONT ===Death===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''A date and place of death has not been identified for Lady Janet Haliburton. She was still alive on 26 August 1550, [https://archive.org/details/calendaroflaing00edin/page/149/mode/1up Ibidem, charter number 571 on p. 149] but 
2 CONC she died before 19 December 1562. [https://archive.org/details/calendaroflaing00edin/page/191/mode/1up Ibidem, charter number 749 on p. 191] The Scots Peerage account of the Haliburton family suggests that she died in about 1560. 
2 CONC [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04paul/page/337/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV; 337-8]
2 CONT
