1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Cecilia Ruthven
2 CONT * F, #12558, d. 8 July 1589
2 CONT * Last Edited=10 Feb 2011      Cecilia Ruthven was the daughter of William Ruthven, 2nd Lord Ruthven. She married Sir David Wemyss, son of Sir John Wemyss of Wemyss and Margaret Otterburn, on 7 May 1556. She died on 8 July 1589.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Cecilia Ruthven and Sir David Wemyss
2 CONT # Sir John Wemyss of Wemyss+ d. b Jun 1622
2 CONT # Sir James Wemyss
2 CONT # Andrew Wemyss
2 CONT # Patrick Wemyss
2 CONT # David Wemyss
2 CONT # Henry Wemyss
2 CONT # Margaret Wemyss+ d. Sep 1636
2 CONT # Jean Wemyss
2 CONT # Cecilia Wemyss
2 CONT # Elizabeth Wemyss
2 CONT # Isobel Wemyss
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/stream/memorialsoffamil01fras#page/371/mode/1up Memorials of the family of Wemyss of Wemyss,] by Sir William Frasier.  Published 1888 by [s.n.] in Edinburgh . Written in English.  Volume l.  "David Wemyss of
2 CONC  Wemyss, 1572-1597."  Page 187.  "Cecilia Ruthven, lady of Wemyss, predeceased her husband on 8th July 1589 ... Their children were six sons and five daughters ..."
2 CONT
