2 CONT ====Genealogy
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04paul#page/261/mode/1up The Scots Peerage vii: 261]
2 CONT # [http://www.thepeerage.com/p57158.htm#i571578 Darryl Lundy's Peerage]
2 CONT
2 CONT <nowiki>————————————————————————————————————————————</nowiki>
2 CONT
2 CONT >https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Ruthven-43 
2 CONT
2 CONT "Christian was the youngest daughter of William Ruthven of Gowrie, 2nd Lord Ruthven and his wife Janet Halyburton. Her date of birth was not recorded, but is estimated at about 1547, based on the birth dates of her siblings. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT "She married William Lundie of that Ilk.[1] [2] [3]
2 CONT
2 CONT "They had issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT "John Lundie who married Margaret Durie[3]
2 CONT "James Lundie [3]
2 CONT "Robert Lundie [3]
2 CONT "Elizabeth Lundie [3]
2 CONT "Christian Lundie [3]
2 CONT "Margaret Lundie, who married Michael Balfour. [3]
2 CONT "Katherine Lundie who married John Johnston of that Ilk.[3]
2 CONT "Jean Lundie [3] 
2 CONT
2 CONT "She died in 1575. [3] Her husband survived her and married secondly Elizabeth Lundie daughter of Robert Lundie of Balgonie and had 3 more children. [3]
2 CONT ''
