2 NICK III Baronet Glenarchy
2 NICK Glenfalloch and Glenorchy
1 NAME Sir Robert Campbell, 9th Laird, 3rd Baronet of Glenorchy
1 SEX M
1 OCCU M.P. for Argyllshire
2 PLAC Argyll, Scotland
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1575
2 ADDR
3 CITY Glenorchy
3 CTRY Scotland
