1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LRBW-MM9/patrick-para-dubhbeag-campbell-1598-1678
2 CONT
2 CONT When Patrick Para Dubhbeag Campbell was born in December 1598, in Glenorchy, Argyll, Scotland, United Kingdom, his father, Sir Duncan Campbell 7th of Glenorchy, 1st Baronet, was 48 and his mother, Lady Elizabeth Sinclair, was 23. 
2 CONC He married Annabelle Margaret Campbell of Dunstaffnage in 1620, in Glenorchy, Argyll, Scotland, United Kingdom. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 6 daughters. He died on 25 March 1678, in Glenorchy, Argyll, Scotland, at
2 CONC  the age of 79, and was buried in Glenorchy, Argyll, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------------------------
