2 CONT
2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir John Campbell, Baronet [S 1625] of Glenorchy</strong>, 1st son and heir , born about 1615; succeeded to the Baronetcy after 1647. He was M.P. [S] for Argyllshire, 1661-63. He married firstly in or before 1635, Mary, 1
2 CONC st daughter of William (Graham), Earl of Airth and Menteith [S], by Agnes, daughter of Patrick (Gray), Lord Gray [S]. He married secondly, Christian, daughter of John Muschet, of Craighead in Monteith. He died before 1677."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524382#page/n301/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. II; page 283
2 CONT
