1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun02paul/page/200/mode/2up
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir John Campbell, the eldest son of Sir Robert Campbell of Glenurchy succeeded him … He died in June 1686, having married, first, Mary, daughter to "William (Graham), Earl of Airth and Menteith. She died 28th January 1653, and wa
2 CONC s buried at Finlarig. By her he had issue :—
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. Isabel, second lawful daughter, married to Donald Campbell of Barbreck, contract 30 September and 28 December 1658, with issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/cc4aq/campbell43.php
2 CONT
2 CONT * Colin Campbell m. ?? (dau/heir of ?? laird of Barbreck)
2 CONT ** 1.	Colin Campbell (a 1575)
2 CONT ***  	A.	Sir Archibald Campbell of Barbreck (d c1630)
2 CONT ****  i.	Colin Campbell of Barbreck  	m. _ Campbell  	
2 CONT ***** a.	Donald Campbell of Barbreck (a 1690) m. (mcrt 1658) Isabel Campbell (dau of Sir John Campbell, 4th Bart of Glenurchy)
2 CONT ****** 	(1)	Archibald Campbell of Barbreck 	m. Barbara Stuart (dau of Sir Dugal Stuart of Bute)
2 CONT ***** 	b.	Duncan Campbell
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
