1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Beatrix Campbell''' was born on February 7, 1648 in Perth, Perthshire, Scotland (United Kingdom) and was baptized on February 7, 1648 in Kenmore,Perth,Scotland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatrix married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761630802 Robert Currie] on September 22, 1679, in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34761556368 Agnes Currie];
2 CONC  [https://www.geni.com/profile-34767454386 James Currie]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatrix married [https://www.geni.com/profile-127127012 William Robert Curry]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-49185658 William Curry]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on April 29, 1687, in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland (United Kingdom). 
2 CONT ----
