1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == ANNA BINING ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''At least one pedigree hosted by MyHeritage falsely claims that it was Anna Bining, here treated, who married https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-James-Graham-of-Airth-Kt/6000000032080683225 and had a daughter named Chri
2 CONC stian Airth.This is nonsense. Anna Bining's husband was https://www.geni.com/people/James-Airth/6000000184301693828?through=6000000040822641408 He is not the same person as https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-James-Graham-of-Airth-Kt/
2 CONC 6000000032080683225 [https://www.myheritage.com/names/anna_bining MyHeritage] [https://www.ancestry.co.uk/genealogy/records/james-airth-ggf-24-12jb041?geo_a=r&o_iid=41013&o_lid=41013&o_sch=Web+Property Ancestry]'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Anna Bining, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/James-Airth/6000000184301693828?through=6000000040822641408 '''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Children ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Grissel-Airth/6000000184301869823?through=6000000040822641408
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Anna-Airth/6000000184301944822
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Christian-Airth/6000000040822915042
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Graham Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun01pauluoft/page/149/mode/1up The Scots Peerage I: 137]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/gg/graham07.php Stirnet: Graham 07]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy by MyHeritage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Anna Airth (born Bining) was born in 1625, at birth place , to James Bining and Mary Margaret Bining (born Feilding) . James was born in 1606. Mary was born in 1609. Anna married James Airth . James was born circa 1623, in Pitt
2 CONC enweem, Fife, Scotland. They had 2 children: Christian Fleming (born Airth) and one other child.
2 CONT Anna passed away circa 1685, at age 60 at death place . [https://www.myheritage.com/names/anna_bining#:~:text=Anna%20Airth%20%28born%20Bining%29%20was%20born%20in%201625%2C,was%20born%20in%201609.%20Anna%20married%20James%20Airth 
2 CONC MyHeritage]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Fake Genealogy by MyHeritage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Anna Airth (born Bining), 1625 - 1685. Anna Airth was born in 1625, at birth place . Anna married James Graham of Airth . They had one daughter: Christian Airth . Anna passed away in 1685, at age 60 at death place. [https://www
2 CONC .myheritage.com/names/anna_bining MyHeritage]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Fake Genealogy by Ancestry ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Airth. Born in Pittenweem, Fife, Scotland on Abt 1623 to Sir William Graham ( Knight of Airth, Commissioner of Judiciary & Justice - General of Scotland, 6th Earl of Mentieth, Lord of Airth) and Agnes Grey Gray, (10GGM) C
2 CONC ountess of Menteith and Airth. James Airth (9GGF) married Anna Bining Bayning - Airth (9GGM) and had 4 children. He passed away on Abt 1683 in Pittenweem, Fife, Scotland. [https://www.ancestry.co.uk/genealogy/records/james-airth-g
2 CONC gf-24-12jb041?geo_a=r&o_iid=41013&o_lid=41013&o_sch=Web+Property Ancestry]'''
2 CONT
