2 CONC argaret Drummond). Alexander Gordon married Barbara Loggie of Ennis, their (I am assuming) Colonel William Stewart, a veteran of the wars and fought for Augustus Adolphus, bought the lands of Castle Stewart, Penningham, Scotland w
2 CONC hen he returned to Scotland. IHe married Elizabeth M"Clelland. their daughter and heiress Elizabeth married John Gordon of Cardoness. Their daughter and heiress, Elizabeth Gordon married Lord William Stewart, son of James Stewart 
2 CONC 2nd Earl of Galloway.
