2 CONC aret Stewart, and Jonet Stewart. Confirmation was granted to Margaret Stewart and her son Alexander on 5 February 1594. [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Commissary Court, The Testament Testamentar and Inventory of Johnne S
2 CONC tewart parson of Kirkmaho, reference CC8/8/26]'''
2 CONT
