2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000195710025833 Image of Testament]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Memorial Stone ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''HEERE LYETH THE BODYES' OF VIII CHILDREN SONNES & DAUGHTERS UNT JOHN STEWART OF BALLYMARREN. PATRICK STEWART OBIJT 1 OCTOr 1628. THOMAS THE 24 JUNE 1631 MARION 24 JULYE 1631. ROBERT 27 DECEMr 1634. LVDOWICKE 30 DECEMBr 1635. GR
2 CONC ISSELL 11AVGVSt 1638. ANTHONY 24 OCTr 1641. JOHN THE ELDEST SONN DYED THE 13 AVGVST 1642. Also the Body of JOANNAS ASTEWART GRAHAM Wife of John Alexr Graham, Grand Drand Daughter of the Late JOHN STEWART of Ballymorran Who died at
2 CONC  Antrim on the 7th day of FEBRUARY 1801. Aged 26 years. [https://www.findagrave.com/cemetery/2742647/memorial-search?firstname=&middlename=&lastname=stewart&cemeteryName=Killowen+Medieval+Church&birthyear=&birthyearfilter=&deathye
2 CONC ar=&deathyearfilter=&memorialid=&mcid=&linkedToName=&datefilter=&orderby=r&plot Find A Grave]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
