1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ===JOHN WALLACE OF CRAIGIE (formerly the tutor of Craigie)===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''According to Sir James Balfour Paull, John Wallace, tutor of Craigie, married, as her second husband, Katherine Kennedy, daughter of James Kennedy of Blairquhan and his wife Agnes Murray [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeerage
2 CONC fou00paulgoog#page/n433/mode/1up The Scots Peerage, IV, page 408]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the National Records of Scotland===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''21 August 1545: Charter issued under the Great Seal of Scotland which confirms possession of the lands of Dundonald to Lady Katherine Kennedy, widow of William, Lord Herries, and her second husband John Wallace, tutor of Cragy.
2 CONC   [https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi03scot#page/740/mode/1up charter number 3151 on page 740]'''
1 FAMS @F6000000071860297933@
1 RFN geni:6000000071860297929
