2 CONT >>Jane Dunbar, daughter of Patrick Dunbar of Sydera (currently Cyderhall) in Sutherland (between Skibo and Dornoch). She was first married to William Ross of Little Kindeace, Ross-shire, and, secondly to Captain Hugh Mackay, son o
