1 NAME William Dunbar, 1st of Hemprigg
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE BEF 25 NOV 1624
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} V. WILLIAM DUNBAR OF STRUTHERS, afterwards of Hempriggs (of one-third of which he got a charter in 1574), is called portioner of Hempriggs in his father's will, which is dated 25th February 1577. He married Catheri
2 CONC ne, the daughter (and heiress probably) of John Anderson of Struthers and Janet Gibson, his spouse, and he died on 25th November 1624. He had four sons and a daughter. (http://www.fionamsinclair.co.uk/genealogy/Caithness/Hempriggs
2 CONC .htm)
2 CONT
2 CONT William Dunbar was also known as William Dunbar (of Hempriggs) in some records.
2 CONT * William Dunbar married Margaret Anderson. William Dunbar was born illegitimate before 1555 at Scotland. William Dunbar (de Hempriggis) fil. nat. Alex Dunbar of Conze. Burke describes him as the youngest son. He was the son of Al
2 CONC exander Dunbar and Hon Elizabeth Forbes.
2 CONT * He was the first of Hempriggs, had a charter of that estate, 30 March 1576.
2 CONT * William died before 30 October 1636.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also http://thepeerage.com/p30513.htm
