2 CONC Camregane and Killoquhen [Killochan] ut supra. At Mayboill [Maybole]. Names of assize: Alan, lord Cathcart, John, lord Barganie [Bargany], Alan, master of Cathcart, Sir William Wallace of Craigie, Kt., Bt., Sir John Kennedie [Kenn
2 CONC edy] of Girvanmaynes [Girvan Mains], Kt., Bt., Archibald Kennedie of Culzeane [Culzean], John Mure [Muir] of Auchindraine, Quintin Kennedie of Drumellane [Drumellan], John Kennedie of Kirkmichaell [Kirkmichael], Thomas Kennedie of
