1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://www.thepeerage.com/p29941.htm#i299403 Helenmor Stewart]
2 CONT * F, #299401
2 CONT * Last Edited=18 Aug 2013
2 CONT * Consanguinity Index=0.04%
2 CONT
2 CONT Helenmor Stewart is the daughter of Hon. Robert Stewart and Elizabeth Dunbar. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Sir Thomas Kirkpatrick of Closeburn, 2nd Bt., son of Sir Thomas Kirkpatrick of Closeburn, 1st Bt. and Isabel Sandilands, on 18 February 1691 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Kirkpatrick. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S37] BP2003 volume 2, page 1512. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Thomas Kirkpatrick of Closeburn, 2nd Bt. 
2 CONT * M, #299402
2 CONT * Last Edited=20 Jul 2014
2 CONT * Consanguinity Index=0.01% 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Thomas Kirkpatrick of Closeburn, 2nd Bt. is the son of Sir Thomas Kirkpatrick of Closeburn, 1st Bt. and Isabel Sandilands  
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, firstly, Helenmor Stewart, daughter of Hon. Robert Stewart and Elizabeth Dunbar, on 18 February 1691. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, secondly, Isobel Lockhart, daughter of Sir William Lockhart of Carstairs, 1st Bt. and Lady Isabel Douglas, in 1702. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded to the title of  2nd Baronet Kirkpatrick, of Closeburn [N.S., 1685]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir Thomas Kirkpatrick of Closeburn, 2nd Bt. and Isobel Lockhart
2 CONT * 1.Sir Thomas Kirkpatrick of Closeburn, 3rd Bt.+2 b. 1704, d. Oct 1771
2 CONT * 2.James Kirkpatrick2 b. 1704
2 CONT * 3.William Kirkpatrick+2 b. 1705, d. 17 Oct 1777
2 CONT * 4.Robert Kirkpatrick2 b. 1717, d. 1781
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
