2 CONT GORDON
2 CONT
2 CONT Viscount KENMURE  In the he 10th of king Robert I    '''Sir Adam Gordon'''  in reward of his good services obtained from that prince the barony of Stickel in the county of Roxburgh and was succeeded by his second son 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''' William'''    in all his lands in the south from whom descended 
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-John-Gordon-Of-Lochinvar-Knight/6000000027466055394   Sir John Gordon of Lochinvar {Geni Profile} ] who in the reign of James IV marrying [https://www.geni.com/people/Annabella-Boyd-of-Kilmarnock/6
2 CONC 000000006727947032 Annabella]  daughter of Robert lord Boyd had a son
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/people/Alexander-Gordon-of-Kenmure/6000000003828038189  '''Alexander''] and by a second wife [https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Lindsay/6000000000748084281 Elizabeth Lindsay]  had three sons 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Gordon/6000000000748079340  '''Sir Robert his successor''']   
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/people/William-Gordon/6000000023597013861  William of Crauchlaw] ancestor of the Gordons of Pulvenan Grange Balmig &c and
2 CONT # John also two daughters.  
2 CONT
2 CONT His eldest son [https://www.geni.com/people/Alexander-Gordon-of-Kenmure/6000000003828038189 '''Sir Alexander who succeeded'''] was in great favour with James III but being slain in the battle of Floddon was succeeded by his brothe
2 CONC r 
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Gordon/6000000000748079340 '''Sir Robert''']     who marrying Marian daughter and sole heir of John Accasarlan of Glenshyre-burn had 
2 CONT * six  sons and 
2 CONT * three daughters
2 CONT *''' whereof Sir James his heir''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-John-Gordon-of-Lochinvar-Kt/6000000006322753199 Sir James   his heir]''' by [https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Crichton/6000000006768448247 Margaret his wife {GENI Profile} ] and heir of Robe
2 CONC rt Crichton of Kilpatrick had five and five daughters 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/people/Janet-Gordon-of-Lochinvar-Countess-Glengairn/6000000006454657243 Janet] married to William Coningham earl of Glencairn 
