2 CONT # James  and  
2 CONT # Alexander He was slain at the battle of Pinkie and was succeeded by his eldest son 
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-John-Gordon-of-Lochinvar/6000000006885224163   '''John''' who marrying to his first wise [https://www.geni.com/people/Juliana-Home/6000000002116161208 Juliana] daughter of Sir David Hume of  Wedder
2 CONC burn had one daughter
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Gordon/6000000002116161214 Margaret] married to Hugh lord Loudoun  and by his second wife [https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Gordon-Maxwell/6000000006885430083 Elizabeth] daughter of Joh
2 CONC n lord Herries ancestor of the earl of Nithisdale he had five sons 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-Robert-Gordon-of-Lochinvar/6000000006872959664 '''Sir Robert his heir '''] 
2 CONT # William  
2 CONT # John  
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/people/James-Gordon-of-Buittle/6000000014986859553 James]  of whom hereafter and  
2 CONT # Alexander  and four daughters 
