1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JAMES SINCLAIR OF MURKLE===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Sinclair of Murkle, styled Master of Caithness, who had a charter of the lands of Halcro and others, 20 April 1593, wherein he is designed brother-german of George, Earl of Caithness, who, on 19 April 1613, made a disposi
2 CONC tion to him of the quarter lands of Murchil. He married Elizabeth Stewart, third daughter of Robert, Earl of Orkney, natural son of King James V., by whom he had two sons and a daughter. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefo
2 CONC un02paul/page/340/mode/1up The Scots Peerage II: p. 340]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Death===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Sinclair of Murkle died before 5 June 1633. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD139%2f133&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Francis+Sinclair&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1670&di=n NRS: GD139/13
2 CONC 3]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the National Records of Scotland===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''5 June 1633: Signet letters of horning raised at the instance of Alexander Sutherland of Fors against Sir James Sinclair of Murkle for failing to pay to Alexander 4000 merks assigned (25 July 1629) to him by Francis Sinclair; w
2 CONC hich sum of money was due to Francis by the late James Sinclair of Murkle, his father, and the above Sir James, his brother, under the marriage contract (19 July 1621, registered Register of Deeds, 22 June 1632) between Francis on
2 CONC  the one part and Jonnett Sinclair [sic], daughter of the above Alexander Sutherland, on the other part. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD139%2f133&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Francis+
2 CONC Sinclair&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1670&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Sutherland family of Forse, Sutherland, reference GD139/133]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun02paul/page/340 The Scots Peerage II: 340-42]
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/saintclairsofisl00sain/page/195 The Saint-Clairs of the Isles: 195]
2 CONT # [http://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I2605&tree=CC Clan MacFarlane and associated clans genealogy]
2 CONT # [http://www.thepeerage.com/p2845.htm#i28447 Darryl Lundy's Peerage]
