1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Bio notes: From Davenport
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph, bap. 23 March 1734 proved his father's will in 1784. He married 18 May 1761 Mary Greaves and had a son George bap. at Halesowen 12 April 1762 and a daughter Sarah, bap. 8 Dec. 1771 at Frankley. He was apparently the Joseph
2 CONC  bur. at Halesowen 6 April 1 8 1 3, aged 75 but if so his age should have been given as 78. His son George, bap. 1762 married Elizabeth Foxell at Frankley 2 Dec. 1782 and had four children bap. there as shown above. George's stone
2 CONC  at Halesowen shows that he and his wife both passed the fourscore years :
2 CONT To the memory of Elizabeth
2 CONT wife of
2 CONT George Grove
2 CONT late of Hasbury who died Septr 2nd 1845 Aged 82
2 CONT Also the above George Grove who died July 27 1849 aged 87 years
2 CONT Also Joseph son of the above died June 8th 1856 Aged 65 years.
2 CONT To the memory of Rosa, Daughter of Joseph & Rose Grove of Lutley who died July 30th 1863 aged I year and 6 months
2 CONT Also of Joseph son of the above who died Novr 23rd 1873 Aged 4 years.
