1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===HELEN HEPBURN===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Helen Hepburne was married on 10 July 1446, contract dated 20 February 1445-46, to John Somerville, styled Baron of Carnwath, eldest son and apparent heir of William, second Lord Somerville, who afterwards succeeded as third Lo
2 CONC rd Somerville. She died before March 1456-57. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun02paul/page/141/mode/1up The Scots Peerage II: p. 141]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun02paul/page/141/mode/1up The Scots Peerage II: p. 141]'''
2 CONT # '''[http://www.thepeerage.com/p18645.htm#i186446 Darryl Lundy's Peerage]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/144445906/helen-somerville Find A Grave Memorial]'''
