2 CONT * http://www.thepeerage.com/p10802.htm#i108016
2 CONT * http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p137.htm#i4114
2 CONT * http://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I1265&tree=CC
