1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Mariotta Macdonald
2 CONT * Parents:	Donald MacDonald, Margaret (Mary) Leslie
2 CONT * Husband:	Archibald (Celestin) Campbell, Alexander Sutherland
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT # Marion (Mariota) Sutherland+5 b. c 1440, d. 1488.  Married William Calder
2 CONT # Marjory Sutherland.  Married William Sinclair
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT Scottish History Society volumes > Series 4 > Acts of the lords of the Isles, 1336-1493 > (139) Page 46 <[https://digital.nls.uk/scottish-history-society-publications/browse/archive/126624651#?c=0&m=0&s=0&cv=138&xywh=-320%2C-1%2C2
2 CONC 343%2C2825 link]>
2 CONT
2 CONT Precept by Alexander, earl of Ross and lord of the Isles, addressed to Alexander Sutherland of Duffus, John Sutherland of Golspie and the principal coroner of Caithness to give sasine to Alexander Sutherland and '''Mariota de Ile'
2 CONC '', '''sister of the granter''', of the lands of the lordship of Dunbeath with the castle and the lands of the lordship of Reay in the earldom of Caithness, sheriffdom of Inverness. Inverness, 24 October 1439.
2 CONT
2 CONT ======================
