1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daughter of Sir Duncan Campell and his 1st wife, Margaret (Marjorie) Stewart (daughter of Robert Stewart, Duke of Albany, governor of Scotland).
2 CONT
2 CONT While the references for her father Duncan state she died young, there is also a claim that Walter Stewart of Lennox, Master of Fife, had most of his children by an 'unknown' daughter of Duncan Campbell (1st Lord of Campbell) and 
2 CONC Marjorie Stewart.
2 CONT
2 CONT Since Celestine is the only identified daughter of Duncan & Marjorie, she is currently attached as the mother of most (if not all!) of Walter Stewart's children.
