1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  
2 CONT
2 CONT Hector Buie MacLean 3rd MacLean of Urquhart was born about 1430 in Urquhart, Inverness-Shire, Scotland.  The son of Charles MacLean and a daughter of Grant of Frenchie. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Mor MacKintosh.  They had 3 sons. She was the daughter of Gillecoluim MacKintosh.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hector married Marian McRory.  They had five sons.
2 CONT Marian was born in The Isles, Scotland about 1435
2 CONT
2 CONT Hector Buie MacLean married a daughter of Malcolm Beg MacIntosh.  They had two sons.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hector married Margaret Fraser. They had three sons. She was the daughter of Hugh Fraser.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hector died in 1461 at the age of 31.
2 CONT
2 CONT (The Genealogy of the Clan MacLean 3rd edition 2021 p 104 Entry 26)
2 CONT
