1 NAME Lachlan Cattanach Maclean, 11th Clan Chief
1 NAME Lachlan Cattanach //
2 GIVN Lachlan Cattanach
2 SURN Maclean
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1465
2 PLAC Duart Castle
2 ADDR
