2 CONT
2 CONT DESCENDANT OF MALCOLM III, DAVID I, THE ANCIENT KINGS OF SCOTLAND, SOMERLED LORD OF THE ISLES, AND LADY MACBETH
2 CONT
2 CONT DESCENDANT OF KING BRIAN BORU OF IRELAND, KING LOUIS VII OF FRANCE AND ELEANOR OF AQUITAINE
