2 CONT * Reference: [http://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I5717&tree=CC TNG Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Apr 12 2017, 0:54:09 UTC''
