2 CONT      Donald Macdonald, Lord of the Isles was the son of Iain Macdonald, Lord of the Isles and Margaret Stewart.2 He married Mary Leslie, Countess of Ross, daughter of Walter Leslie, Earl of Ross and Eupheme de Ross, Countess of Ro
2 CONC ss.1 He died in 1423.1
