2 CONC  of the Isles and Mary Leslie, Countess of Ross Alexander Macdonald, 10th Earl of Ross+4 d. 7 May 1449 Angus Macdonald4 unknown son Macdonald4 Anna Macdonald4 Citations [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Families: The Complete Gen
2 CONC ealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 221. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Families. [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Families, page 222. [S37] BP2003 volume 3, page 3402. See link for full details for this sou
2 CONC rce. Hereinafter cited as. [S37] [S37] BP2003. [S37] _________________________________________________________-
