2 CONT *Mother	Euphemia O'Beolan, Countess of Ross, Abbess of Elcho,   d. 1398 
2 CONT *Husband: Donald MacDonald, of Harlaw, 8th Lord of the Isles,   d. 1423 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mariota Leslie had by her husband, Donald, Lord of the Isles, issue — 
2 CONT
