2 CONT Marriage and children
2 CONT Alexander had two consorts with whom he fathered offspring. The daughter of MacPhee produced a number of bastard sons, and secondly he married Elizabeth, the daughter of Alexander Seton, Lord Gordon and had:
2 CONT
2 CONT John of Islay, Earl of Ross, who succeeded Alexander at age fifteen.
2 CONT Other children include:
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh MacDonald, Lord of Sleat
2 CONT Celestine MacDonald, Lord of Lochlash.[16]
2 CONT Margaret Macdonald(NO SOURCES CITED) 
2 CONT Florence Macdonald(NO SOURCES CITED) 
