1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===XI JOHN MACLEOD OF LEWIS (aka John MacTorquil)===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John MacLeod of Lewis, here treated, is the son of Torquil MacLeod of Lewis. The name of his mother is not known. [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/mac/macleod06.php Stirnet: Macleod 06]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Macleod was excluded from the succession when his father John was forfeited. The estates were restored to his uncle Malcolm in 1513 and John MacLeod, here treated, succeeded him. [https://archive.org/stream/historyofmacleo
2 CONC d00mack#page/292/mode/1up The History of the MacLeods: p. 292 for the family of  XI John MacLeod of Lewis]'''
