1 NAME Isabel /Oliphant/
2 GIVN Isabel
2 SURN Oliphant
2 _MARNM Dundas
1 SEX F
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == ISABEL OLIPHANT ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Isabel Oliphant, here treated, seems unlikely to be the same person as https://www.geni.com/people/Isobelle-Oliphant/6000000010515072326 '''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == The Question of Identity ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''According to John Burke's Commoners, published in 1836, Isabel Oliphant, here treated, is the daughter of Lawrence, Lord Oliphant. Verifiable evidence is not cited, and it is not clear where this information came from. [https:/
2 CONC /archive.org/details/genealogicalhera03burk/page/114/mode/1up Commoners 114] The Dundas of Fingask website appears to have accepted the claim made by Commoners, although, once again. verifiable evidence is not cited. Commoners is 
2 CONC not supported by John Maitland Thomson's account of the family, which was published in the Scots Peerage seventy-three years later. This makes no mention of a daughter named Isabel for Lawrence, Lord Oliphant. [https://archive.org
2 CONC /details/scotspeeragefoun06pauluoft/page/540/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VI: pp. 540-43]  
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/details/genealogicalhera03burk/page/114/mode/1up A Genealogical and Heraldic History of the Commoners of Great Britain and Ireland. Volume III. (1836): pp.114-5 for Dundas of Fingask]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06pauluoft/page/540/mode/1up The Scots Peerage Volume VI (1909): For the family of Lawrence, Lord Oliphant see pp. 540-43]'''
2 CONT # '''[http://dundasfamily.co.uk/record_61.htm Dundas of Fingask]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/oo/oliphant2.php#linklo Stirnet: Oliphant 02]
2 CONT # '''[https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/dd/dundas03.php Stirnet: Dundas 03]'''
