1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''William Oliphant of Newton''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Parents: Colin Oliphant, Master of Oliphant and Lady Elizabeth Keith. '''(see Below)'''
2 CONT * Wife: Oliphant, daughter of Andrew Oliphant. 
2 CONT * Death: 1588.3
2 CONT * Residence: Newton, Perthshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of William Oliphant of Newton and Margaret Oliphant
2 CONT * Laurence Oliphant of Newton and of Thrumster d. b 1605
2 CONT * John Oliphant
2 CONT * Alexander Oliphant d. b 1604
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations:
2 CONT * [http://www.thepeerage.com/p34918.htm#i349173 The Peerage]
2 CONT * Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 2, page 2996. 
2 CONT * Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT * Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition, volume 2, page 2997.
2 CONT
2 CONT  '''Lady Elizabeth Keith''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: William Keith, 2nd Earl Marischal and Lady Elizabeth Gordon. Husband 1: Colin Oliphant, Master of Oliphant, son of John Oliphant, 2nd Lord Oliphant and Lady Elizabeth Campbell, before 1513. Husband 2: William Sinclair, 4t
2 CONC h Lord Sinclair, son of Henry Sinclair, 3rd Lord Sinclair and Margaret Hepburn, after 17 April 1524. Death: 24 November 1549.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Elizabeth Keith and Colin Oliphant, Master of Oliphant
2 CONT * Laurence Oliphant, 3rd Lord Oliphant d. 29 Mar 1566
2 CONT * William Oliphant of Newton d. 1588
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Lady Elizabeth Keith and William Sinclair, 4th Lord Sinclair
2 CONT * Henry Sinclair, 5th Lord Sinclair b. fr 1527 - 1528, d. 21 Oct 1601
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
