2 CONT
2 CONT He married Hon. Elizabeth Hamilton, daughter of James Hamilton, 1st Lord Hamilton and Mary Stewart, Princess of Scotland, on 9 April 1494. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 9 September 1513.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of John Stuart, 1st Earl of Lennox and Margaret Montgomerie. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He gained the title of 2nd Earl of Lennox.
