1 NOTE Earl of Lennox
1 NOTE Matthew Stuart, 2nd Earl of Lennox was the son of John Stuart, 1st Earl of Lennox and Margaret Montgomerie. He was born before 5 May 1488.1 He married Margaret Lyle, daughter of Robert Lyle, Lord Lyle, before 13 June 1480. He marr
2 CONC ied Hon. Elizabethton, daughter of James Hamilton, 1st Lord Hamilton and Mary Stewart, Princess of Scotland, on 9 April 1494. He died on 9 September 1513. He gained the title of 2nd Earl of Lennox.
1 NOTE He succeeded his father in 1494. He and the Earl of Argyll commanded the right wing of the Scottish Army on 9 Sep 1513 at Flodden field and both fell in that disaster.
