1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == LADY ELIZABETH STEWART secundus ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Elizabeth Stewart is the daughter of John, Earl of Lennox, and his wife Margaret Montgomery. [https://archive.org/stream/chiefsofcolquhou01fras#page/72/mode/1up The Chiefs of Colquhoun, i, 72] She is not the same person as
2 CONC  https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Stuart-Countess-of-Argyle/6000000000850596018?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1569435087259&through=6000000002991797769 who appears to be her sister german. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeerage
2 CONC foun05pauluoft/page/350 The Scots Peerage V: 350]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Elizabeth Stewart married Sir John Colquhoun of Luss. According to William Fraser, they were married in about 1480. [https://archive.org/stream/chiefsofcolquhou01fras#page/72/mode/1up  Colquhoun I: 72]'''
2 CONT
