2 CONC odified 28 Aug 2017 | Created 27 May 2011 This page has been accessed 1,745 times. Biography The fifth child of John Stewart, 1st Earl of Lennox (2nd creation, 1488) and Margaret Montgomery, she was also known as Margaret.[1] Base
2 CONC d on her marriage of about 1480 to Sir John Colquhoun of Luss her birth was by 1464. Based on the assumed birth date of her son, she died after 1495, probably well after.[2] Sources ↑ #S2 The Peerage ↑ #S1 Burke's Peerage, Baronet
