1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===LADY JANET STEWART===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Janet Stewart is the daughter of John, second Earl of Atholl, and his wife Janet Campbell. [https://archive.org/details/cu31924092516180/page/n482/mode/1up The Scots Peerage I: 443]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===First Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Janet Stewart married Alexander, Master of Sutherland. in about 1520.  [https://archive.org/details/cu31924092516180/page/n482/mode/1up The Scots Peerage I: 443] [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04paul#page/261/
2 CONC mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 261]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Second Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Janet Stewart married Sir Hugh Kennedy of Girvanmains before 1532. [https://archive.org/details/cu31924092516180/page/n482/mode/1up The Scots Peerage I: 443] [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04paul#page/261/mode
2 CONC /1up The Scots Peerage IV: 261]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Third Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Janet Stewart married Henry Stewart, first Lord Methven before 1544. [https://archive.org/details/cu31924092516180/page/n482/mode/1up The Scots Peerage I: 443]  [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04paul#page/261/m
2 CONC ode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 261]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Fourth Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Janet Stewart married Patrick, third Lord Ruthven in 1557. [https://archive.org/details/cu31924092516180/page/n482/mode/1up The Scots Peerage I: 443] [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04paul#page/261/mode/1up The
2 CONC  Scots Peerage IV: 261]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/cu31924092516180/page/n482/mode/1up The Scots Peerage I: 443]
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04paul#page/261/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 261]
2 CONT # [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#John2Atholldied1521 Foundation for Medieval Genealogy: Scotland, Mormaers, Earls, Lords]
2 CONT # [http://thepeerage.com/p1014.htm#i10136 Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Lady Janet Stewart]
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#John2Atholldied1521ROM FOUNDATION FOR MEDIEVAL GENEALOGY]
2 CONT
2 CONT JOHN Stewart, son of Sir JOHN Stewart of Balveny 1st Earl of Atholl & his second wife Eleanor Sinclair (-1521).  2nd Earl of Atholl. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m JANET Campbell, daughter of ARCHIBALD Campbell 2nd Earl of Argyll & his wife Elizabeth Stewart of the Earls of Lennox (-[2 Feb 1546]). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Earl John & his wife had six children: 
2 CONT *1.         HELEN (-1577).  m firstly JOHN 5th Lord Lindsay (-1562).  m secondly THOMAS Morieux .
2 CONT *2.         JEAN .  m (1507) JAMES Arbuthnott of Arbuthnott (-before 1521).
2 CONT *3.         ELIZABETH .  m (1538) KENNETH Mackenzie of Kinkall (-1568).
2 CONT *4.         JOHN (6 Oct 1507-[Nov] 1542).  3rd Earl of Atholl.  m firstly (1521) GRIZEL Rattray, daughter of Sir JOHN Rattray of that Ilk & his wife --- (-after 1533).  m secondly (1541) as her first husband, JEAN, daughter of JOH
2 CONC N 6th Lord Forbes & his third wife Elizabeth Lady Elphinstone née Barlow.  She married secondly (after 17 Nov 1545) Alexander Hay of Dalgety, and thirdly (before 17 Jan 1550) as his first wife, William Leslie of Balquhar.  Earl Jo
2 CONC hn & his first wife had eight children:
2 CONT **a)         BARBARA .  m (1536) JAMES Menzies .
2 CONT **b)         ISABEL .  m (1552) WILLIAM Stuart of Grandtully. 
2 CONT **c)         MARGARET (-1540).  m (1539) JOHN Grant Lord of Freuchie.
2 CONT **d)         HELEN .  m JOHN Macfarlane . 
2 CONT **e)         JOHN (-Stirling 24 Apr 1579, bur Edinburgh St Giles´s Church).  4th Earl of Atholl.  m firstly (before 26 May 1547) ELIZABETH Gordon, daughter of GEORGE Gordon 4th Earl of Huntly & his wife Elizabeth Keith.  m secondl
2 CONC y (contract 1 Apr 1557) as her third husband, MARGARET, widow firstly of ROBERT Graham Lord Graham and secondly of THOMAS Erskine Master of Erskine, daughter of MALCOLM 3rd Lord Fleming & his wife Joan Stewart [of Scotland] (-afte
2 CONC r 15 Aug 1584).  
2 CONT **Earl John & his first wife had one child:
2 CONT ***i)          ELIZABETH (-1595).  m firstly (1567) HUGH Fraser 5th Lord Lovat (-1577).  m secondly (1578, divorced 1581) ROBERT Stuart Earl of Lennox [Bishop of Caithness].  m thirdly (1581) JAMES Stuart Earl of Arran, son of AND
2 CONC REW Stewart 2nd Lord Ochiltree & his wife Agnes Cuningham (-1595). 
2 CONT **Earl John & his second wife had five children: 
2 CONT ***ii)         MARGARET .  m (before 1578) GEORGE Abernethy 7th Lord Saltoun . 
2 CONT ***iii)        JEAN (-1593).  m (1573) Sir DUNCAN Campbell of Glenorchy (-1631). 
2 CONT ***iv)       JOHN (Dunkeld 22 May 1563-Perth 25 Aug 1595).  5th Earl of Atholl.  m (Perth 24 Jan 1580) as her first husband, MARY Ruthven, daughter of WILLIAM Ruthven 1st Earl Gowrie & his wife Dorothea Stewart of Methven.  She ma
2 CONC rried secondly (contract 31 Mar 1596) as his second wife, John Stewart Earl of Atholl.  
2 CONT ***Earl John & his wife had five children: 
2 CONT ****(a)       MARGARET (-young). 
2 CONT ****(b)       DOROTHEA .  m (1604) WILLIAM Murray 2nd Earl of Tullibardine . 
2 CONT ****(c)       MARY Stewart .  m firstly (1603) JAMES Stewart Earl of Atholl, son of JOHN Stewart 6th Lord Innermeath, Earl of Atholl & his first wife Margaret Lindsay of Crawford (1583-1625).  m secondly (1626) Captain PETER Rollo
2 CONC ck . 
2 CONT ****(d)       JEAN Stewart (-1623).  m firstly (1603) HENRY Stuart 1st Lord St Colme, son of JAMES Stuart 1st Lord Doune & his wife Margaret Campbell of Argyll (-1612).  m secondly NICOL Bellenden of Standenflat.
2 CONT ****(e)       ANNE (-1635).  m (1604) ANDREW Stewart Master of Ochiltree (-1639).
2 CONT ***v)        GRIZEL .  m (1581) DAVID Lindsay 11th Earl of Crawford (-1607).
2 CONT ***vi)       MARY (-[1588]). m (1587) FRANCIS Hay 9th Earl of Erroll .
2 CONT ****f)          JEAN .  m firstly JOHN Otterburn (-1595).  m secondly GEORGE Crawford . 
2 CONT ****g)         daughter .  m --- Lord of Balfour . 
2 CONT ****h)         daughter .  m WALTER Wood of Balbegno . 
2 CONT *5.         ISABEL .  m JAMES Herring of Lethendy.
2 CONT *'''6.         JANET .  m firstly (1520) ALEXANDER Gordon Master of Sutherland (1501-1530).  m secondly (1532, divorced) Sir HUGH Kennedy of Girvanmains (-after 1568).  m thirdly (1546) as his third wife, HENRY Stuart Lord Methven
2 CONC , son of ANDREW Stewart Lord Avondale & his wife Lady Margaret Kennedy ([1495/1500]-soon after 10 Oct 1551).  m fourthly (1557) as his second wife, PATRICK 2nd Baron Ruthven .'''
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://thepeerage.com/p1014.htm#i10136 From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Lady Janet Stewart]
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Janet Stewart [1]
2 CONT *F, #10136
2 CONT * Last Edited=14 Aug 2018
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.48%
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Janet Stewart married, fourthly, Patrick Ruthven, 3rd Lord Ruthven, son of William Ruthven, 2nd Lord Ruthven and Janet Halyburton, Lady Dirletoun.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, firstly, Alexander Gordon, Master of Sutherland, son of Adam Gordon and Elizabeth de Moravia, Countess of Sutherland, circa 16 June 1520. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, Sir Hew Kennedy of Girvanmains before 1532. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, thirdly, Henry Stewart, 1st Lord Methven, son of Andrew Stewart, 1st Lord Avandale and Margaret Kennedy, before 1544.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of John Stewart, 2nd Earl of Atholl and Lady Janet Campbell.[1] 
2 CONT *Her married name became Ruthven. 
2 CONT *Her married name became Gordon. As a result of her marriage, Lady Janet Stewart was styled as Dowager Countess of Sutherland.[1] 
2 CONT *Her married name became Kennedy. 
2 CONT *Her married name became Stewart.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Lady Janet Stewart and Sir Hew Kennedy of Girvanmains
2 CONT * Margaret Kennedy+4
2 CONT * Barbara Kennedy+5
2 CONT * Helen Kennedy5
2 CONT *
2 CONT Children of Lady Janet Stewart and Alexander Gordon, Master of Sutherland
2 CONT *1. John Gordon, 11th Earl of Sutherland+ d. 23 Jun 1567
2 CONT *2. Alexander Gordon d. c 1552
2 CONT *3. Janet Gordon
2 CONT *4. Beatrice Gordon
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Janet Stewart and Henry Stewart, 1st Lord Methven
2 CONT *1. Henry Stewart, 2nd Lord Methven+ d. bt 3 Mar 1571 - 1572
2 CONT *2. Dorothea Stewart+
2 CONT *3. Joan Stewart1 b. a 1533
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Pedigree 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.multiwords.de/genealogy/kennedy01.htm 
2 CONT
2 CONT *a.	John Kennedy, 2nd Lord b before 12.10.1454, d 1508: m1 before 25.03.1459 Elizabeth Montgomery dau of Alexander Montgomery, 1st Lord; m2 before 30.06.1471 Elizabeth Gordon d 17.04.1500, dau of Alexander Seton, 1st Earl Huntly
2 CONT **5	Alexander Kennedy, 1st of Girvan Mains or Girvanmains a 1481
2 CONT ***A	Hugh Kennedy, 2nd of Girvan Mains m by 1531 Janet Stewart b 1500, dau of John Stewart, 2nd Earl of Atholl 4 children identified in the Vans family site mentioned as a Main Source for 'Agnew01'.
2 CONT **** i	Gilbert Kennedy of Girvan Mains
2 CONT **** ii	Margaret Kennedy m Uchtred Macdowall, 12th of Garthland d 1593
2 CONT **** iii	Elizabeth Kennedy m Sir Patrick Vaus or Vans of Barnbarroch d 22.12.1597
2 CONT **** iv	Barbara Kennedy m mcrt 30.09.1554 Sir John Bellenden 
2 CONT **** v.	Helen Kennedy probably of this generation m by 22.04.1556 Laurence Bruce, 4th of Cultmalundy d 08.1617.
2 CONT *** partners unknown
2 CONT ***B+	other issue - Alexander a 1542, George a 1542
2 CONT
