2 CONC  337. 9 Acts and Decreets, i. ff. 361, 364 ; Seventh Report Hist. MSS. Com., App. 713. 10 Complete Peerage; Reg. Mag. Sig., 17 March 1537-38. » Macfarlane's Gen. Coll., ii. 214. 12 Acts and Decreets, i. ff. 508, 525''
2 CONT
2 CONT .as his first wife, William Leslie of Balquhain.1 He left issue : —
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. JOHN, fourth Earl.2
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Barbara, married, contract 20 May 1536, to James Menzies of that Ilk.3
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Isabel, married, before 25 March 1552, to William Stewart of Grandtully.4
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Margaret, married, before 19 February 1539, to John Grant, fourth of Freuchie. She died in 1555.5
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Helen, stated to have been married to Sir John Mac-farlane of that Ilk.6
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Jean, stated to have been the Joneta Stewart, relict in 1595 of John Otterburn of Redhall.7
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. Daughter stated to have been married to the Laird of Balfour.
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. Daughter stated to have been married to the Laird of Balbednach8 or Wood of Balbegno.9
2 CONT
