1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lady Elizabeth Stewart formerly Campbell aka Gordon Born 1502 [location unknown] Daughter of Colin (Campbell) Third Earl of Argyll and Janet (Gordon) Campbell Sister of Alasdair Campbell, John Campbell, Archibald (
2 CONC Campbell) fourth Earl of Argyll and Agnes Campbell of Argyll	 Wife of John (Gordon) eleventh Earl of Sutherland — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Wife of James (Stewart) First Earl of Moray — married August 1529 [locatio
2 CONC n unknown] Mother of Lady Mary Stewart	 Died about 1548 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Colin Campbell, 3rd Earl of Argyll and Jean Gordon: Archibald Campbell, 4th Earl of Argyll d. bt 21 August 1558 – 2 December 1558, married three times. Lady Elizabeth Campbell d. c 1548, married; firstly, James Stewart
2 CONC , 1st Earl of Moray, an illegitimate son of King James IV; secondly, John Gordon, 11th Earl of Sutherland[1] Lady Agnes Campbell (1526–1601), married James MacDonald and Turlough Luineach O'Neill. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Campbell-5893
2 CONT
2 CONT " b. between 1512 and 1526, d. before 25 November 1564"
2 CONT
