1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Janet Kennedy
2 CONT *Daughter of Gilbert Kennedy, 2nd Earl of Cassillis and Isabel Campbell
2 CONT *Wife of Fergus McDowall — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT *Wife of Alexander Vaus — married before 1557 (to 1566) in Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Janet Kennedy was the daughter of Gilbert Kennedy, 2nd Earl of Cassillis and Lady Isabel Campbell.1 She married Alexander Vaus of Barnbarroch, son of John Vaus of Barnbarroch and Janet McCulloch, before 1566.1 She died in 1566.1
2 CONT
2 CONT From before 1566, her married name became Vaus.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Janet Kennedy and Alexander Vaus of Barnbarroch
2 CONT *Helen Vaus1 b. 1557
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
