1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Marion was the eldest daughter of her parents. Her place of birth is unknown but in her marriage contract (14 Sept 1469) she is aged 12 which would give her a year of birth as 1457. It is unclear when and where she
2 CONC  died.  According to Sir Richard Maitland (whose grandmother this is) there were three sons and two daughters. Her husband also had many bastards including William, James, Christel and Thomas, and four daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children George,3rd Lord Seton (eldest surviving son) Robert Seton (second son) John Seton (third son) Martha Seton (eldest daughter) Katherine Seton (second daughter, a nun) Christian Seton
