1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.thepeerage.com/p10801.htm#i108007
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian Lindsay was the daughter of John Lindsay, 1st Lord Lindsay of the Byres and Agnes Stewart.2,3 She married, firstly, John Seton, Master of Seton, son of George Seton, 1st Lord Seton and Margaret Stewart, circa 20 January 
2 CONC 1458/59.2 She married, secondly, Robert Cuninghame, 2nd Earl of Glencairn, son of Alexander Cuninghame, 1st Earl of Glencairn and Margaret Hepburn, before 19 July 1476.4 She died between 1491 and 11 March 1496.2  From circa 20 Jan
2 CONC uary 1458/59, her married name became Seton. From before 19 July 1476, her married name became Cunningham.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Christian Lindsay and Robert Cuninghame, 2nd Earl of Glencairn
