1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT === Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Herries-1
2 CONT
2 CONT Janet[citation needed] was the daughter of Herbert Herries and Margaret Douglass[1][2][3]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Herbert Maxwell.[1][2][3][4] They had issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Robert, second Lord Maxwell[2][3]
2 CONT # Edward, ancestor of the Maxwells of Tinwald.[2][3]
2 CONT # Catherine, married GIlbert Kennedy[2][5]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Research Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT The source for the given name 'Janet' is unknown (other than it showing in Ancestry citations of ' Netherlands, GenealogieOnline Trees Index'). Most sources describe her as merely a daughter of Herbett Herris of Terregles.
2 CONT
2 CONT
