1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Herbert Maxwell, 1st Lord Maxwell=
2 CONT * Born about 1388 [uncertain] in Caerlaverock Castle, Dumfries-shire, Scotland 
2 CONT * Died before 14 Feb 1454 before about age 66 in Caerlaverock Castle, Dumfries-shire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Maxwell-865
2 CONT
2 CONT Herbert was the son of Herbert Maxwell, 10th of Maxwell and Katherine Stewart.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Herbert was created a Lord of Parliament as Lord Maxwell.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married firstly, Janet Herries.[2][3][4][5] They had the following children.
2 CONT
2 CONT # Robert, second Lord Maxwell[2][4]
2 CONT # Edward, ancestor of the Maxwells of Tinwald.[2][4]
2 CONT # Katherine, married GIlbert Kennedy[2][6][7]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married secondly, Katherine Seton.[2][5] They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # George, ancestor of Maxwells of Carnsalloch in the county of Dumfries[2]
2 CONT # David[2]
2 CONT # Adam, ancestor of Maxwells of Southbar in Renfrewshire[2]
2 CONT # John[2]
2 CONT # WIlliam[2]
2 CONT # Janet[2]
2 CONT # Maria[2][8]
2 CONT
2 CONT He also had a child whose mother has not been determined.
2 CONT # Gavin[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Herbert passed away before 14 February 1453/54.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Research Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT It should be noted that there is no evidence available as to exactly where he was born, or died.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
