2 CONT ROBERT, the second Lord Maxwell, obtained a grant of Eskdale, which remained for nearly two centuries in the possession of the family, but is now the property of the Duke of Buccleuch. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.electricscotland.com/webclans/families/maxwells.htm
