2 CONT ========================
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://archive.org/stream/maxwellhistoryge00hous#page/10/mode/2up Maxwell History]  has no birth dated given for  him or his son.  thus I have changed  the  birth date to reflect this.
2 CONT
2 CONT ___________________
2 CONT *'''Sir Robert Maxwell, 2nd Lord Maxwell, Lord Carlaverock1,2
2 CONT *'''M, #4105, d. between 22 April 1485 and 29 April 1486
2 CONT *Father      Sir Herbert Maxwell, 1st Lord Maxwell d. b 4 Feb 1454
2 CONT *Mother     Catherine Seton b. c 1410, d. b 7 Feb 1478
2 CONT *'''     Sir Robert Maxwell, 2nd Lord Maxwell, Lord Carlaverock was born at of Carlaverock, Scotland. He married Janet Forrester, daughter of Sir John Forrester, 2nd Laird of Corstorphine, Chamberlain of Scotland and Jean Sinclair
2 CONC , between 13 January 1425 and 4 February 1425. Sir Robert Maxwell, 2nd Lord Maxwell, Lord Carlaverock died between 22 April 1485 and 29 April 1486.
2 CONT *'''Family      Janet Forrester d. a 1488
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **John Maxwell, Master of Maxwell+ d. 22 Jul 1484
2 CONT **Agnes Maxwell+ b. c 1430
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S11568] The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain, and the United Kingdom, by George Edward Cokayne, Vol. VIII, p. 590-591.
2 CONT * 2.[S11585] The Scots Peerage, Vol. VI, edited by Sir James Balfour Paul, p. 476-477.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p137.htm#i4105 _______________________
2 CONT *'''Robert Maxwell, 2nd Lord Maxwell1
2 CONT *'''M, #364969, d. between 22 April 1485 and 29 April 1486
2 CONT *Last Edited=11 Mar 2014
2 CONT *'''     Robert Maxwell, 2nd Lord Maxwell was the son of Herbert Maxwell, 1st Lord Maxwell and unknown Herries.2 He married Janet Forrester, daughter of Sir John Forrester of Corstorphine and Jean Sinclair, from 13 January 1424/25
2 CONC  to 4 February 1424/25.3 He died between 22 April 1485 and 29 April 1486.1
2 CONT *'''     He gained the title of 2nd Lord Maxwell.
2 CONT *'''Child of Robert Maxwell, 2nd Lord Maxwell and Janet Forrester
2 CONT ** 1.John Maxwell, Master of Maxwell+1 d. 22 Jul 1484
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Exti
2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume VIII, page 590. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT * 2.[S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume VIII, page 589.
2 CONT * 3.[S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume VIII, page 591.
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p36497.htm#i364969 _________________________
2 CONT *'''Robert Maxwell, 2nd Lord Maxwell[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]
2 CONT *'''Died   22 Apr-8 May 1485  [2] 
2 CONT *'''Notes  ◦IDENTITY: Robert was served heir to his father in the lands of Carlaverock, 14 February 1453-54. As Admiral and Warden of the Marches he was a conservator of truces with England in 1457 and 1459. Though of the party of
2 CONC  the Boyds in the minority of James III., he attended Parliament in November 1469, when the Boyds were condemned. He died between 22 April and 8 May 1485, having married (probably in his minority) before 4 February 1424-25, Janet,
2 CONC  daughter of Sir John Forrester of Corstorphine, by whom he had issue [2]
2 CONT * Father  Sir Herbert Maxwell, 1st Lord Maxwell of Caerlaverock,   d. Bef 14 Feb 1453-1454 
2 CONT * Mother   [Unknown] Herries,   b. Abt 1385, of, Terregles, Kirkcudbrightshire, Scotland 
2 CONT *'''Family 1   Janet Forrester
2 CONT *'''Married  Bef 4 Feb 1424-1425  [2] 
2 CONT *Children 
2 CONT **1. John Maxwell, 3rd Lord Maxwell,   d. 22 Jul 1484
2 CONT **2. Thomas Maxwell
2 CONT **3. David Maxwell,   d. Aft 22 Apr 1485
2 CONT **4. Robert Maxwell,   d. Aft 23 Jul 1468
2 CONT **5. Aymer Maxwell,   d. Aft 23 Sep 1473
2 CONT **6. Agnes Maxwell
2 CONT **7. Christian Maxwell
2 CONT *'''Family 2  [Unknown]
2 CONT *Children 
2 CONT **1. Mr. John Maxwell
2 CONT **2. Niccol Maxwell 
