2 CONT      Margaret Kennedy was born before 1485. She was the daughter of John Kennedy, 2nd Lord Kennedy and Lady Elizabeth Gordon. She married Patrick Vaux of Barnbarroch, son of Blaise Vaux of Barnbarroch and Elizabeth Shaw. She marri
2 CONC ed Andrew Stewart, 1st Lord Avandale, son of Alexander Stewart, before 4 February 1499/0. She died in 1542.
