1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Alexander-Kennedy-of-Bargany/6000000001213824977
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===ALEXANDER KENNEDY OF GIRVANMAINS===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Alexander Kennedy of Girvanmains is the son of John, Lord Kennedy, and his second wife  Elizabeth Gordon, daughter of George, Earl of Huntly and widow of Nicol, Earl of Erroll. [https://archive.org/stream/historicalaccoun1849co
2 CONC wa#page/n32/mode/1up Kennedy History: 27]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Death===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Alexander Kennedy of Girvanmains died before 1 February 1527. [https://archive.org/stream/scottishrecordso10scotuoft#page/143/mode/1up Protocol Book of Gavin Ros: 809]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the Protocol Book of Gavin Ros===
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1 April 1531: Instrument narrating that the procurator for Jonet Corry, relict of the late (Alexander Kennedy) of Girvanemanis, and noe spouse of Thomas Kennedy (of Knockreach), solemnly protested (apparently before the sheriff
2 CONC  of Ayr or his depute in reference to a decreet effecting the lands) that whatever was done or to be done before the sheriff this day or any other should not pejudice the said Jonet as to her conjunct infeftment of the lands of Gi
2 CONC rvanemanis, or any other lands of the late Alexander, her spouse. Done at M'ylvenistoun 1 April 1531. Witnesses, George Douglas, William Stewart and Bartholomew Craufued of Kerss. [https://archive.org/stream/scottishrecordso10scot
2 CONC uoft#page/205/mode/1up Protocol Book of Gavin Ros, N.P., 1512-1532, Edited by the Reverend John Anderson, Curator of the Historical Department, H.M. General Register House, and Francis J. Grant, W.S., (Scottish Record Society, Edi
2 CONC nburgh, 1908), protocol number 1138 on p. 205]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1 April 1531: Instrument narrating that Alexander Kennedy, in name of and on behalf of John Kennedy, son and heir of Hugh Kennedy of Girvanemanis, apparent, protested that whatever was done before the said Charles Campble, sher
2 CONC iff foresaid, in the apprising of the lands of Hugh Kennedy (as above) should not injure John K. concerning the lands of Girvanemanis. Same date and place as above. [https://archive.org/stream/scottishrecordso10scotuoft#page/205/m
2 CONC ode/1up Protocol Book of Gavin Ros, N.P., 1512-1532, Edited by the Reverend John Anderson, Curator of the Historical Department, H.M. General Register House, and Francis J. Grant, W.S., (Scottish Record Society, Edinburgh, 1908), 
2 CONC protocol number 1138 on p. 205]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogical Account===
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://archive.org/stream/historicalaccoun1849cowa#page/n32/mode/1up Historical Account of the Noble Family of Kennedy, Marquess of Ailsa and Earl of Cassillis, with Notices of Some of the Principal Cadets Thereof  (Edinburgh MD
2 CONC CCCXLIX), p. 27]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT from Scots Peerage 1
2 CONT
2 CONT >"Alexander Kennedy of Girvanmains, son of second marriage. He had from his father, on 31 July 1481, two charters of the lands of Girvanmains and Mackilevinstoun and others. He was also granted by his father on 11 March 1487-88, t
2 CONC he barony of Leswalt, confirmed by King James IV. 24 January 1488-89, and on 21 February 1499-1500 he had a charter to himself from James IV. of this barony, which he afterwards, on 30 March 1506, handed over to his eldest brother
2 CONC  David, who got a charter of them that day on Alexander's resignation."
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander married.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT # Sir Hew Kennedy of Girvanmains
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Pedigree 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.multiwords.de/genealogy/kennedy01.htm 
2 CONT
2 CONT *a.	John Kennedy, 2nd Lord b before 12.10.1454, d 1508: m1 before 25.03.1459 Elizabeth Montgomery dau of Alexander Montgomery, 1st Lord; m2 before 30.06.1471 Elizabeth Gordon d 17.04.1500, dau of Alexander Seton, 1st Earl Huntly
2 CONT **5	Alexander Kennedy, 1st of Girvan Mains or Girvanmains a 1481
2 CONT ***A	Hugh Kennedy, 2nd of Girvan Mains m by 1531 Janet Stewart b 1500, dau of John Stewart, 2nd Earl of Atholl 4 children identified in the Vans family site mentioned as a Main Source for 'Agnew01'.
2 CONT **** i	Gilbert Kennedy of Girvan Mains
2 CONT **** ii	Margaret Kennedy m Uchtred Macdowall, 12th of Garthland d 1593
2 CONT **** iii	Elizabeth Kennedy m Sir Patrick Vaus or Vans of Barnbarroch d 22.12.1597
2 CONT **** iv	Barbara Kennedy m mcrt 30.09.1554 Sir John Bellenden 
2 CONT **** v.	Helen Kennedy probably of this generation m by 22.04.1556 Laurence Bruce, 4th of Cultmalundy d 08.1617.
2 CONT *** partners unknown
2 CONT ***B+	other issue - Alexander a 1542, George a 1542
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # https://www.patrickspeople.scot/ourfamily/22001.htm cites 
2 CONT ## e-books, The Scots Peerage ed. Sir James Balfour Paul vol. 2 (1905).
