2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT
2 CONT When Lady Isabella Campbell of Loudoun was born in 1465, in Loudoun, Ayrshire, Scotland, her father, Sir George Campbell IV Sheriff of Ayr, was 16 and her mother, Catherine Kennedy, was 20. She married Sir Robert Erskine , 4th Lor
2 CONC d of Erskine in 1481, in Erskine, Renfrewshire, Scotland. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 4 daughters. She died on 14 December 1518, in Crawford, Lanarkshire, Scotland, United Kingdom, at the age of 53.
