2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Isabel, married to sir John Maxwell of Pollock,
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Margaret, married to John Kennedy of Blairquhan, Esq;.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, 2dly, lady Isabel Ruthven, daughter of William earl of Gowrie, widow of sir Robert Gordon of Lochinvar, by whom he had two daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.ÃÂÃÂ¢ÃÂÃÂÃÂÃÂ, married to sir William CunÃÂÃÂ¢ÃÂÃÂÃÂÃÂ£ninghame of Cunninghamhead.
2 CONT
