1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Margaret Boyd1 
2 CONT *F, #5222, d. after September 1453
2 CONT *http://www.thepeerage.com/p523.htm#i5222
2 CONT *Last Edited=29 Jun 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Boyd was the daughter of Sir Thomas Boyd, 5th of Kilmarnock.2 She married Alexander Montgomerie, 1st Lord Montgomerie, son of Sir John Montgomerie of Ardrossan and Agnes of the Isles.3 She died after September 1453.3. Her
2 CONC  married name became Montgomerie.3
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Margaret Boyd and Alexander Montgomerie, 1st Lord Montgomerie
2 CONT *Margaret Montgomerie+ 1 
2 CONT *Alexander Montgomerie, Master of Montgomerie+ d. 14521 
2 CONT *Elizabeth Montgomerie+ 1 
2 CONT *George Montgomerie 1 
2 CONT *Reverend Thomas Montgomerie 1 
2 CONT *Agnes Montgomerie 1 
2 CONT *Margaret Montgomerie 1 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alexander_Montgomerie,_1st_Lord_Montgomerie
2 CONT
2 CONT With his wife Margaret, Montgomerie had three or four sons and three daughters:[2]
2 CONT * Alexander, master of Montgomerie and father of Hugh Montgomerie, 1st Earl of Eglinton;
2 CONT * George, ancestor of the Montgomeries of Skelmorlie;
2 CONT * Thomas, parson of Eaglesham, and rector of the university of Glasgow;
2 CONT * John of Giffen (doubtful);
2 CONT * Margaret, married to John Stewart, 1st Earl of Lennox;
2 CONT * Elizabeth, to John Kennedy, 2nd Lord Kennedy; and
2 CONT * Agnes, to William Cunningham of Glengarnock
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Margaret, death after 16 Sep 1453, daughter of Sir Thomas Boyd of Kilmarnock. [Magna Charta Sureties]
2 CONT
2 CONT He [Alexander Montgomerie] married Margaret, sister of Robert, 1st LORD BOYD [SCT], and 2nd daughter of Sir Thomas BOYD, of Kilmarnock. She was living 16 September 1453. He was living 1469, but died apparently in 1470. [Complete P
2 CONC eerage IX:134-5, (transcribed by Dave Utzinger)]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Margaret, second daughter of Sir Thomas Boyd of Kilmarnock, who was the father of the first Lord Boyd, Montgomerie and had three (maybe four) sons and three dauthters
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Margaret Boyd married Alexander, 1st Lord Montgomerie. Had a son Alexander Montgomery, 3rd Lord Montgomery.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
