2 CONT *'''Name	Alexander Montgomerie, Lord Montgomerie  [1] 
2 CONT *'''Born	Bef 1413 	of, Ardrossan, Ayrshire, Scotland  [2] 
2 CONT *'''Died	Abt 1470  [3] 
2 CONT *Father	Sir John Montgomerie,   b. of, Ardrossan, Ayrshire, Scotland  d. Bef 22 Nov 1429, , , England 
2 CONT *Mother	Agnes of the Isles,   d. Bef Mar 1413-1414 
2 CONT *'''Family 	Margaret Boyd,   b. Abt 1409, of, Kilmarnock, Ayrshire, Scotland   d. Aft 16 Sep 1453  (Age ~ 44 years) 
2 CONT *Children 	
2 CONT ** 	1. Alexander Montgomerie, "Master of Montgomerie",   b. Abt 1426, of, Ardrossan, Ayrshire, Scotland   d. 1452  (Age ~ 26 years)
2 CONT ** 	2. George Montgomerie,   b. of, Skelmorlie, Largs, Ayrshire, Scotland   d. 1505
2 CONT ** 	3. Thomas Montgomerie
2 CONT ** 	4. Margaret Montgomerie,   b. of, Ardrossan, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT ** 	5. Elizabeth Montgomerie
2 CONT ** 	6. Agnes Montgomerie
2 CONT *Sources 	
2 CONT *[S3] #21 The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extinct, or Dormant (1910), Cokayne, George Edward (main author) and Vicary Gibbs (added author), (New edition. 13 volumes
2 CONC  in 14. London: St. Catherine Press,1910-), vol. 1 p. 199; vol. 3 p. 74; vol. 14 p. 339 [GLENCAIRN] (Reliability: 3).
2 CONT *[S4] #230 [5th edition, 1999] The Magna Charta Sureties, 1215 (5th edition, 1999), Adams, Arthur, (5th edition. Baltimore: Genealogical Publishing, 1999), FHL book 973 D2aa 1999., p. 16 line 15A:10 (Reliability: 3).
