1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===SIR ADAM HEPBURN OF HAILES===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir Adam Hepburn of Hailes was granted a papal dispensation for his marriage to Janet Borthwick on 2 November 1411. [https://archive.org/details/genealogicalnote00hepb/page/n49/mode/1up Genealogical Notes: 23] According to Stir
2 CONC net, she was the daughter of Sir William Borthwick. [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/hh4bz/hepburn1.php Stirnet: Hepburn]'''
