2 CONT '''Patrick Hepburn, Lord Hailes, here treated, is the eldest son of https://www.geni.com/people/Adam-Hepburn-Master-of-Hailes-Sherriff-of-Bertwickswhire/6000000001580934837?through=6000000002187896120 The name of his mother has no
2 CONC t been satisfactorily identified. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun02paul/page/141/mode/1up The Scots Peerage II: 141]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Patrick Hepburn, Lord Hailies, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Ellen-Wallace/6000000007606332264?through=6000000002187896120 [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/187/mode/1up The Scots Peer
2 CONC age II: 187] Wikipedia claims that she was the daughter of Thomas Wallace of Auchinbothy, but this proposition is not supported by authentic evidence. [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Patrick_Hepburn,_1st_Lord_Hailes Wikipedia]
2 CONT
