2 CONT      Agnes Colquhoun was the daughter of Humphrey Colquhoun, 12th of Luss and Helen Erskine.1 She married, secondly, John Somerville, 3rd Lord Somerville, son of William Somerville, Master of Somerville and Marjorie Montgomerie. S
2 CONC he married, firstly, James Galbraith, 7th of Culreuch, son of Andrew Galbraith, 5th of Culreuch.1 She died after 1528.2
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her married name became Somerville.1 Her married name became Galbraith.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Agnes Colquhoun and James Galbraith, 7th of Culreuch
2 CONT
