2 CONT *Last Edited=19 Mar 2008
2 CONT *'''     Marion Bruce is the daughter of Sir David Bruce of Clackmannan and Janet Blackadder.1,2 She married, firstly, Robert Bruce of Airth, son of Sir Robert Bruce of Airth and Eupheme Montgomerie.1 She married, secondly, Marcus
2 CONC  Sinclair of Carberry.2
2 CONT *'''     She was also known as Mariot.2 Her married name became Bruce.1 Her married name became Sinclair.2
