1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == ROBERT BRUCE OF BALDRIG ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''The Question of Identity'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''According to Stirnet, Robert Bruce of Baldrig, here treated, is the son of https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Bruce-of-Airth/6000000002006454467?through=6000000199157960835 and his first wife https://www.geni.com/pe
2 CONC ople/Janet-Forrester/6000000002006030997 [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/bb4fz/bruce08.php Stirnet: Bruce 08] This is wrong. Robert Bruce of Baldrig, here treated, is the son of https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Bruce
2 CONC -of-Airth/6000000002006454467?through=6000000199157960835 and his second wife https://www.geni.com/people/Marion-Bruce/6000000193466079848?through=6000000199157960835 [NRS: GD37/71]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert Bruce of Baldrig, here treated, is noticed as the brother of 
2 CONT
2 CONT on 6 March 1581-82. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD37%2f71&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=baldrig&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1550&dt=1600&di=n NRS: GD37/71]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == His Mother's Last Will and Testament ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marion Bruce, Lady Airth, the wife of Magnus Sinclair of Kynninmonth, made her last will and testament on 18 June 1575. It was made in the Burgh of Dysart in Fife. She nominated and constituted her husband https://www.geni.com/
2 CONC people/Magnus-Sinclair-of-Kynninmonth/6000000193466545830?through=6000000193466079848 and her second son https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Bruce-of-Baldrig/6000000199157960835 to be her only executors and intromitters with her wh
2 CONC ole goods and gear. Confirmation was granted to the executors on 11 August 1575. [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Commissary Court, The Testament Testamentar and Inventory of Marioun Bruce, Lady Airth, sometime spouse to M
2 CONC agnus Sinclair in Kynninmonth, reference CC8/8/3]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000199242855821 Image of Testament]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000199236313866 Image of Testament]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000199236236845 Image of Testament]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000199236432821 Image of Testament]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''6 March 1581-82: Instrument of Redemption by Robert Bruce of Baldrig, brother to Sir Alexander Bruce of Airth, kt., to the said Sir Alexander, of an annualrent of 300 merks furth of the lands of Stanehous, Crawnestis and Inches
2 CONC , in the baronie of Harbertachyre on payment of 3000 merks by Mr. Robert Bruce, son of the said Sir Alexander, acting as his procurator. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD37%2f71&st=1
2 CONC &tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=baldrig&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1550&dt=1600&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Bruce family of Airth, reference GD37/71]'''
