1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JOHN MAXWELL OF POLLOCK===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Maxwell of Pollock is the eldest son of John Maxwell of Pollock and his wife Elizabeth Stewart. He succeeded his father in about 1510. [https://archive.org/stream/memoirsofmaxwev100fras#page/23/mode/1up Pollock Memoirs, p.
2 CONC  23]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Death===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Maxwell of Pollock died in May 1517. [https://archive.org/stream/memoirsofmaxwev100fras#page/23/mode/1up Pollock Memoirs, p. 23]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Maxwell of Pollock married Margaret Blair. [https://archive.org/stream/memoirsofmaxwev100fras#page/23/mode/1up Pollock Memoirs, p. 23]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-John-Maxwell-of-Pollok-10th-of-Pollok/6000000005940222784?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1517916196171&through=6000000056444053984
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Maxwell/6000000056443972987?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1517916277463&through=6000000056444053984
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Katherine-Maxwell/6000000056444383872?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1517916396319&through=6000000056444053984
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir John Maxwell of Pollock</strong>, eldest son of Sir John, succeeded his father in the lands and baronies of Nether Pollock, Murray, Herdhouse, Carnwardoch, and many others...
2 CONT
2 CONT ...In the year 1400, this Sir John and his brother Sir Robert, entered into a mutual indenture and entail, whereby it was provided, that in case of failure of heirs-male of either of these bodies, that their estate should devolve 
2 CONC upon the surviving heirs-male of the other...
2 CONT
2 CONT ...Sir John died in the reign of king James I. and left issue a son."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~battle/baronage/page451.html The Baronage of Scotland], Robert Douglas, 1798, page 421
