2 CONT # Robertson, George, "A Genealogical Account of the Principal Families in Ayrshire, More Particulary in Cunninghame", Irvine: Cunninghame Press, 1823, Archive.org, p. 310
2 CONT # Paterson, James, "History of the County of Ayr: With a Genealogical Account of the Families of Ayrshire", Edinburgh: John Dick, 1852, Vol. II, Archive.org, p. 119 <[https://archive.org/details/historyofcountyo02pateuoft/page/118
2 CONC /mode/1up?view=theater&q=glengarnock Archive.Org]>
2 CONT # Marshall, David. "Genealogical Notes anent some Ancient Scottish Families', Perth: J.V. Nicoll, 1884, Archive.org, p. 101, p. 108
2 CONT #  "Cuningham," Edited by J. S. Dabie. p. 174.
2 CONT # Reg. Mag. Sigilli, Edmonstone's "Family of Edmonstone of Duntreath."
