1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Children of Alexander Schaw and Elizabeth Cunningham include
2 CONT
2 CONT *ii. John Schaw was born ABT 1542 in Sauchie, Clackmannshire, Scotland, and died ABT 1593 in Greenock, Renfrewshire, Scotland.
2 CONT *iii. Janet Schaw was born ABT 1545 in Sauchie, Clackmannshire, Scotland, and died FEB 1573. (Died unmarried)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT 1 - Elizabeth, married to Alexander Schaw of Sauchie, who died before 1547. ("History of the County of Ayr with a Genealogical Account of the families of Ayrshire' by James Paterson") [http://archiver.rootsweb.ancestry.com/th/read
2 CONC /GEN-MEDIEVAL/1999-01/0917230664]
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 - Burke's Peerage calls him John Schaw of Greenock. She married 2ndly before 1555 David Cuninghame of Robertland (b. after 1536 d. before 1 Dec 1592), elder son of David Cuninghame of Robertland and Margaret Cuninghame of Craige
2 CONC nds (who married 1stly John Colquhoun).
