2 CONT * [http://archiver.rootsweb.ancestry.com/th/read/GEN-MEDIEVAL/1999-01/0915844019 Cunningham of Glengarnock] updated 1999
2 CONT * http://www.cracroftspeerage.co.uk/online/content/index1707.htm#FLEMING_1451_2
