1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == JOHN BLAIR younger of that Ilk ==
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Death
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Blair, younger of that Ilk,''' died intestate in January 1604.  [National Records of Scotland, Glasgow Commissary Court, Testament Dative & Inventory of Johne Blair, younger, of that Ilk, reference CC9/7/5]
2 CONT
2 CONT ====His Testament Dative
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Isabel Boyd''' gave up her deceased husband's testament dative in name and behalf of their four daughters, Grissell, Issobell, Agnas and Margaret Blair. Confirmation was granted to her on 3 July 1608. [National Records of Scotl
2 CONC and, Glasgow Commissary Court, Testament Dative & Inventory of Johne Blair, younger, of that Ilk, reference CC9/7/5]
2 CONT
