1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Blair-474
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna (or Ann), born circa 1575 probably in Blair, Ayrshire, Scotland, was a daughter of John Blair of that Ilk[1] and Grizell Sempill,[2][3] a daughter of Robert, 3rd Lord Semple,
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna married John Brisbane of Bishoptoun on 24 Dec1595.[4][5][6][1] They had issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT # John, heir, m. bef. 1635 to Jean Chalmers, d. aft. 1649[1][4]
2 CONT # Robert, m. 1635 to Elizabeth, daughter of Sir Thomas Lyon, of Auldbar[1][4]
2 CONT # Janet, m. 1611 to Fleming of Baghall.[1][4]
2 CONT # Grissel, m. 1623 to Walter Denieston, of Calgrain[4]
2 CONT # Elizabeth, m. James Shaw of Bailliegelli in Ireland [1][4]  [sic: Isabella] 
2 CONT # Sarah, m. Sir William Mure, of Rowallan[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann passed away 8 March 1608.[5][6] and the will probated 2 Feb 1609.[7]
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann's husband John, after her death, married a second Sempill descendant, Jean, daughter of the 4th Lord Sempill.[8]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
