2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''25 November 1591: Instrument of sasine propriis manibus by John Craufurd of Kylbirny to Margaret Blair, his spouse, [daughter of John Blair of that ilk], in liferent, of the lands of Manes, Holmeheid, Hoill and Aix, Tannox and 
2 CONC Mosend, Boig, Balgra, Bighill, Brokliehill, Broklie Newlandis, Medowsyd, Knokistoun and Myln of Kylburny in the barony thereof and bailiary of Cuningham. (Tenants detailed). (With charter dated 3 March 1592). [http://catalogue.nrs
2 CONC cotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD20%2f1%2f437&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=margaret+blair&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1650&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Earls of Glasgow (Crawford Priory), refere
2 CONC nce GD20/1/437]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''21 January 1598: Charter by John Craufurd of Kilbirnie to Margaret Blair, his spouse, in liferent, of the 23/4d lands of Guleland with the house etc of Kilbirnie, all in satisfaction of her terce from the fifty merklands of Kil
2 CONC birnie. [Tag]. (With instrument of sasine propriis manibus, dated 29 April 1598). [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD20%2f1%2f440&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=margaret+blair&ko=p&r=&ro=s&
2 CONC df=&dt=1650&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Earls of Glasgow (Crawford Priory), reference  GD20/1/440]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''15 March 1599: Charter by John Craufurde of Kilbirny to Margaret Blair, his spouse, in liferent, of the lands of Nedermanis and Overmanis of Kilbirny, Balgray, Seirislie and Park of Kilbirny, being parts of the fifty merklands 
2 CONC thereof in the parish thereof, and twenty merklands of Eister Grenok in the barony of Renfrew. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD20%2f1%2f441&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=margaret+blair&
2 CONC ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1650&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Earls of Glasgow (Crawford Priory), reference  GD20/1/441]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     4
2 CONT
2 CONT '''15 June 1603: Extract contract by which John Craufurde of Auchincloyche and Jean Sempill, his spouse, dispone to John Blair of that ilk and Margaret Blair, his daughter, on behalf of John Craufurde of Kilbirny, spouse of said M
2 CONC argaret, 22 merklands of Hoilhous and Auchincloych in the barony of Kilbirny. Registered B of C and S, 24 February 1604. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD20%2f1%2f445&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&t
