1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===MASTER JAMES CUNNINGHAM OF MONTGREENAN===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Cunningham died before 14 October 1648. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD138%2f1%2f299&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=montgrenan&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1650&di=n NRS: GD138/1/299]''
2 CONC '  
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the National Records of Scotland===
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''28 July 1592: Instrument of Seisin in favour of James Cunningham (son of late Alexander commendator of Kilwinning) (See GD39/1/121) in (the 8 merk land of Shaw) the 4 merk land of Bowieston and 5 merk land of Lambrochton, proce
2 CONC eding on a precept of clare constat by James Earl of Glencairn to the said James Cunningham as heir of Jean Cunningham his sister, daughter of Alexander commendator of Kilwinning. Witnesses to the precept, John Cunningham of Ross,
2 CONC  brother german of the Earl, Hugh Glen of Linthill and Robert Cunningham servitor to the Earl, dated at Finlayston 23 July 1592 (23 July 1592 was the last day of 25th Jas. VI. Do. 25 Jas. VI., 28 July 1592 was in 26 Jas) [http://c
2 CONC atalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD39%2f1%2f132&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=montgrenan&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1650&di=n National Records of Scotland, Earls of Glencairn, reference GD39/1/132]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                    2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''20 June 1614: Charter by which James VI, King of Scots, confirms that he has made a new grant of the ten merk lands of of old extent of Montgrennan to Master James Cunningham of Montgrennan and his wife Mariote Douglas, and to 
2 CONC Alexander Cunningham, their lawful eldest son. Master James and his wife Mariote are to hold in conjuct fee and liferent and the land is to descent to Alexander and his lawful male heirs, whom failing to the heirs and assigness of
2 CONC  Master James. The charter was confirmed under the Great Seal of Scotland on 23 August 1615. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi07scot/page/480 Registrum Magni Sigilli Regum Scotorum. The Register of the Great Seal of Sc
2 CONC otland, A.D. 1609-1620, charter number 1318 on pp. 480-81]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''9 January 1624: (1104) ALEXANDER CUNYNGHAME filius legitimus Magistri Jacobi Cunynghame de Montgrennan, haeres Jeannae Blair, aviae. viii. 241. [https://books.google.co.uk/books?id=PiVDAAAAcAAJ&pg=PR17&lpg=PR17&dq=Nether+Carmyl
2 CONC e&source=bl&ots=qkxdEQg71e&sig=HyjCNPSI5Zn-R82Uv3MfsmcM1os&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwivnPu529DTAhWlKsAKHeowAM0Q6AEIRDAG#v=onepage&q=montgrennan&f=false Inquisitionum Ad Capellam Domini Regis Retornatarum ets. II: Inquisitiones General
2 CONC es]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     4
2 CONT
