2 CONC rsion of the 16 merkland of Powtoun. At Paisley. wit:- Robert Alexander writer in Paisley, James Alexander his son and John Whyte notary burgess of Paisley. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?refer
