1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == ROBERT COLVILLE OF HILTOUN (Afterwards ROBERT COLVILLE OF OCHILTREE) ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert Colville of Hiltoun, here treated: "who was appointed Director of Chancery on 17 June 1488, an office he no doubt owed to his father's influence. He held a number of lands from the Crown in tenancy, as may be seen from t
2 CONC he rentals, which lands were afterwards contained in his barony of Tilliecultrie. On 13 March 1503-4 he had a charter to himself and his wife of the lands of Hiltoun in Clackmannan, which had belonged to his father, and on which b
2 CONC oth had bestowed much expense, and on 14 February 1504-5 he received the lands of Cleish in Fife. In 1509 (10 and 30 April) he received from Elizabeth Colville of Ochiltree and her husband, her half of Ochiltree and Oxnam, but no 
2 CONC relationship between the parties is stated in the charters, and he probably purchased the lands. He sold Oxnam on 5 May to Andrew Ker of Fernyhirst, and is afterwards designed of Ochiltree. In 1511 he had a grant of the barony of 
2 CONC Tillicultrie. He was killed at Flodden d September 1513. He married Elizabeth Arnot, said to be daughter of Walter Arnot of Balbarton. She died before 31 January 1527-28. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun02pauluoft/sco
2 CONC tspeeragefoun02pauluoft/page/544/mode/1up The Scots Peerage II: 544-5]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''16 October 1483: Charter by which James III, King of Scots, confirms, at the special request of his consort Queen Margaret, that he has given the lands of Hiltoun in the barony of Tillicoultry to Robert Colville and his wife Ma
2 CONC rgaret Logan. Robert and Margaret already held Hiltoun on a nineteen year lease.[https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi02scot#page/329/mode/1up RMS 1424-1513, charter number 1568]'''
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''13 April 1504: [https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi02scot#page/591/mode/1up RMS 1424-1513: charter number 2784]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''15 February 1504-05: [https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi02scot#page/599/mode/1up RMS 1424-1513, charter number 2820]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     4
2 CONT
2 CONT '''5 January 1506: [https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi02scot#page/644/mode/1up RMS 1424-1513: charter number 3022]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     5
2 CONT
2 CONT '''21 August 1513: [https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi02scot#page/847/mode/1up RMS 1424-1513: charter number 3881]'''
2 CONT
