2 CONC  of that kingdom. Edited by Sir James Balfour Paul, Lord Lyon King of Arms. Volume II. (David Douglas, Edinburgh, 1905), 602 pp.]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/stream/originalletterso00bann#page/n6/mode/1up Original Letters of Mr John Colville 1582-1603 to which is added his Palinode, 1600, with a Memoir of the Author (Bannatyne Club, Edinburgh, M.DCCC.LVIII.), 
2 CONC 407 pp. including indexes]'''
