2 CONT == [http://thepeerage.com/p18380.htm#i183797 Biographical Summary by Darryl Lundy's Peerage]==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Robert Crawford was born circa 1482.He married Margaret Semple. He died in 1513. He was the son of Malcolm Crawford and Marion Crichton. Child of Robert Crawford and Margaret Semple: Laurence Crawford, b. c 1506, d. 4 Jun 1547]
2 CONC '''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Unattributed Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir Robert Crawford received charter in 1506 for lands of Eastern  Greenock. Dispensation from James Beaton, Abbot of Dumfermling.'''
