0 @N6000000000604982184@ NOTE George Douglas, Master of Angus1 (M) b. circa 1469, d. 9 September 1513, #109562d. 9 Sep 1513|p10957.htm#i109562|Archibald Douglas, 5th Earl of Angus|b. c 1453d. bt 29 Nov 1513 - 31 Jan 1514|p10956.htm#i109559|Elizabeth Boyd|b. b 
1 CONC 1458d. b 21 Feb 1497|p10956.htm#i109560|George Douglas, 4th Earl of Angus|b. b 1429d. 14 Nov 1462|p10956.htm#i109554|Isabel Sibbald|b. b 1436d. bt 1500 - Feb 1503|p10956.htm#i109555|Robert Boyd, 1st Lord Boyd of Kilmarnock|b. b 14
1 CONC 39d. 1470|p481.htm#i4808|Mariot Maxwell|b. b 1437|p10957.htm#i109561|');"Pedigree <JavaScript:pup('George Douglas, Master of Angus|b. c 1469<BR> Last Edited=22 Aug 2003
1 CONT George Douglas, Master of Angus was the son of Archibald Douglas, 5th Earl of Angus <p10956.htm> and Elizabeth Boyd <p10956.htm>.1 He was born circa 1469.1 He married Elizabeth Drummond, daughter of John Drummond, 1st Lord Drummon
1 CONC d <p10832.htm> and Elizabeth Lindsay <p481.htm>, between July 1485 and 31 January 1489.1 He died on 9 September 1513 at Flodden, killed in action.1  He was styled as Master of Angus between 1470 and 1513.1 He fought in the Battle 
1 CONC of Flodden on 9 September 1513.1
1 CONT Children of George Douglas, Master of Angus and Elizabeth Drummond:
1 CONT Archibald Douglas, 6th Earl of Angus <p10149.htm>+ b. c 1490, d. Jan 1556/57 Elizabeth Douglas <p10833.htm> b. b 1494 Alison Douglas <p10963.htm> b. b 1496 Margaret Douglas <p10964.htm>+ b. b 1498 Sir George Douglas <p10958.htm>+ 
