0 @N6000000003043431072@ NOTE John Blair V (15..-c. 1570) of that Ilk obtained the lands of Tunnybandhead, Blair and Ardhoch in 1546 upon the resignation of his rather.  This seems to have been in consequence of his marriage about that time to Margaret, daught
