0 @N6000000001783474443@ NOTE John Lyon, 6th Baron of Glamis, born abt 1491 at Glamis, died April 8th, 1528 at Leith. He married Janet Douglas, born abt 1495 at Angus. She married, firstly, John Lyon, 6th Lord Glamis, son of John Lyon, 4th Lord
1 CONT Glamis and Elizabeth Gray , before 12 December 1527. She married, secondly, Archibald Campbell, son of Archibald Campbell, 2nd Earl of Argyll and Elizabeth Stuart , after 1528. She died on 17 July 1537 in
1 CONT Castle Hill, Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland , burned at the stake for threatening the life of King James V with sorcery. From after 1528, her married name became Campbell. They had John Lyon, 7th baron of Glamis, Elizabeth, Marga
1 CONC ret and George.
1 CONT
1 CONT LeAnn
0 @N6000000001877513169@ NOTE 7th Lord Glamis
0 @N6000000001783474475@ NOTE John Lyon, 7th Baron of Glamis. born between 1510-1515 in Ryslippe, Middlesex, England and died in 1558 or before Sept 18th, 1559. He was imprisoned and sentenced to be executed, but was respited until he
1 CONT should attain majority, in the interim, he was ordered to be closely confined and his estates declared forfeited. On the death of King James V, he was released and restored to his estates and honors by Parliament,
1 CONT 15 March 1542/3. He married Janet Keith Lyon between Feb 6th, 1543 - 1544. They had ( at least ) John Lyon, the 8th Baron of Glamis, Margaret and Sir Thomas Lyon.
1 CONT
1 CONT LeAnn
