1 CONT      Archibald Campbell, Master of Campbell was born before 1406. He was the son of Sir Duncan Campbell, 1st Lord Campbell and Lady Marjorie Stewart.1 He married, firstly, Elizabeth Somerville, daughter of John Somerville, 2nd Lor
1 CONC d Somerville.1 He married, secondly, unknown Stewart, daughter of Murdoch Stewart, 2nd Duke of Albany, before 1440.2 He died between August 1431 and March 1440.1,3 
1 CONT      Archibald Campbell, Master of Campbell was also known as Gillespic.2 He was styled as Master of Campbell.4 He was also known as Celestine.1 He lived in Lochow, Argyllshire, Scotland.4 
1 CONT
