0 @N6000000002188028754@ NOTE John Kennedy, 2nd Lord Kennedy
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT John Kennedy, PC, 2nd Lord Kennedy (b. bef. 12 October 1454, d. between 24 July 1508 and 13 May 1509) was a Scottish lord, the son of Gilbert Kennedy, 1st Lord Kennedy.
1 CONT
1 CONT He married (1) Elizabeth Montgomerie, daughter of Alexander Montgomerie, 1st Lord Montgomerie, before 25 March 1460. They had one child:
1 CONT
1 CONT David Kennedy, 1st Earl of Cassillis (b. bef. 1478-1513) 
1 CONT He married (2) Lady Elizabeth Seton, daughter of Alexander Gordon, 1st Earl of Huntly, between 24 August 1467 and 12 August 1471. They had two children:
1 CONT
1 CONT Janet Kennedy (b. bef. 1483-1543) 
1 CONT Margaret Kennedy (b. bef.1485-1542) 
1 CONT He married (3) Elizabeth Kennedy after 1500.
1 CONT
1 CONT He succeeded to the title of 2nd Lord Kennedy c.1480.
1 CONT
1 CONT Peerage of Scotland 
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT Gilbert Kennedy Lord Kennedy
1 CONT c.1480–1508 Succeeded by:
1 CONT David Kennedy 
