0 @N6000000002187894300@ NOTE James Hamilton, 1st Earl of Arran
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT James Hamilton, 1st Earl of Arran, (c.1475–1529) was a Scottish politician.
1 CONT
1 CONT He was a son of the 1st Lord Hamilton and Princess Mary Stewart of Scotland. Mary was a daughter of King James II and his Queen consort Mary of Gueldres. She was also a sister of King James III.
1 CONT
1 CONT James succeeded to his father's lordship in 1479, and was made a Scottish Privy Counsellor by his first cousin King James IV, whose marriage with Margaret Tudor he negotiated in 1503. In the same year Lord Hamilton was created Ear
1 CONC l of Arran for his skill in tournament.
1 CONT
1 CONT He was appointed Lieutenant General of Scotland and helped to reduce the Western Isles in 1504 and to re-establish John of Denmark. Hamilton was detained in the Kingdom of England by Henry VII after a diplomatic mission to the cou
1 CONC rt of Louis XII of France in 1507.
1 CONT
1 CONT During the minority of King James V he opposed Archibald Douglas, 6th Earl of Angus and the English party. He plotted against the Regent John Stewart, 2nd Duke of Albany. He was president of the council of regency during Albany's 
1 CONC absence in France from 1517 to 1520.
1 CONT
1 CONT He was defeated in an attempt to overpower Angus in the streets of Edinburgh in 1520, a riot known as "Cleanse the Causeway". He was again a member of the council of regency in 1522 and Lieutenant of the South. He joined the Queen
1 CONC  Dowager Margaret Tudor in ousting Albany and proclaiming James V in 1524.
1 CONT
1 CONT Hamilton was compelled by King Henry VIII to readmit Angus to the council. He supported Angus against John Stewart, 3rd Earl of Lennox in 1526, but on the escape of James V from the Douglases, Hamilton received Bothwell from Angus
1 CONC 's forfeited estates.
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT New Creation Earl of Arran
1 CONT 1503–1529 Succeeded by:
1 CONT James Hamilton
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT James Hamilton Lord Hamilton
1 CONT ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1 CONT James Hamilton, 1st Earl of Arran (M)
1 CONT b. circa 1475, d. between 26 March 1529 and 21 July 1529, #102118
1 CONT Pedigree
1 CONT Last Edited=26 Feb 2004
1 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.1%
1 CONT
1 CONT      James Hamilton, 1st Earl of Arran was born circa 1475.1 He was the son of James Hamilton, 1st Lord Hamilton and Mary Stewart, Princess of Scotland. He married, firstly, Elizabeth Home, daughter of Alexander Home, 2nd Lord Hom
1 CONC e and Nichola Ker, before 28 April 1490.2 He and Elizabeth Home were divorced on 16 November 1504 on the grounds that her first husband, Thomas Hay, previously thought dead, was in fact still alive at the time of her marriage to J
1 CONC ames.2 He married, secondly, Janet Beaton, daughter of Sir David Beaton, between 11 November 1516 and 23 November 1516.2 He died between 26 March 1529 and 21 July 1529 in Kinneil, Scotland.2
1 CONT      James Hamilton, 1st Earl of Arran succeeded to the title of 2nd Lord Hamilton [I., 1617] on 6 November 1479.1 He fought in the naval expedition by Denmark against Sweden in 1502.3 He was invested as a Privy Counsellor (P.C.) 
1 CONC [Scotland] in 1503.3 He was created 1st Earl of Arran [Scotland] on 11 August 1503.3 He was commanded of the a Scottish fleet against England, but accomplished nothing in 1513.3 He held the office of a Lord of Regency [Scotland] i
1 CONC n 1517.3 He fought in the Battle of Linlithgow on 4 September 1526,, where he commanded the army for the King against Lennox.3
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Child of James Hamilton, 1st Earl of Arran
1 CONT     Elizabeth Hamilton b. bt 1491 - 15284
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Children of James Hamilton, 1st Earl of Arran and Beatrix Drummond
1 CONT     Margaret Hamilton+ b. b 1505
1 CONT     Sir John Hamilton+ b. b 15125
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Children of James Hamilton, 1st Earl of Arran and Janet Beaton
1 CONT     Lady Helen Hamilton+ b. b 15136
1 CONT     James Hamilton, 2nd Earl of Arran+ b. 1515, d. 22 Jan 1574/75
1 CONT
