1 CONC created 20 July, 1565, nine days before his nuptials with Mary, Queen of Scots. The next [Duke of Albany] was Charles Stewart, 2nd son of King James VI, who was, at his babtism, 23 December, 1600, created Duke of Albany, Marquess 
