0 @N6000000002187896127@ NOTE Patrick Hepburn
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Sir Patrick Hepburn (d. 1483) lived in the fifteenth century and had estates in Lanarkshire and Berwickshire. He was the feudal lord of Hailes.
1 CONT
1 CONT His grandson Patrick (who would become the first Earl of Bothwell) succeeded him as Lord of Hailes, as his eldest son Adam predeceased him. Another of his sons, John established Saint Leonards College in Saint Andrews.
